      "updated": 1782684974781,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JS is a High level language , single threaded , synchdrounous , interpreted , scrpting kind of langaige jo basically helps in \n\nmaking full stack web apps . JS is introduced by BRENDEN EICH eariler it is named as MOCHA . \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JS is a High level language , single threaded , synchdrounous , interpreted , scrpting kind of langaige jo basically helps in \n\nmaking full stack web apps . JS is introduced by BRENDEN EICH eariler it is named as MOCHA . \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jgVukJUUU-EgQ9j2u4UOw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 717.7993603771869,
      "y": 469.03457758296344,
      "width": 1217.899169921875,
      "height": 950,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1547847727,
      "version": 1571,
      "versionNonce": 923072001,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782685630016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. High level language : matalb iss langaugae mei ham human readable langage use krte hai ie ENGLISH , bss usi langiage mei \n\ntabhi isko kehte hai HLL\n\n\n2. Schronous : JS is a syync langauge it means jab tak pehela ka kaam jo bhi call stack / loop mei aya hai jab tak woh katam\nnai hoga next KAAM shuru nai hoga \n\nfir bhi JS handles ASYNC task woh baad mei karege \n\n\n3. Single Threaded langauge : JS is a STL  iska matalb by birth js single thread based platform hai . \n\nThread = it is a part of execution \n\nOne thread = one task at a time , Fir bhi it can handle strong heavy async tasks .\n\nLater on we cover this things in async wait PROMISES \n\n\n4. Interpreted : IT means kaha par code line by line execute ho raha hai ,\n\njitni bar req hogi uti barr woh line by line execute kargega kaam , but i can say taht JS is not only interpreted lagauage \n\nit is IL + Compiled langauge [mix of both langauge] \n\n\nso JS is a JIT based language : JUST IN time langauge \n\n\n\n5. scriptng lanagua : it means ke JS is understandable by the browser directly no need to convert it into like HIgh level to \n\nMachine level language .\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. High level language : matalb iss langaugae mei ham human readable langage use krte hai ie ENGLISH , bss usi langiage mei \n\ntabhi isko kehte hai HLL\n\n\n2. Schronous : JS is a syync langauge it means jab tak pehela ka kaam jo bhi call stack / loop mei aya hai jab tak woh katam\nnai hoga next KAAM shuru nai hoga \n\nfir bhi JS handles ASYNC task woh baad mei karege \n\n\n3. Single Threaded langauge : JS is a STL  iska matalb by birth js single thread based platform hai . \n\nThread = it is a part of execution \n\nOne thread = one task at a time , Fir bhi it can handle strong heavy async tasks .\n\nLater on we cover this things in async wait PROMISES \n\n\n4. Interpreted : IT means kaha par code line by line execute ho raha hai ,\n\njitni bar req hogi uti barr woh line by line execute kargega kaam , but i can say taht JS is not only interpreted lagauage \n\nit is IL + Compiled langauge [mix of both langauge] \n\n\nso JS is a JIT based language : JUST IN time langauge \n\n\n\n5. scriptng lanagua : it means ke JS is understandable by the browser directly no need to convert it into like HIgh level to \n\nMachine level language .\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
