      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "abb problem samjao jara :\n\n1. Jab Internet and HTML AND CSS se webpages bananae lag  gye toh problem arises ke user siraf info gather kar raha hai \n \nkoi interaction nai kar pa rhaa hai  , jisse user ki abilty to search and Interact with website reduces a lot , User EXP bhi \n\nkharab ho raha tha\n\n\nthen JS is introduced : user webpage se interaction kar paye taaki uska EXP increase ho sake \n\nJs helps the user to control the website by therir own marnas you can get answr as per yout request .\n\n\n\nJS ane se jo website hai uhme jaan a gyi hai ke hamara bhi kuch ho akta hai abbb \n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "abb problem samjao jara :\n\n1. Jab Internet and HTML AND CSS se webpages bananae lag  gye toh problem arises ke user siraf info gather kar raha hai \n \nkoi interaction nai kar pa rhaa hai  , jisse user ki abilty to search and Interact with website reduces a lot , User EXP bhi \n\nkharab ho raha tha\n\n\nthen JS is introduced : user webpage se interaction kar paye taaki uska EXP increase ho sake \n\nJs helps the user to control the website by therir own marnas you can get answr as per yout request .\n\n\n\nJS ane se jo website hai uhme jaan a gyi hai ke hamara bhi kuch ho akta hai abbb \n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
