      "seed": 1033714881,
      "version": 1824,
      "versionNonce": 1974947375,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782688090527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Echma Scrippt :\n\n\nStory samjo iski abab poori hai kya yeh cheez ::\n\n1. Ab mai appko iska real matalb samjhata hu ke yeh cheez exixts hi kyo karti hai \n\nSEE : abhi industry evolution mei lagi hui thi OKAY \n\nsab compnies appni appni duplicate JAVASCRIPT BANA rahi thi and uski ke reated woh browser engines bana rahi thi \njo iss JS ko handle kar sake lekin thing is that ke appne appne JS appni appni engines \n\n\nLATER ON there is a Problem for users agar ek company ne website banayi hai using JavaScipt but uska engine hai Spidermonkey \n\ntoh usss website ka output kuch aur ayega at V8 engines \n\n\nso Then USer exprerince ho rhaa tha bht kharab okay \n\nABB sari industries ne milkar kaha ke see aise toh nai chal sakta kaam hamko kuch aisa karna padega ke hamare JS webisite \n\nhar kisi platform par render ho sake \n\n\n\nTOH UNHONE tab batt ki Ecma internaltional company se ke app kuch kro is issue ke relted :\n\n\nECMA iNTENATIONAL COMPANY : ne ek standarization rules set kar diye language ke upper ke iss rule ko follw krke webpage \nbanao har kisi engine par render hoga agar compatibitity of your version and engines matches ,\n\nISKA NAME DIYA AS echma script name after Java Script \n\n\nEchma ne rules set kiye ke :\n\nARRAYS , FN , CORICION yeh sab kya krege and result kya show hoga isi ki wajah se we all have same result on DIFF platforms \n\n\nKONSI cheeze Echma ke rules mei nai atti ahi :\n\nBrowser specifaction related koi bhi cheez nai show hogi jaise \n\nDOM , window , aise cheeze ko realted hai browser ke \n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Echma Scrippt :\n\n\nStory samjo iski abab poori hai kya yeh cheez ::\n\n1. Ab mai appko iska real matalb samjhata hu ke yeh cheez exixts hi kyo karti hai \n\nSEE : abhi industry evolution mei lagi hui thi OKAY \n\nsab compnies appni appni duplicate JAVASCRIPT BANA rahi thi and uski ke reated woh browser engines bana rahi thi \njo iss JS ko handle kar sake lekin thing is that ke appne appne JS appni appni engines \n\n\nLATER ON there is a Problem for users agar ek company ne website banayi hai using JavaScipt but uska engine hai Spidermonkey \n\ntoh usss website ka output kuch aur ayega at V8 engines \n\n\nso Then USer exprerince ho rhaa tha bht kharab okay \n\nABB sari industries ne milkar kaha ke see aise toh nai chal sakta kaam hamko kuch aisa karna padega ke hamare JS webisite \n\nhar kisi platform par render ho sake \n\n\n\nTOH UNHONE tab batt ki Ecma internaltional company se ke app kuch kro is issue ke relted :\n\n\nECMA iNTENATIONAL COMPANY : ne ek standarization rules set kar diye language ke upper ke iss rule ko follw krke webpage \nbanao har kisi engine par render hoga agar compatibitity of your version and engines matches ,\n\nISKA NAME DIYA AS echma script name after Java Script \n\n\nEchma ne rules set kiye ke :\n\nARRAYS , FN , CORICION yeh sab kya krege and result kya show hoga isi ki wajah se we all have same result on DIFF platforms \n\n\nKONSI cheeze Echma ke rules mei nai atti ahi :\n\nBrowser specifaction related koi bhi cheez nai show hogi jaise \n\nDOM , window , aise cheeze ko realted hai browser ke \n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
