      "updated": 1782688461396,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Engines kya hai THESE acts like translators matalb mai JS use karke koi project bana raa hu toh mai usko direactly machine \n\nlangauge mei toh nai likhuga , LIkhuga toh english ei hi toh eNGINES kya karege woh meri english ko convert krke samjha dege \n\ncomputer ko AS computer understand binary numbers .\n\n\nEngines pehele as said  USS TIME PAR BRWOSER ENGINE WAR start hui padi thi companies ke andar :\n\nmatalb ke har comapny ne appna engine banya for its own version of js ke liye .\n\n\nFIREFOX ==== SPIDERMONKEY [KING OF FIREFOX ]\n\nchakar ==== Microsoft Old files [ RETIRED ]\n\nV8 === chrome ne \n\nJS CORE = safari ke liye [ king of apple ]\n\n\nHar engines ki specs alag hai working style alag hai kuch kisi cheez mei fast hai kuch kise mai soo kisi ek ko best kehena is \n\nnot optimistic\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Engines kya hai THESE acts like translators matalb mai JS use karke koi project bana raa hu toh mai usko direactly machine \n\nlangauge mei toh nai likhuga , LIkhuga toh english ei hi toh eNGINES kya karege woh meri english ko convert krke samjha dege \n\ncomputer ko AS computer understand binary numbers .\n\n\nEngines pehele as said  USS TIME PAR BRWOSER ENGINE WAR start hui padi thi companies ke andar :\n\nmatalb ke har comapny ne appna engine banya for its own version of js ke liye .\n\n\nFIREFOX ==== SPIDERMONKEY [KING OF FIREFOX ]\n\nchakar ==== Microsoft Old files [ RETIRED ]\n\nV8 === chrome ne \n\nJS CORE = safari ke liye [ king of apple ]\n\n\nHar engines ki specs alag hai working style alag hai kuch kisi cheez mei fast hai kuch kise mai soo kisi ek ko best kehena is \n\nnot optimistic\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
