      "text": "Continuing from Engines we have concept called as JIT compilation \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Continuing from Engines we have concept called as JIT compilation \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "covxcoeEZvpW3vqIqxQ_i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 666.3473460444212,
      "y": 4564.850122467526,
      "width": 1020.4990844726562,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9775fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1912619489,
      "version": 810,
      "versionNonce": 156637199,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782688860780,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JS is not interpreted langauge it is neither complied -- it is JIT based langauge \n\n\nnow yeh kyu aya see we have terms like intergrated : \n\niska matalb ke code run karna line by line each line ko dekhke niche jana iske kya hoga har time each line \n\nko dekhna time consuming ho jata tha \n\n\nNow compiled : iska matalb before compile time sara code HL se MC mei convert ho jata tha then woh \nagge process hota tha \n\n\nabb Google comes into picture \n\nand said ke \" aisa kuch karn padega ke browser engine bhi fast ho and js bhi fast chale \"\n\nso ther comes a process caleed as JUST IN TIME COMPIALTION \n\n\nMatalb :\n\n\n  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JS is not interpreted langauge it is neither complied -- it is JIT based langauge \n\n\nnow yeh kyu aya see we have terms like intergrated : \n\niska matalb ke code run karna line by line each line ko dekhke niche jana iske kya hoga har time each line \n\nko dekhna time consuming ho jata tha \n\n\nNow compiled : iska matalb before compile time sara code HL se MC mei convert ho jata tha then woh \nagge process hota tha \n\n\nabb Google comes into picture \n\nand said ke \" aisa kuch karn padega ke browser engine bhi fast ho and js bhi fast chale \"\n\nso ther comes a process caleed as JUST IN TIME COMPIALTION \n\n\nMatalb :\n\n\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X4w0PiPwH3_vEnU909Pm8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830.2047811836992,
      "y": 5154.774055783463,
      "width": 402.2397766113281,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1747755087,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 960300079,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782688867543,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JavaScript Code\n       │\n       ▼\nInterpreter\n(Code ko turant execute karta hai)\n       │\n       ▼\nKya Ye Code Baar-Baar Chal Raha Hai?\n       │\n   ┌───┴────┐\n   │        │\n  No       Yes\n   │        │\n   ▼        ▼\nInterpreter  Compiler (TurboFan)\nContinue     │\n             ▼\n     Machine Code Banata Hai\n             │\n             ▼\n      Machine Code Store\n             │\n             ▼\n Next Time Direct Machine Code Execute\n             │\n             ▼\n      🚀 Fast Execution",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JavaScript Code\n       │\n       ▼\nInterpreter\n(Code ko turant execute karta hai)\n       │\n       ▼\nKya Ye Code Baar-Baar Chal Raha Hai?\n       │\n   ┌───┴────┐\n   │        │\n  No       Yes\n   │        │\n   ▼        ▼\nInterpreter  Compiler (TurboFan)\nContinue     │\n             ▼\n     Machine Code Banata Hai\n             │\n             ▼\n      Machine Code Store\n             │\n             ▼\n Next Time Direct Machine Code Execute\n             │\n             ▼\n      🚀 Fast Execution",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
