    {
      "id": "HSEMRcB6oWl7EEpCfwDyI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 639.913540635101,
      "y": 6123.48310571183,
      "width": 1360.779296875,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1134004161,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 2006721505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782688960411,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature                  | Interpreted                         | Compiled                                                                  |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Meaning**              | Code line-by-line execute hota hai. | Poora code pehle Machine Code me convert hota hai, phir execute hota hai. |\n\n| **Execution**            | Line by line                        | Whole program ek saath                                                    |\n\n| **Translation Time**     | Runtime par                         | Execution se pehle                                                        |\n\n| **Startup Speed**        | Fast                                | Slow (Compilation ki wajah se)                                            |\n\n| **Execution Speed**      | Slow                                | Fast                                                                      |\n\n| **Compilation Required** | ❌ Nahi                              | ✅ Haan                                                                    |\n\n| **Optimization**         | Kam                                 | Zyada                                                                     |\n\n| **Error Detection**      | Runtime par                         | Compile time par                                                          |\n\n| **Machine Code**         | Permanently store nahi hota         | Generate hokar store hota hai                                             |\n\n| **Examples**             | Python, Old JavaScript              | C, C++, Go                                                                |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature                  | Interpreted                         | Compiled                                                                  |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Meaning**              | Code line-by-line execute hota hai. | Poora code pehle Machine Code me convert hota hai, phir execute hota hai. |\n\n| **Execution**            | Line by line                        | Whole program ek saath                                                    |\n\n| **Translation Time**     | Runtime par                         | Execution se pehle                                                        |\n\n| **Startup Speed**        | Fast                                | Slow (Compilation ki wajah se)                                            |\n\n| **Execution Speed**      | Slow                                | Fast                                                                      |\n\n| **Compilation Required** | ❌ Nahi                              | ✅ Haan                                                                    |\n\n| **Optimization**         | Kam                                 | Zyada                                                                     |\n\n| **Error Detection**      | Runtime par                         | Compile time par                                                          |\n\n| **Machine Code**         | Permanently store nahi hota         | Generate hokar store hota hai                                             |\n\n| **Examples**             | Python, Old JavaScript              | C, C++, Go                                                                |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wmjsCoz1m5dXKsMqP6QuE",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 616.7356668663299,
