    {
      "id": "HPhFX3Yhk77zZ30v4SdCi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 553.1985361010884,
      "y": 6812.398381165185,
      "width": 1547.4190673828125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 860885999,
      "version": 84,
      "versionNonce": 457727663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782689038992,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature         | Synchronous                                            | Asynchronous                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Meaning**     | Ek task complete hone ke baad hi next task chalta hai. | Long task background me chala jata hai, main thread dusre kaam karta rehta hai. \n|\n| **Execution**   | One by One                                             | Non-Blocking                                                                    |\n\n| **Flow**        | Sequential                                             | Parallel feeling (actual parallel nahi)                                         |\n\n| **Waiting**     | Next task ko wait karna padta hai                      | Wait nahi karna padta                                                           |\n\n| **Blocking**    | ✅ Blocking                                             | ❌ Non-Blocking                                                                  |\n\n| **Performance** | Slow agar koi task heavy ho                            | Better user experience                                                          |\n\n| **Main Thread** | Busy rehta hai                                         | Free rehta hai                                                                  |\n\n| **Use Cases**   | Simple calculations, basic operations                  | API Calls, File Reading, Database, Timers                                       |\n\n| **Examples**    | Normal JavaScript statements                           | `fetch()`, `setTimeout()`, Promises, `async/await`                              |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature         | Synchronous                                            | Asynchronous                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Meaning**     | Ek task complete hone ke baad hi next task chalta hai. | Long task background me chala jata hai, main thread dusre kaam karta rehta hai. \n|\n| **Execution**   | One by One                                             | Non-Blocking                                                                    |\n\n| **Flow**        | Sequential                                             | Parallel feeling (actual parallel nahi)                                         |\n\n| **Waiting**     | Next task ko wait karna padta hai                      | Wait nahi karna padta                                                           |\n\n| **Blocking**    | ✅ Blocking                                             | ❌ Non-Blocking                                                                  |\n\n| **Performance** | Slow agar koi task heavy ho                            | Better user experience                                                          |\n\n| **Main Thread** | Busy rehta hai                                         | Free rehta hai                                                                  |\n\n| **Use Cases**   | Simple calculations, basic operations                  | API Calls, File Reading, Database, Timers                                       |\n\n| **Examples**    | Normal JavaScript statements                           | `fetch()`, `setTimeout()`, Promises, `async/await`                              |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "paANu5ah1FyQurpcZWS6S",
