      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n         DYNAMIC TYPING\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nDefinition:\nJavaScript ek Dynamically Typed language hai,yani variable ka data type \nRuntime par automatically decide hota hai.\n\nMain Points:\n✔ Type manually declare nahi karni padti.\n✔ JavaScript value dekhkar type decide karti hai.\n✔ Same variable different data types store\n  kar sakta hai.\n✔ Type Runtime (execution time) par decide hota hai.\n✔ Variable ka type fixed nahi hota.\n\nAdvantages:\n✔ Less code\n✔ Fast development\n✔ Easy to learn\n✔ Flexible\n\nDisadvantages:\n✔ Runtime errors ka chance zyada\n✔ Type safety nahi hoti\n✔ Large projects me bugs ho sakte hain\n\nDynamic vs Static:\nDynamic → Runtime par type decide hota hai.\nStatic → Compile time par type decide hota hai.\n\nInterview Line:\n\"JavaScript is a Dynamically Typed language\nbecause the data type of a variable is\ndetermined automatically at runtime, and\nthe programmer does not need to declare\nthe type explicitly.\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━",
      "fontSize": 41.934901130391644,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n         DYNAMIC TYPING\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nDefinition:\nJavaScript ek Dynamically Typed language hai,yani variable ka data type \nRuntime par automatically decide hota hai.\n\nMain Points:\n✔ Type manually declare nahi karni padti.\n✔ JavaScript value dekhkar type decide karti hai.\n✔ Same variable different data types store\n  kar sakta hai.\n✔ Type Runtime (execution time) par decide hota hai.\n✔ Variable ka type fixed nahi hota.\n\nAdvantages:\n✔ Less code\n✔ Fast development\n✔ Easy to learn\n✔ Flexible\n\nDisadvantages:\n✔ Runtime errors ka chance zyada\n✔ Type safety nahi hoti\n✔ Large projects me bugs ho sakte hain\n\nDynamic vs Static:\nDynamic → Runtime par type decide hota hai.\nStatic → Compile time par type decide hota hai.\n\nInterview Line:\n\"JavaScript is a Dynamically Typed language\nbecause the data type of a variable is\ndetermined automatically at runtime, and\nthe programmer does not need to declare\nthe type explicitly.\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━",
