      "updated": 1782773300346,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Execution Context :: yeh kya cheez hai and js mei iski need kya hai  ???\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Execution Context :: yeh kya cheez hai and js mei iski need kya hai  ???\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "njmbCtlAM5YvK417tG5JN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3055.6932107206044,
      "y": 683.8641353121291,
      "width": 1302.779052734375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ak",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2144092304,
      "version": 405,
      "versionNonce": 1510094960,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782774621436,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "jab bhi koi JS program nu run karan hai ya ode bare sochna bhi hai sabse pehele step hai ke woh chhez socho jo isnu hanlde kardi hai \n\n\nJS code likh dita --- ohh kithe likhya hai kon handle ya manage kar rha ahi usnu --> ie basucally your Execution Context ..\n\n\nEC ::::",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "jab bhi koi JS program nu run karan hai ya ode bare sochna bhi hai sabse pehele step hai ke woh chhez socho jo isnu hanlde kardi hai \n\n\nJS code likh dita --- ohh kithe likhya hai kon handle ya manage kar rha ahi usnu --> ie basucally your Execution Context ..\n\n\nEC ::::",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-pzbvosj-I3Fy_5ZUkZZB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3031.683416797606,
      "y": 918.0903253243699,
      "width": 1297.51904296875,
      "height": 1900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 676688016,
      "version": 2889,
      "versionNonce": 1392248047,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786189515469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "iska matab hai ke agar mai JS code likhna chaahata hu toh mere ko ek ENVIORMNET chahiye jaha par mai isko fully handel kar pau\n\nfrom storing it to the execution \n\n\nEC : ka main 2 tarike ka kaam karta hai :\n\n1. Creation phase \n\n2. Execution phase \n\n\niss se pehele lets talk about GLOBAL EXECUTION CONTEXT ::\n\nyeh kya karta hai jo bhi things hai usko ek global env mei rakh deta hai taaki woh future mei use kar paye program during executioin \n\nIt is going to create a global space where you can soter the relatable data in the global context ;\n\n\nex : let a=10 ;\n        console.log(a)\n\nAB kya hoga yeh global Execution phase mei jayega jaha par :\n\n>> store hoga varaible name , value \n>> what is the scope of this \n>> iski this kya hai > matalb yeh kis cheez koo point out kar aha hai \n\n\nEk batt aurr :\n\n<< bina GEC koi program run hi nai ho sakta \n>> yeh basically sara program control karta hai > kaha store karan hai , uski data type kaha store hogi and uska \nbehaviour kya hoga \n\n\n2. Creation phase :\n\nyeh phase siraf ready rehene ko  bolta hai ,, execution ke bare mei kuch nai bota \n\nyaha par bss sab cheeze ready hogi ke agge kya kaya hoga ya kya kya hone wala hai \n\nlike : Execution context created ,\n           Storage spaces also created ,\n        scopes are defined \n\n\nSAB kuch ho jayega yaha par bss execution nai hogi \n\n\n3. Execution phase :\njab sab kuch porgram ka pta chal jayega ke kya kya kran hai tabb last step hoga execution phase ,\n\njo code hai usko execute kardo jara isme ab ek cheez ayegi \n\n\nSuppose jab tak PDT hai tab tak normally chali jauga , jasie hi  NPDT aya matlab like functions aye , toh dikkar hogi ,\n\nkyo ki fucntion ka nature hai dynamic dif dif output on calling , so agar unka varaibel name sme hua toh ,\n\nconflit a sakta hai > TABHI AYA APPKA Function execution Context > \n\niska matalb hai agr program mei kahi par fucntion aya toh kya hoga :\n\nappka Fucntional executional contet active ho jayega :\n\nyeh kya karta hai jab bhi priogram mei functional calling hogi tab yeh :\n\n>> yeh ek temp executon context crete kardega for execuition of a fucntion \n\n>> and yeh independently work karega inside GEC ke andar \n\n^^ jasie hi function execution hoga >> return akrega value >> appne app destrory ho jayega uske badd\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iska matab hai ke agar mai JS code likhna chaahata hu toh mere ko ek ENVIORMNET chahiye jaha par mai isko fully handel kar pau\n\nfrom storing it to the execution \n\n\nEC : ka main 2 tarike ka kaam karta hai :\n\n1. Creation phase \n\n2. Execution phase \n\n\niss se pehele lets talk about GLOBAL EXECUTION CONTEXT ::\n\nyeh kya karta hai jo bhi things hai usko ek global env mei rakh deta hai taaki woh future mei use kar paye program during executioin \n\nIt is going to create a global space where you can soter the relatable data in the global context ;\n\n\nex : let a=10 ;\n        console.log(a)\n\nAB kya hoga yeh global Execution phase mei jayega jaha par :\n\n>> store hoga varaible name , value \n>> what is the scope of this \n>> iski this kya hai > matalb yeh kis cheez koo point out kar aha hai \n\n\nEk batt aurr :\n\n<< bina GEC koi program run hi nai ho sakta \n>> yeh basically sara program control karta hai > kaha store karan hai , uski data type kaha store hogi and uska \nbehaviour kya hoga \n\n\n2. Creation phase :\n\nyeh phase siraf ready rehene ko  bolta hai ,, execution ke bare mei kuch nai bota \n\nyaha par bss sab cheeze ready hogi ke agge kya kaya hoga ya kya kya hone wala hai \n\nlike : Execution context created ,\n           Storage spaces also created ,\n        scopes are defined \n\n\nSAB kuch ho jayega yaha par bss execution nai hogi \n\n\n3. Execution phase :\njab sab kuch porgram ka pta chal jayega ke kya kya kran hai tabb last step hoga execution phase ,\n\njo code hai usko execute kardo jara isme ab ek cheez ayegi \n\n\nSuppose jab tak PDT hai tab tak normally chali jauga , jasie hi  NPDT aya matlab like functions aye , toh dikkar hogi ,\n\nkyo ki fucntion ka nature hai dynamic dif dif output on calling , so agar unka varaibel name sme hua toh ,\n\nconflit a sakta hai > TABHI AYA APPKA Function execution Context > \n\niska matalb hai agr program mei kahi par fucntion aya toh kya hoga :\n\nappka Fucntional executional contet active ho jayega :\n\nyeh kya karta hai jab bhi priogram mei functional calling hogi tab yeh :\n\n>> yeh ek temp executon context crete kardega for execuition of a fucntion \n\n>> and yeh independently work karega inside GEC ke andar \n\n^^ jasie hi function execution hoga >> return akrega value >> appne app destrory ho jayega uske badd\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YXXa_dGXRKDHwOah-hdKj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2952.2421092440236,
      "y": 2851.7901313134366,
      "width": 979.7392578125,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e64980",
      "backgroundColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 145857136,
      "version": 659,
      "versionNonce": 1392751361,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786194145508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Call Stack :\n\nAb is process mei sabse major role hai Call Stack ka : OAKY \n\nAGAR call stack na ho toh kuch bhi nai chalega > \n\nCall stack = manager ?? Execution coentect haiga = worker \n\n\nCall stack : execute hue program ko ksie chalana hai kosna variable kab chalega ,\nkosna nai chalega \n\n\nisme yeh cheeze decide hoti hai via Scope ;\n\nke appka code ka scopr kya hai main , konsa part of code kab chalega \n\n** jab bhi porgram ayega woh push ho jayega call stack mei && complete hone par pop bhi ho jayega \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Call Stack :\n\nAb is process mei sabse major role hai Call Stack ka : OAKY \n\nAGAR call stack na ho toh kuch bhi nai chalega > \n\nCall stack = manager ?? Execution coentect haiga = worker \n\n\nCall stack : execute hue program ko ksie chalana hai kosna variable kab chalega ,\nkosna nai chalega \n\n\nisme yeh cheeze decide hoti hai via Scope ;\n\nke appka code ka scopr kya hai main , konsa part of code kab chalega \n\n** jab bhi porgram ayega woh push ho jayega call stack mei && complete hone par pop bhi ho jayega \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Fr9TQOISu5cR4rVtK6LLv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2946.4433642898166,
      "y": 3424.246900705475,
      "width": 1067.6192626953125,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7950f2",
      "backgroundColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1449172112,
      "version": 564,
      "versionNonce": 1126316144,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782776781055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SCOPE :\n\nkoi bhi program hai woh bina scope ke ani chal sakta hai . scope must hai taaki JS engine usko easily \n\nsamaj paye and koi conflit na a sake .\n\nScope defines akrda hai ke ik variable ka covering parth area kitna hai , kaha tak usko access akr sakte ahi ,\n\nuske bhar jayenge toh error a sakta hai \n\n\nTYPES of scopes ::\n\n1. Global Scope \n2. Function scope \n3. Block scope \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SCOPE :\n\nkoi bhi program hai woh bina scope ke ani chal sakta hai . scope must hai taaki JS engine usko easily \n\nsamaj paye and koi conflit na a sake .\n\nScope defines akrda hai ke ik variable ka covering parth area kitna hai , kaha tak usko access akr sakte ahi ,\n\nuske bhar jayenge toh error a sakta hai \n\n\nTYPES of scopes ::\n\n1. Global Scope \n2. Function scope \n3. Block scope \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3yEIejDgKTAm4ODSEBEyl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2937.5778375390323,
      "y": 3912.9829702254256,
      "width": 1096.659423828125,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3bc9db",
      "backgroundColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1152241264,
      "version": 642,
      "versionNonce": 588557456,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782777062416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scope chain :\n\nyeh bht imp hai samajni  supose karo ek asie situation a gyi hai ke jis scope mai mai varaible dhund raha hu , \n\nwoh usme nai milla okay fine , abb kahi na kahi se uske sath linking ho rahi hai >\n\nlike Child mei nai milla >> link ja raha hai Parent tak >> parent mei nai milla >> link gya Grand Parent tak >> usme \n\nnai milla > toh link gya gLOBAL SCOPE TAK >> usme nai milla toh refernce error \n\n\neg :: let a =12;\n       \nlet b =a ;\n\nconsole.log(b)    isme abb kahi na kahi se mil gya b ki value so this is SCope chaining ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scope chain :\n\nyeh bht imp hai samajni  supose karo ek asie situation a gyi hai ke jis scope mai mai varaible dhund raha hu , \n\nwoh usme nai milla okay fine , abb kahi na kahi se uske sath linking ho rahi hai >\n\nlike Child mei nai milla >> link ja raha hai Parent tak >> parent mei nai milla >> link gya Grand Parent tak >> usme \n\nnai milla > toh link gya gLOBAL SCOPE TAK >> usme nai milla toh refernce error \n\n\neg :: let a =12;\n       \nlet b =a ;\n\nconsole.log(b)    isme abb kahi na kahi se mil gya b ki value so this is SCope chaining ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GtCzW3I9n2Ox4LP_8qMmj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2921.9216786314273,
      "y": 4424.165802027403,
      "width": 971.779296875,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#a18072",
      "backgroundColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ar",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 747025520,
      "version": 985,
      "versionNonce": 562485904,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782777500657,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Working of ecection context :\n\n1. sabse pehela tuhada file mei se node.js ki file ko , chakega and usko browser par load karwayega \n\n2. JS engine : abb js engine uss file ko load karwane mei help karega \nSpidermonkey , JavaScript Code ,  V 9 \n\nyeh basically help karte hai usko UI par lane ke liye \n\n3. Tokenization :\n\nab apka jo bhi code hai uske chote chote tukde karo and usko align kardo \n\n4. Parsing : iss step mei check hoga ke koi grammertical error , syntax errror toh ni hai kya \n\n5. AST : abb compouter nai samaj pata JS ko borwser samaj leta hai \n\nyeh apka tree bakke ayege\n\n6.. Bytecode : yeh cinvert karda hai JS ko unke techgg je accorignky \n\n7 , abb itne steps ke badd aya mai Execution context jaha par readt made creamm mil rahi hai \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Working of ecection context :\n\n1. sabse pehela tuhada file mei se node.js ki file ko , chakega and usko browser par load karwayega \n\n2. JS engine : abb js engine uss file ko load karwane mei help karega \nSpidermonkey , JavaScript Code ,  V 9 \n\nyeh basically help karte hai usko UI par lane ke liye \n\n3. Tokenization :\n\nab apka jo bhi code hai uske chote chote tukde karo and usko align kardo \n\n4. Parsing : iss step mei check hoga ke koi grammertical error , syntax errror toh ni hai kya \n\n5. AST : abb compouter nai samaj pata JS ko borwser samaj leta hai \n\nyeh apka tree bakke ayege\n\n6.. Bytecode : yeh cinvert karda hai JS ko unke techgg je accorignky \n\n7 , abb itne steps ke badd aya mai Execution context jaha par readt made creamm mil rahi hai \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ouHRg9Bj3PlCG7BA-dhNs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2919.6581729556888,
      "y": 5074.556377176259,
      "width": 498.669677734375,
      "height": 1050,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#a18072",
      "backgroundColor": "#f08c00",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "as",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 727545488,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 1038136464,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782777527353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Program Start\n      │\n      ▼\nGlobal Execution Context (GEC) Create\n      │\n      ▼\nCreation Phase (GEC)\n      │\n      ├── Variables ke liye memory banao\n      ├── Functions store karo\n      └── Execute mat karo\n      │\n      ▼\nExecution Phase (GEC)\n      │\n      ├── Variables ko values do\n      ├── Calculations karo\n      │\n      ├── Function Call mila?\n      │        │\n      │       YES\n      │        │\n      │        ▼\n      │   Function Execution Context (FEC) Create\n      │        │\n      │        ▼\n      │   Creation Phase (FEC)\n      │        ├── Local variables ki memory\n      │        ├── Parameters ki memory\n      │        └── Arguments assign\n      │        │\n      │        ▼\n      │   Execution Phase (FEC)\n      │        ├── Function ka code execute\n      │        ├── Return value\n      │        └── FEC Destroy\n      │\n      ▼\nBack to Global Execution Context\n      │\n      ├── Next line execute\n      └── Program End",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Program Start\n      │\n      ▼\nGlobal Execution Context (GEC) Create\n      │\n      ▼\nCreation Phase (GEC)\n      │\n      ├── Variables ke liye memory banao\n      ├── Functions store karo\n      └── Execute mat karo\n      │\n      ▼\nExecution Phase (GEC)\n      │\n      ├── Variables ko values do\n      ├── Calculations karo\n      │\n      ├── Function Call mila?\n      │        │\n      │       YES\n      │        │\n      │        ▼\n      │   Function Execution Context (FEC) Create\n      │        │\n      │        ▼\n      │   Creation Phase (FEC)\n      │        ├── Local variables ki memory\n      │        ├── Parameters ki memory\n      │        └── Arguments assign\n      │        │\n      │        ▼\n      │   Execution Phase (FEC)\n      │        ├── Function ka code execute\n      │        ├── Return value\n      │        └── FEC Destroy\n      │\n      ▼\nBack to Global Execution Context\n      │\n      ├── Next line execute\n      └── Program End",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
