    {
      "id": "foEHPduZyNjUsIA2ERznw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2484.406805894184,
      "y": 6406.540989328926,
      "width": 2038.2587890625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1118990668,
      "version": 723,
      "versionNonce": 899220596,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252540301,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Env is a space that is imp for code to write , manage , execute the code and once it is finished you have to delete the things .\n\nIt is a space for each code that will decide its execution context to exectuion phase tak code kaise kiase konse konse env mei banega ,\n\nkonse scope mei run hoga and later execute hoga and kaise uss code ke exectuion ke badd usko edelete kiya jayega and kise usko track kiya jayega \n\nkaise uski memory creation phase banegi , and uske execution ke baad kaise uske env ko clear kiya jayga \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Env is a space that is imp for code to write , manage , execute the code and once it is finished you have to delete the things .\n\nIt is a space for each code that will decide its execution context to exectuion phase tak code kaise kiase konse konse env mei banega ,\n\nkonse scope mei run hoga and later execute hoga and kaise uss code ke exectuion ke badd usko edelete kiya jayega and kise usko track kiya jayega \n\nkaise uski memory creation phase banegi , and uske execution ke baad kaise uske env ko clear kiya jayga \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9rHq3HSW2dd-SDqtN9DL2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2530.479288281552,
      "y": 6711.770814417685,
      "width": 1790.3437731857607,
      "height": 52.277112242011604,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 206665588,
      "version": 401,
      "versionNonce": 1007936500,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252915568,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "YThis is very imp for the code as env decides the code how to execute and terminate. ",
      "fontSize": 41.82168979360928,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "YThis is very imp for the code as env decides the code how to execute and terminate. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hhVM26s0QGDu8LQNHwS4f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2514.6417523177056,
      "y": 6855.747225763663,
      "width": 1666.9810791015625,
      "height": 575.8346009549097,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1118513268,
      "version": 82,
      "versionNonce": 1584697588,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783252913753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Environment ke bina kya hoga?\nVariables store hi nahi honge.\nFunctions store nahi honge.\nVariables ko access (lookup) nahi kar paoge.\nFunction calls properly execute nahi hongi.\nScope ka concept khatam ho jayega.\nLocal aur global variables ka difference nahi rahega.\nHoisting possible nahi hogi.\nClosures work nahi karenge.\nIdentifier resolution (variable/function name ko dhoondhna) nahi ho payega.\nJavaScript engine ko pata hi nahi chalega ki x, y, ya myFunction kis cheez ko refer kar rahe hain.\nExecution Context ke paas execute karne ke liye required data hi nahi hoga.\nResult: Program ReferenceError dega ya execute hi nahi ho payega",
      "fontSize": 35.43597544337906,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Environment ke bina kya hoga?\nVariables store hi nahi honge.\nFunctions store nahi honge.\nVariables ko access (lookup) nahi kar paoge.\nFunction calls properly execute nahi hongi.\nScope ka concept khatam ho jayega.\nLocal aur global variables ka difference nahi rahega.\nHoisting possible nahi hogi.\nClosures work nahi karenge.\nIdentifier resolution (variable/function name ko dhoondhna) nahi ho payega.\nJavaScript engine ko pata hi nahi chalega ki x, y, ya myFunction kis cheez ko refer kar rahe hain.\nExecution Context ke paas execute karne ke liye required data hi nahi hoga.\nResult: Program ReferenceError dega ya execute hi nahi ho payega",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
