    {
      "id": "9JhlDuW_FjkW5kTA9n8LC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2565.3934754883694,
      "y": 8303.068798878838,
      "width": 2134.718505859375,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2046669900,
      "version": 969,
      "versionNonce": 43414132,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783253511504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lexical means :: env that deals with let and const .\n\niss env mei ham store karte hai code ke env ko based on their position in the code ,\n\nmeans ke code kisscope mei hai uske hisab ke uska env store kiya jata hai . Isme ham code ki copy sotre nai krte balki ham isme \n\nisme outer refercne store karte hai code ka taaki hamko hamesha updated code ka env de deal kar sake \n\nAB asie karte kyuo hai ham ???\n\ndekho agar ham copy sotre kar lege toh badd mei agar code mei changes ho gaye toh dikkat a jayegi kyoki ham OLD ENV SE HI DEAL KARTE REAHEGE \n\nisss liye we are not doing like taht things , so ham store karte hai outer env refercne takki isse deal kar sake easily and to deal with current env everytime\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lexical means :: env that deals with let and const .\n\niss env mei ham store karte hai code ke env ko based on their position in the code ,\n\nmeans ke code kisscope mei hai uske hisab ke uska env store kiya jata hai . Isme ham code ki copy sotre nai krte balki ham isme \n\nisme outer refercne store karte hai code ka taaki hamko hamesha updated code ka env de deal kar sake \n\nAB asie karte kyuo hai ham ???\n\ndekho agar ham copy sotre kar lege toh badd mei agar code mei changes ho gaye toh dikkat a jayegi kyoki ham OLD ENV SE HI DEAL KARTE REAHEGE \n\nisss liye we are not doing like taht things , so ham store karte hai outer env refercne takki isse deal kar sake easily and to deal with current env everytime\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "U1xIx1AGR7Q0_R7gStU88",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2569.712753548872,
      "y": 8983.716786192788,
      "width": 1588.4669189453125,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 256599412,
      "version": 369,
      "versionNonce": 419148748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783253629427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ENV RECORDD :: iska matalb hai ke ham current scope ke env ke varaible , fucntion ko store , manage kar rahe hai ?\n\nhar env ka alag alag env record banega like \n\nGLOBAL EXECUTION CONTEXT MEI CODE HAI = alag env record \n\nFn                                                           = ka alag \n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ENV RECORDD :: iska matalb hai ke ham current scope ke env ke varaible , fucntion ko store , manage kar rahe hai ?\n\nhar env ka alag alag env record banega like \n\nGLOBAL EXECUTION CONTEXT MEI CODE HAI = alag env record \n\nFn                                                           = ka alag \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nfccF14GJ41Nj_jeUlqLP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2548.8362337693407,
      "y": 9384.330801180611,
      "width": 2005.8907470703125,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 438448332,
      "version": 614,
      "versionNonce": 1092610420,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783253897565,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Outer env referecne ::\nyeh imp hissa hai suppose kare ke 3 env records hai mere passs \n\nand mai ek variable dhudh raha hu woh mere ko current wale mei nai milla toh kya krna hai agge , toh woh appne parent ke pass jake dekhega ke \n\nkya yeh tumhare pass hai > agar uske pass nai hoga toh GLOBAL KE pass jaeyga >> uske pass bhi nai hhua toh refernce error ayega fir mere pass\n\nke bascially reference se deal karta hai ..\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Outer env referecne ::\nyeh imp hissa hai suppose kare ke 3 env records hai mere passs \n\nand mai ek variable dhudh raha hu woh mere ko current wale mei nai milla toh kya krna hai agge , toh woh appne parent ke pass jake dekhega ke \n\nkya yeh tumhare pass hai > agar uske pass nai hoga toh GLOBAL KE pass jaeyga >> uske pass bhi nai hhua toh refernce error ayega fir mere pass\n\nke bascially reference se deal karta hai ..\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LretG2cOkK7QjdCJoPBG5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3098.105791041229,
      "y": 9825.618187249534,
      "width": 979.32763671875,
      "height": 2030,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 554969420,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 1907515852,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783254184254,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// ---------------- GLOBAL ENVIRONMENT ----------------\n\n// Environment Record (Global)\n// ---------------------------\n// a  -> 10\n// greet -> function\n//\n// Outer Environment Reference\n// ---------------------------\n// null (Global ke bahar kuch nahi hota)\n\nlet a = 10;\n\nfunction greet() {\n\n    // ------------ GREET FUNCTION ENVIRONMENT ------------\n\n    // Environment Record (greet)\n    // --------------------------\n    // b -> 20\n    // print -> function\n    //\n    // Outer Environment Reference\n    // --------------------------\n    // Global Environment\n\n    let b = 20;\n\n    function print() {\n\n        // ----------- PRINT FUNCTION ENVIRONMENT -----------\n\n        // Environment Record (print)\n        // --------------------------\n        // c -> 30\n        //\n        // Outer Environment Reference\n        // --------------------------\n        // greet Environment\n\n        let c = 30;\n\n        console.log(a); // print me a nahi mila\n                        // Outer -> greet gaya\n                        // greet me bhi nahi mila\n                        // Outer -> Global gaya\n                        // Global me mil gaya (10)\n\n        console.log(b); // print me nahi mila\n                        // Outer -> greet me mil gaya (20)\n\n        console.log(c); // print ke Environment Record me hi mil gaya (30)\n    }\n\n    print();\n}           \n\ngreet();",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// ---------------- GLOBAL ENVIRONMENT ----------------\n\n// Environment Record (Global)\n// ---------------------------\n// a  -> 10\n// greet -> function\n//\n// Outer Environment Reference\n// ---------------------------\n// null (Global ke bahar kuch nahi hota)\n\nlet a = 10;\n\nfunction greet() {\n\n    // ------------ GREET FUNCTION ENVIRONMENT ------------\n\n    // Environment Record (greet)\n    // --------------------------\n    // b -> 20\n    // print -> function\n    //\n    // Outer Environment Reference\n    // --------------------------\n    // Global Environment\n\n    let b = 20;\n\n    function print() {\n\n        // ----------- PRINT FUNCTION ENVIRONMENT -----------\n\n        // Environment Record (print)\n        // --------------------------\n        // c -> 30\n        //\n        // Outer Environment Reference\n        // --------------------------\n        // greet Environment\n\n        let c = 30;\n\n        console.log(a); // print me a nahi mila\n                        // Outer -> greet gaya\n                        // greet me bhi nahi mila\n                        // Outer -> Global gaya\n                        // Global me mil gaya (10)\n\n        console.log(b); // print me nahi mila\n                        // Outer -> greet me mil gaya (20)\n\n        console.log(c); // print ke Environment Record me hi mil gaya (30)\n    }\n\n    print();\n}           \n\ngreet();",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
