    {
      "id": "9A7JO4KUGRh2Pp355Io5v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5601.563234499405,
      "y": 6172.113899891266,
      "width": 1347.779541015625,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1541176780,
      "version": 905,
      "versionNonce": 1664907508,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783255779085,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Closures kya karuga isme :: now see closures  ka scene kya hai ::\n \nPROBLEM :\n\nsuppose there is a nested fucntion : 2 fucntion hai nested \n\nabb outer fucntion call hua and uske varable ko execute kar liaya toh ab naormally kya hoga \nvaraibel execute ke badd outer env destroy ho jayega \n\nHere a twist : ab inner fucntion call hua and usko jarurat thi outerfunction ke variable ki now \n\nan outer ka env toh katam ho gya >< now ab inner outer ko use nai kar paya and gets stuck ther \n\nab yaha par need padti ahi closure ki \n\n\nClosures bante hai appke Lexical env mei jaha par appka=\nVARIABLES + Outer varaibel memory refence store hota hai \n\nAB closure kya kehta hai ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Closures kya karuga isme :: now see closures  ka scene kya hai ::\n \nPROBLEM :\n\nsuppose there is a nested fucntion : 2 fucntion hai nested \n\nabb outer fucntion call hua and uske varable ko execute kar liaya toh ab naormally kya hoga \nvaraibel execute ke badd outer env destroy ho jayega \n\nHere a twist : ab inner fucntion call hua and usko jarurat thi outerfunction ke variable ki now \n\nan outer ka env toh katam ho gya >< now ab inner outer ko use nai kar paya and gets stuck ther \n\nab yaha par need padti ahi closure ki \n\n\nClosures bante hai appke Lexical env mei jaha par appka=\nVARIABLES + Outer varaibel memory refence store hota hai \n\nAB closure kya kehta hai ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LjX3-4DprhmfQjnL72L96",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5607.634211641872,
      "y": 6927.559575202505,
      "width": 1689.1829833984375,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1690836300,
      "version": 1322,
      "versionNonce": 1937496820,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783256310504,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "yeh kehta hai ke agar kisi function ko parenet ke outer ENV ke refernce ki need hai toh usko preserve karlo \n\njab tak need hai uski and jab uski need katam toh usko terminate krdo \n\n// yeh appka koi varaioble store nai kaerga \n\n// na koi copy sote krega \n\nyeh appa outer env ka refenrce store karega taaki appko jo bhi curent oyuter ref hua jis state mei usse app direactlu deal \nkar sako \n\n\n\nSteps :::\n\n1. 2 fucntion bana liye nested pehele outer funtin banaya uske andar inside functin banaya \n\n2. ab outer fucntion call hua uska env refecne bana varaibel execute hue , function call hua \n\n3. ab agar inner fucntion ko outer ki env ka refernce chaiye toh outer ke refence ko preserve karlo \n\njab tak uski need hai tab tak rakhio badd mei terniamte kardo usko okay ||||||",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "yeh kehta hai ke agar kisi function ko parenet ke outer ENV ke refernce ki need hai toh usko preserve karlo \n\njab tak need hai uski and jab uski need katam toh usko terminate krdo \n\n// yeh appka koi varaioble store nai kaerga \n\n// na koi copy sote krega \n\nyeh appa outer env ka refenrce store karega taaki appko jo bhi curent oyuter ref hua jis state mei usse app direactlu deal \nkar sako \n\n\n\nSteps :::\n\n1. 2 fucntion bana liye nested pehele outer funtin banaya uske andar inside functin banaya \n\n2. ab outer fucntion call hua uska env refecne bana varaibel execute hue , function call hua \n\n3. ab agar inner fucntion ko outer ki env ka refernce chaiye toh outer ke refence ko preserve karlo \n\njab tak uski need hai tab tak rakhio badd mei terniamte kardo usko okay ||||||",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FMc2rl-I8-hfnDqwVHni3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5601.334732147103,
      "y": 7730.002647520734,
      "width": 1352.4552001953125,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2068884980,
      "version": 165,
      "versionNonce": 1095074380,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783256526698,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IMP ??? ke js ko kasie pta chalta hai ke iska outer env refernce ki need padgo ke  nai  badd mei ??\n\n\n✅ Har function create hote hi Outer Environment Reference set hota hai.\n✅ Us time JS check nahi karti ki closure banega ya nahi.\n✅ Baad me agar variable current environment me nahi mila, tab ye reference use hota hai.\n✅ Agar kabhi zarurat hi nahi padi, to reference bana rehna koi issue nahi.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IMP ??? ke js ko kasie pta chalta hai ke iska outer env refernce ki need padgo ke  nai  badd mei ??\n\n\n✅ Har function create hote hi Outer Environment Reference set hota hai.\n✅ Us time JS check nahi karti ki closure banega ya nahi.\n✅ Baad me agar variable current environment me nahi mila, tab ye reference use hota hai.\n✅ Agar kabhi zarurat hi nahi padi, to reference bana rehna koi issue nahi.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oB_1hJAzE3l822XDSa-H0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5601.08330807236,
      "y": 8083.272432652831,
      "width": 1779.0068359375,
      "height": 420,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 736127476,
      "version": 300,
      "versionNonce": 255481548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783256630397,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Actual need of closure is in :::\n\nDATA HIDING \n\nPRIVATE VARIABLES \n\nASYNC PROGRAMMING \n\nEVENT LISTENERS \n\n\niski need waha padti hai jaha futre mei kosne varaivbe ki need padegi and kya actions honge waha apr uski need jayada hogi ??????",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Actual need of closure is in :::\n\nDATA HIDING \n\nPRIVATE VARIABLES \n\nASYNC PROGRAMMING \n\nEVENT LISTENERS \n\n\niski need waha padti hai jaha futre mei kosne varaivbe ki need padegi and kya actions honge waha apr uski need jayada hogi ??????",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
