      "updated": 1786302378722,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THIS ::::\n\n\nit is a specail keyword jo appke object ke andar ke varaibles and methods se deal karne ke liye baana hai >> \n\nwithout this =APPKI SCOPE CHAIN CHALTI HAI = JISME HAM VARAIBLE / FUCNTION KO DHUDHTE HAI \n\nwith this = appki scope chain nai chalti balki appka object seartching chalti hai jisme ham variable / ya methods ko dhuudhte hai >>\n\nThis appke current object ko refer karega \n\n\n?? yeh appka this kaha likha hai isse decide nai krta ke kisko point karega \nappke this kisne call kiya hai usko point karega \n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THIS ::::\n\n\nit is a specail keyword jo appke object ke andar ke varaibles and methods se deal karne ke liye baana hai >> \n\nwithout this =APPKI SCOPE CHAIN CHALTI HAI = JISME HAM VARAIBLE / FUCNTION KO DHUDHTE HAI \n\nwith this = appki scope chain nai chalti balki appka object seartching chalti hai jisme ham variable / ya methods ko dhuudhte hai >>\n\nThis appke current object ko refer karega \n\n\n?? yeh appka this kaha likha hai isse decide nai krta ke kisko point karega \nappke this kisne call kiya hai usko point karega \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
