      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786305106088,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Binding : iska matalbe hai ke ham this ko kis object ke sath conneected kar rahe hai ??\nand kya yeh object ne this ko call kiya hai that comes uinder biding \n\n\n\nTypes of Binding :\n\n\nDefault binding : yeh just normal js ki tarah hoti hai [ normal js Call ];\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28.20971069398858,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Binding : iska matalbe hai ke ham this ko kis object ke sath conneected kar rahe hai ??\nand kya yeh object ne this ko call kiya hai that comes uinder biding \n\n\n\nTypes of Binding :\n\n\nDefault binding : yeh just normal js ki tarah hoti hai [ normal js Call ];\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
