      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JavaScript sochti hai\n\n\"Is function ko kisi object ne call nahi kiya.\"\n\nTo default rule apply hoga.\n\nBrowser (non-strict) → this = window\nNode.js → this alag behave kar sakta hai (module context)\nStrict mode → this = undefined",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JavaScript sochti hai\n\n\"Is function ko kisi object ne call nahi kiya.\"\n\nTo default rule apply hoga.\n\nBrowser (non-strict) → this = window\nNode.js → this alag behave kar sakta hai (module context)\nStrict mode → this = undefined",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
