      "seed": 440740212,
      "version": 39,
      "versionNonce": 786930636,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783258137400,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kab hoti hai?\n\nJab tum JavaScript ko khud bolte ho:\n\n\"Is function ka this ye object hona chahiye.\"\n\nfunction show() {\n    console.log(this.name);\n}\n\nconst user = {\n    name: \"Amardeep\"\n};\n\nshow.call(user);\n\nJavaScript sochti hai:\n\n\"Developer ne call() use kiya hai, isliye jo object pass hua hai wahi this hoga.\"\n\nthis = user\n\napply() bhi same karta hai.\n\nbind() function ko permanently kisi object se bind kar deta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kab hoti hai?\n\nJab tum JavaScript ko khud bolte ho:\n\n\"Is function ka this ye object hona chahiye.\"\n\nfunction show() {\n    console.log(this.name);\n}\n\nconst user = {\n    name: \"Amardeep\"\n};\n\nshow.call(user);\n\nJavaScript sochti hai:\n\n\"Developer ne call() use kiya hai, isliye jo object pass hua hai wahi this hoga.\"\n\nthis = user\n\napply() bhi same karta hai.\n\nbind() function ko permanently kisi object se bind kar deta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
