    {
      "id": "M8jFUyBrSXEEf6xSd5o-O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9607.518834659018,
      "y": 252.74283958616707,
      "width": 1839.2626953125,
      "height": 1400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 488385578,
      "version": 1910,
      "versionNonce": 1170023542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783449355584,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "History of hoisting :::\n\nJS 1995 de vioch ban rahi si , odo sare developers jehre siga ohho basically use karde si c, c++ , java \n\nso ehh sari langiages jehri sigiya ahh sariya sigiya Compile time language [compile time means] pehele sara code\n\nscan houga the ohho execute hoga ,\n\nede ch pehela sara code scan hunda si ==>> oss toh badd tuc function nu upper call kro niche call kro matter nai krda si \n\nokay ||| \n\n\nBUT jado JS ayi odo tuhada ahh concept nai aya si loki familier nai si ke var nal undefined kyo aunda pya ahi jado assi call rkde pye a\n\nso developer ess cheez nu keha hoisting ->>> ke tuc call kar sakde a but ohh tuhdaa auga var de case vich \n\nUNDEFINED ->>>> Let && const da case bht time badd aua si tuhada aproxx 20 years later\n\n\nQUESTION :: why peoplw who are using java and c and c++ they shift to js??\n\nIndustry booms when web di gal hoyui, now dekho abb makert ch ik asie langauge si jo web nal directly gal kardi si \n\nTHAT IS JS ->> C = OS , DRIVERS \n                    \n                    C++ = high level performance , mobile app ch use krda si \n\n                    JAVA = banking , enterprise app \n\nKOI ve langauge uss time di direcly gal nai kar sakdi si web browser nal \n\n\nso developers moves to JS -->>>>\n\n\nSEE HOITING IS NOT GIVEN BY ECMA SCRIPT -> Hositing is the informal name that is given by developers of that time \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "History of hoisting :::\n\nJS 1995 de vioch ban rahi si , odo sare developers jehre siga ohho basically use karde si c, c++ , java \n\nso ehh sari langiages jehri sigiya ahh sariya sigiya Compile time language [compile time means] pehele sara code\n\nscan houga the ohho execute hoga ,\n\nede ch pehela sara code scan hunda si ==>> oss toh badd tuc function nu upper call kro niche call kro matter nai krda si \n\nokay ||| \n\n\nBUT jado JS ayi odo tuhada ahh concept nai aya si loki familier nai si ke var nal undefined kyo aunda pya ahi jado assi call rkde pye a\n\nso developer ess cheez nu keha hoisting ->>> ke tuc call kar sakde a but ohh tuhdaa auga var de case vich \n\nUNDEFINED ->>>> Let && const da case bht time badd aua si tuhada aproxx 20 years later\n\n\nQUESTION :: why peoplw who are using java and c and c++ they shift to js??\n\nIndustry booms when web di gal hoyui, now dekho abb makert ch ik asie langauge si jo web nal directly gal kardi si \n\nTHAT IS JS ->> C = OS , DRIVERS \n                    \n                    C++ = high level performance , mobile app ch use krda si \n\n                    JAVA = banking , enterprise app \n\nKOI ve langauge uss time di direcly gal nai kar sakdi si web browser nal \n\n\nso developers moves to JS -->>>>\n\n\nSEE HOITING IS NOT GIVEN BY ECMA SCRIPT -> Hositing is the informal name that is given by developers of that time \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hGYpo24cIWnOKmgpH_iS1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9539.834837763268,
      "y": 1699.459307011541,
      "width": 2140.458740234375,
      "height": 1750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1892351734,
      "version": 2211,
      "versionNonce": 1088560118,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783450493746,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hoisting ???\n\nsee hoisting is not that thing jidde ch assi kehedne aa ke we are moving the variable scope at the top of code -> jidde nal variabel nu assi \n\ncall ya assess kar sade hai \n\n\nHoisint means ke jado tuhada execution context banda aa ->> ode ch jehre varaible decalrations hundi a ode scope nal ohnu scan karna ,\n\nodi bindiungs create karna and bad ch ohna nu ik memeroy space provide karni jidde nal exection phase chal sake properly ===HOSITINH \n\n\n\n\n\nHOISTING PHASE 3 CHEEZA TE relay karda hai :::\n\n1> Declaration   2> Bindings  3> Memeory creation phase \n\n\nDeclaration maens : JS engine ko batana ke iss name ko appne system mei register karlo -> register means agge ahh name jithe use houga tneu \npta hove ke ahh name mai kite dekhya hai pehela \n\n\nBindings :: hun siraf name nu resigter karna kafi nai aa::\n\n1> name da scope ki aa \n2> name kehre value hold karuiga \n\n3> Internal connection between name and the value sotered \n\n\nMmeory creation pashse :::\njab appka binding and declaration pahse is done tabb  apke liye ek memeory space create hogi taaki jab appka code execute ho  toh usko pta ho ke\n\nkaha jke store hona hai \n\niss phase mei ::\n1> memeory decide hogi \n2> bindings hogi yaha decide \n\n\n\nYEH SARA CONCEOPT SE HOISTING HOTI HAI  ABB SHORTLY WE CAN SAY KE WE CAN ASSIGN A VARIABLE BEFORE ITS DECLARATION [VAR CASE]\n\nNOW ABB VARAIBEL IS NOT ASSIGNED OR ACCESSED BEFROE DECALARATION ===== [TDZ LET AND CONST ]\n\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hoisting ???\n\nsee hoisting is not that thing jidde ch assi kehedne aa ke we are moving the variable scope at the top of code -> jidde nal variabel nu assi \n\ncall ya assess kar sade hai \n\n\nHoisint means ke jado tuhada execution context banda aa ->> ode ch jehre varaible decalrations hundi a ode scope nal ohnu scan karna ,\n\nodi bindiungs create karna and bad ch ohna nu ik memeroy space provide karni jidde nal exection phase chal sake properly ===HOSITINH \n\n\n\n\n\nHOISTING PHASE 3 CHEEZA TE relay karda hai :::\n\n1> Declaration   2> Bindings  3> Memeory creation phase \n\n\nDeclaration maens : JS engine ko batana ke iss name ko appne system mei register karlo -> register means agge ahh name jithe use houga tneu \npta hove ke ahh name mai kite dekhya hai pehela \n\n\nBindings :: hun siraf name nu resigter karna kafi nai aa::\n\n1> name da scope ki aa \n2> name kehre value hold karuiga \n\n3> Internal connection between name and the value sotered \n\n\nMmeory creation pashse :::\njab appka binding and declaration pahse is done tabb  apke liye ek memeory space create hogi taaki jab appka code execute ho  toh usko pta ho ke\n\nkaha jke store hona hai \n\niss phase mei ::\n1> memeory decide hogi \n2> bindings hogi yaha decide \n\n\n\nYEH SARA CONCEOPT SE HOISTING HOTI HAI  ABB SHORTLY WE CAN SAY KE WE CAN ASSIGN A VARIABLE BEFORE ITS DECLARATION [VAR CASE]\n\nNOW ABB VARAIBEL IS NOT ASSIGNED OR ACCESSED BEFROE DECALARATION ===== [TDZ LET AND CONST ]\n\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
