      "text": "| **Memory Creation Phase**                                             | **Execution Phase**                                                |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n\n| Runs first.                                                           | Runs after the Creation Phase.                                     |\n\n| Memory is allocated for variables and functions.                      | Code executes line by line.                                        |\n\n| `var` is initialized with `undefined`.                                | `var` gets its actual assigned value.                              |\n\n| `let` and `const` are hoisted but remain in TDZ (uninitialized).      | `let` and `const` are initialized when their declaration executes. |\n\n| Function declarations are stored completely in memory.                | Function calls are executed.                                       |\n\n| No code is executed.                                                  | All statements are executed.                                       |\n\n| Responsible for **Hoisting**.                                         | Responsible for actual program execution.                          |\n\n| Creates the Environment Record and initializes the Execution Context. | Uses the Environment Record and Execution Context to run the code. |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Memory Creation Phase**                                             | **Execution Phase**                                                |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n\n| Runs first.                                                           | Runs after the Creation Phase.                                     |\n\n| Memory is allocated for variables and functions.                      | Code executes line by line.                                        |\n\n| `var` is initialized with `undefined`.                                | `var` gets its actual assigned value.                              |\n\n| `let` and `const` are hoisted but remain in TDZ (uninitialized).      | `let` and `const` are initialized when their declaration executes. |\n\n| Function declarations are stored completely in memory.                | Function calls are executed.                                       |\n\n| No code is executed.                                                  | All statements are executed.                                       |\n\n| Responsible for **Hoisting**.                                         | Responsible for actual program execution.                          |\n\n| Creates the Environment Record and initializes the Execution Context. | Uses the Environment Record and Execution Context to run the code. |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
