      "updated": 1783450872853,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Var Hoisiting :::\n \nyeh hoisting basically var varaible par hoti hai , jab ham var varibel ko before decalaration use krege toh BY default appki value memory space mei \n'\nUndefuined set ho jayegi \n\nIska matalb agar ham aise likhte hai like \n\n\n\nconsole.log(a);\nvar a=10;  \n\nyaha par internaly kya hoga ek var appka pehele hi registrer ho jayega sustem mei that is like \n\n\nvar a;\n\nconsole.log(a)\n\nvar a=10 ;  ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Var Hoisiting :::\n \nyeh hoisting basically var varaible par hoti hai , jab ham var varibel ko before decalaration use krege toh BY default appki value memory space mei \n'\nUndefuined set ho jayegi \n\nIska matalb agar ham aise likhte hai like \n\n\n\nconsole.log(a);\nvar a=10;  \n\nyaha par internaly kya hoga ek var appka pehele hi registrer ho jayega sustem mei that is like \n\n\nvar a;\n\nconsole.log(a)\n\nvar a=10 ;  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
