      "text": "JavaScript Engine khud.\n\nMemory Creation Phase me engine poore code ko scan karta hai aur saari\nvar declarations ko Execution Context ke Environment Record me\nregister kar deta hai.\n\nIsliye jab baad me console.log(a) aata hai, to JavaScript ke paas a pehle\nse maujood hota hai (value undefined ke saath).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JavaScript Engine khud.\n\nMemory Creation Phase me engine poore code ko scan karta hai aur saari var declarations ko Execution Context ke Environment Record me register kar deta hai.\n\nIsliye jab baad me console.log(a) aata hai, to JavaScript ke paas a pehle se maujood hota hai (value undefined ke saath).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
