      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783451066275,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "var js mei bht dikat de raha hai developers ko abb itne salo se var use kiya hai developer nei  toh usko completely replace nai kar sakte so \n\nafter 20 years ECMA SCRIPT 6 ayi jisne basiclly appko diya LET AND CONST so that you can deal with this VAR ;",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "var js mei bht dikat de raha hai developers ko abb itne salo se var use kiya hai developer nei  toh usko completely replace nai kar sakte so \n\nafter 20 years ECMA SCRIPT 6 ayi jisne basiclly appko diya LET AND CONST so that you can deal with this VAR ;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6C5TsfVEOmerC3vdxGyb1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9502.480709321278,
      "y": 5720.46660951798,
      "width": 1988.1947021484375,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1767797942,
      "version": 534,
      "versionNonce": 457571178,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783451230779,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Problems thart you have to deal via using var ::\n\n1> what is this undefined behaviour with the code \n\nconsole .log (a) = undefined why -> chlo maan liya ek bar mei  ke MCP ne poora code scan kiya and usko a ki value nai milli toh undefined de diya /\n\n2> var donot respoect blocks {}\n\nif(true){\n    \n    var a=10;\n    \n    }\n\nconsole.log(a) == now abb dekho ke a bhar accessible ho gya kyoki var har variable ko at ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Problems thart you have to deal via using var ::\n\n1> what is this undefined behaviour with the code \n\nconsole .log (a) = undefined why -> chlo maan liya ek bar mei  ke MCP ne poora code scan kiya and usko a ki value nai milli toh undefined de diya /\n\n2> var donot respoect blocks {}\n\nif(true){\n    \n    var a=10;\n    \n    }\n\nconsole.log(a) == now abb dekho ke a bhar accessible ho gya kyoki var har variable ko at ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y3yVrIBWrdm43foT7sdsC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9494.289981261021,
      "y": 6324.534307638569,
      "width": 2036.6627197265625,
      "height": 560,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 874096874,
      "version": 545,
      "versionNonce": 1061167670,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783452212474,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "var function ke andar poore function me accessible hota hai, aur function ke bahar declare ho to poore global scope me accessible hota hai.\n isi liye yeh scope ko kuch smaj ta hi  nai hai \n\n\n3> bar bar var reassign, redecalrre ho jata hai iski wajah se agar varible name same ho toh woh value ko overwrite kar deta hai \n\nvar a =10 \nvar a=20 \nvar a=30;\n\nso yeh sari problems karke developoers the pareshan so they decided to shift towards ECMA SCRIPT 6 jisne concept diya appka Let and Const ka \n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "var function ke andar poore function me accessible hota hai, aur function ke bahar declare ho to poore global scope me accessible hota hai.\n isi liye yeh scope ko kuch smaj ta hi  nai hai \n\n\n3> bar bar var reassign, redecalrre ho jata hai iski wajah se agar varible name same ho toh woh value ko overwrite kar deta hai \n\nvar a =10 \nvar a=20 \nvar a=30;\n\nso yeh sari problems karke developoers the pareshan so they decided to shift towards ECMA SCRIPT 6 jisne concept diya appka Let and Const ka \n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "i8tjBtmTs3qHP-IY7UGqo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9485.075399174388,
      "y": 6927.919466785543,
      "width": 1994.1304931640625,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1382782198,
      "version": 1059,
      "versionNonce": 1749904566,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783452380265,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ECMA script 6 LET AND COSNT ::\n\ndono theory di gayi thi undefined ko dekh ke ke undefined ki problems se ham ksie sol de saktee hai \n\nJAISE appko pta hai ke let and cosnt ka main reason security basis par tha jab ham large projects use krte hai wha bht cheeze ,matter karti ha \n\nlet and const \n\n1> block scoped in nature jisse appki {} respect walo batt ho jato thi solve \n\n2> TDZ has introduced in this jisse appki predefined [undef weali problem solve ho gayi hai ]\n\n3> let [reassign ho salda hai ] ,const tuhada ohh ve nai ho sakda \n\n\nSOL THEY PROVIDED :\n\n1. your undeined thing gets replaced by TDZ \n\n2. No redecalrations , are allowed so appke value jo ek bar dedi woh secure ho jati hai as a cosntant \n\n3.bar bar same varible name app use nai kar sakte in cosnt / let",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ECMA script 6 LET AND COSNT ::\n\ndono theory di gayi thi undefined ko dekh ke ke undefined ki problems se ham ksie sol de saktee hai \n\nJAISE appko pta hai ke let and cosnt ka main reason security basis par tha jab ham large projects use krte hai wha bht cheeze ,matter karti ha \n\nlet and const \n\n1> block scoped in nature jisse appki {} respect walo batt ho jato thi solve \n\n2> TDZ has introduced in this jisse appki predefined [undef weali problem solve ho gayi hai ]\n\n3> let [reassign ho salda hai ] ,const tuhada ohh ve nai ho sakda \n\n\nSOL THEY PROVIDED :\n\n1. your undeined thing gets replaced by TDZ \n\n2. No redecalrations , are allowed so appke value jo ek bar dedi woh secure ho jati hai as a cosntant \n\n3.bar bar same varible name app use nai kar sakte in cosnt / let",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YtIq_uwqTueQ7FdezKXeG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9451.288528756217,
      "y": 7814.226794628899,
      "width": 2002.222412109375,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 764819254,
      "version": 1003,
      "versionNonce": 943664694,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783452801112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TDZ ???\n\nT=time period D=Durartionkab tak access nai kar sakte   Z=zone\n\n\ndekho jaise memerory creatiuobn phse mei ham bina variable decalartion ko var ke case mei undefined provide krte the woh cheez totally wrong thi \n\nke ham ksie bina actual code tak pauche usko undefined decalre kar diya gya -> iss cheez ko replace kiya hai TDZ nei \n\n\nTDZ kheta hai ke jab tak tum actual code ke varaiobel tak nai  pauch jate ho appka  woh scope is at risk \n\nmatalb jab tak app main code ko access nai kar lete app ka varaible useable nai hai tab tak app TDZ mei ho isme undefined nai store hota as var \n\nso jab app actual code ko access karloge then app appne code ko execture kar sakte hai tab tak sorry hai appka \n\n\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TDZ ???\n\nT=time period D=Durartionkab tak access nai kar sakte   Z=zone\n\n\ndekho jaise memerory creatiuobn phse mei ham bina variable decalartion ko var ke case mei undefined provide krte the woh cheez totally wrong thi \n\nke ham ksie bina actual code tak pauche usko undefined decalre kar diya gya -> iss cheez ko replace kiya hai TDZ nei \n\n\nTDZ kheta hai ke jab tak tum actual code ke varaiobel tak nai  pauch jate ho appka  woh scope is at risk \n\nmatalb jab tak app main code ko access nai kar lete app ka varaible useable nai hai tab tak app TDZ mei ho isme undefined nai store hota as var \n\nso jab app actual code ko access karloge then app appne code ko execture kar sakte hai tab tak sorry hai appka \n\n\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L9dNjqi_5QPc8JdJwgmV1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9927.881736393483,
      "y": 8437.153330189565,
      "width": 759.3035888671875,
      "height": 3605,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1525526634,
      "version": 229,
      "versionNonce": 980292202,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783453002387,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// =========================\n// MEMORY CREATION PHASE\n// =========================\n\n// JavaScript poora code scan karti hai.\n\n// var a\n// ------------------------\n// Variable Environment\n// a -> undefined\n\n// let b\n// ------------------------\n// Lexical Environment\n// b -> <uninitialized>\n// (TDZ Start)\n\n// =========================\n// EXECUTION PHASE\n// =========================\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 1\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(a);\n\n// Environment Record\n// a -> undefined\n\n// Output:\n// undefined\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 2\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(b);\n\n// JavaScript b ko Lexical Environment me dhoondti hai.\n\n// Mil gaya?  ✅ Yes\n\n// Kya initialized hai? ❌ No\n\n// b abhi TDZ me hai.\n\n// Output:\n// ReferenceError:\n// Cannot access 'b' before initialization\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 3\n// ------------------------\n\nvar a = 10;\n\n// Actually:\n\n// var a;      // Already ho chuka\n// a = 10;     // Ab value assign hui\n\n// Variable Environment\n\n// a -> 10\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 4\n// ------------------------\n\nlet b = 20;\n\n// Declaration execute hui.\n\n// TDZ End\n\n// Lexical Environment\n\n// b -> 20\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 5\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(a);\n\n// Output:\n// 10\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 6\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(b);\n\n// Output:\n// 20",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// =========================\n// MEMORY CREATION PHASE\n// =========================\n\n// JavaScript poora code scan karti hai.\n\n// var a\n// ------------------------\n// Variable Environment\n// a -> undefined\n\n// let b\n// ------------------------\n// Lexical Environment\n// b -> <uninitialized>\n// (TDZ Start)\n\n// =========================\n// EXECUTION PHASE\n// =========================\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 1\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(a);\n\n// Environment Record\n// a -> undefined\n\n// Output:\n// undefined\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 2\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(b);\n\n// JavaScript b ko Lexical Environment me dhoondti hai.\n\n// Mil gaya?  ✅ Yes\n\n// Kya initialized hai? ❌ No\n\n// b abhi TDZ me hai.\n\n// Output:\n// ReferenceError:\n// Cannot access 'b' before initialization\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 3\n// ------------------------\n\nvar a = 10;\n\n// Actually:\n\n// var a;      // Already ho chuka\n// a = 10;     // Ab value assign hui\n\n// Variable Environment\n\n// a -> 10\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 4\n// ------------------------\n\nlet b = 20;\n\n// Declaration execute hui.\n\n// TDZ End\n\n// Lexical Environment\n\n// b -> 20\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 5\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(a);\n\n// Output:\n// 10\n\n\n// ------------------------\n// Line 6\n// ------------------------\n\nconsole.log(b);\n\n// Output:\n// 20",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
