      "text": "let aur const Memory Creation Phase me hi Lexical Environment me store ho\njate hain, lekin uninitialized state me hote hain. Ye declaration execute hone tak\nTemporal Dead Zone (TDZ) me rehte hain. Jaise hi declaration execute hoti hai\naur initial value assign hoti hai, variable initialize ho jata hai aur TDZ khatam\nho jati hai.",
