      "seed": 1303101354,
      "version": 74,
      "versionNonce": 1571855222,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783453512139,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Feature**                              | **`var`**                    | **`let`**                        | **`const`**                               |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n\n| Hoisted                                  | ✅ Yes                        | ✅ Yes                            | ✅ Yes                                     |\n\n| Memory Allocation                        | Variable Environment         | Lexical Environment              | Lexical Environment                       |\n\n| Initial Value (Memory Creation Phase)    | `undefined`                  | Uninitialized                    | Uninitialized                             |\n\n| Accessible Before Declaration            | ✅ Yes                        | ❌ No                             | ❌ No                                      |\n\n| Value Before Declaration                 | `undefined`                  | ReferenceError                   | ReferenceError                            |\n\n| TDZ (Temporal Dead Zone)                 | ❌ No                         | ✅ Yes                            | ✅ Yes                                     |\n\n| Initialization Required                  | ❌ No                         | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes (must initialize)                   |\n\n| Can be Declared Without Value            | ✅ Yes                        | ✅ Yes                            | ❌ No                                      |\n\n| Redeclaration (Same Scope)               | ✅ Allowed                    | ❌ Not Allowed                    | ❌ Not Allowed                             |\n\n| Reassignment                             | ✅ Allowed                    | ✅ Allowed                        | ❌ Not Allowed                             |\n\n| Scope                                    | Function / Global            | Block                            | Block                                     |\n\n| Attached to Global Object (Global Scope) | ✅ Yes (`window` in browsers) | ❌ No                             | ❌ No                                      |\n\n| Hoisting Behavior                        | Hoisted with `undefined`     | Hoisted but remains in TDZ       | Hoisted but remains in TDZ                |\n\n| Error Before Declaration                 | ❌ No Error                   | ✅ ReferenceError                 | ✅ ReferenceError                          |\n\n| Best Use Case                            | Legacy code                  | Variables whose value can change | Variables whose value should never change |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Feature**                              | **`var`**                    | **`let`**                        | **`const`**                               |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n\n| Hoisted                                  | ✅ Yes                        | ✅ Yes                            | ✅ Yes                                     |\n\n| Memory Allocation                        | Variable Environment         | Lexical Environment              | Lexical Environment                       |\n\n| Initial Value (Memory Creation Phase)    | `undefined`                  | Uninitialized                    | Uninitialized                             |\n\n| Accessible Before Declaration            | ✅ Yes                        | ❌ No                             | ❌ No                                      |\n\n| Value Before Declaration                 | `undefined`                  | ReferenceError                   | ReferenceError                            |\n\n| TDZ (Temporal Dead Zone)                 | ❌ No                         | ✅ Yes                            | ✅ Yes                                     |\n\n| Initialization Required                  | ❌ No                         | ❌ No                             | ✅ Yes (must initialize)                   |\n\n| Can be Declared Without Value            | ✅ Yes                        | ✅ Yes                            | ❌ No                                      |\n\n| Redeclaration (Same Scope)               | ✅ Allowed                    | ❌ Not Allowed                    | ❌ Not Allowed                             |\n\n| Reassignment                             | ✅ Allowed                    | ✅ Allowed                        | ❌ Not Allowed                             |\n\n| Scope                                    | Function / Global            | Block                            | Block                                     |\n\n| Attached to Global Object (Global Scope) | ✅ Yes (`window` in browsers) | ❌ No                             | ❌ No                                      |\n\n| Hoisting Behavior                        | Hoisted with `undefined`     | Hoisted but remains in TDZ       | Hoisted but remains in TDZ                |\n\n| Error Before Declaration                 | ❌ No Error                   | ✅ ReferenceError                 | ✅ ReferenceError                          |\n\n| Best Use Case                            | Legacy code                  | Variables whose value can change | Variables whose value should never change |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CzMUEO0_Ennoz7ZgQ4p9Z",
      "type": "rectangle",
