    },
    {
      "id": "0AG8M9nSwQay7wQBFiSMd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9332.53615293074,
      "y": 16284.693106314888,
      "width": 1997.367431640625,
      "height": 560,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b46",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 975867382,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 1370553782,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783453870481,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Feature**                            | **Function Declaration Hoisting**          | **Function Expression Hoisting**                            |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| What is Hoisted?                       | Entire function (name + body)              | Only the variable (`var`, `let`, or `const`)                |\n\n| Function Available Before Declaration? | ✅ Yes                                      | ❌ No                                                        |\n\n| Memory Creation Phase                  | Complete function is stored in memory.     | Variable is created (`var → undefined`, `let/const → TDZ`).\n |\n| Execution Before Declaration           | Works correctly.                           | Throws an error.                                            |\n\n| `var` Behavior                         | Not applicable                             | `TypeError: ... is not a function`                          |\n\n| `let` / `const` Behavior               | Not applicable                             | `ReferenceError` (TDZ)                                      |\n\n| Hoisting Result                        | Function can be called before declaration. | Function cannot be called before assignment.                |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Feature**                            | **Function Declaration Hoisting**          | **Function Expression Hoisting**                            |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| What is Hoisted?                       | Entire function (name + body)              | Only the variable (`var`, `let`, or `const`)                |\n\n| Function Available Before Declaration? | ✅ Yes                                      | ❌ No                                                        |\n\n| Memory Creation Phase                  | Complete function is stored in memory.     | Variable is created (`var → undefined`, `let/const → TDZ`).\n |\n| Execution Before Declaration           | Works correctly.                           | Throws an error.                                            |\n\n| `var` Behavior                         | Not applicable                             | `TypeError: ... is not a function`                          |\n\n| `let` / `const` Behavior               | Not applicable                             | `ReferenceError` (TDZ)                                      |\n\n| Hoisting Result                        | Function can be called before declaration. | Function cannot be called before assignment.                |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
