      "updated": 1784058447199,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VARIBELE ::\n\nvarible is used to store the data this the the common defination that everybody knowis\n\nVarible is going to store the referncees of the data which points to a paricaluar memory address in the disk space .\n\nmatalb variabel ek tuhada ek memory location da adress nu as a refernce sotre karda hai ,\n\njado tuhdaa koi identifier auga varible de nal ohnu ik env reacoed bana ke rakh lauga and uss recoed toh varible di value nu access karluga .\n\n\n\nTYPES OF VARIBLE ::::\n\n1. var :: it is a global and fucntoin scoperd varible . jado assi varible nu decalre karege inside bloack -> ek usnu kuch nai smajda -> ie is \nit is not going to deal woth blocck scoper things .",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VARIBELE ::\n\nvarible is used to store the data this the the common defination that everybody knowis\n\nVarible is going to store the referncees of the data which points to a paricaluar memory address in the disk space .\n\nmatalb variabel ek tuhada ek memory location da adress nu as a refernce sotre karda hai ,\n\njado tuhdaa koi identifier auga varible de nal ohnu ik env reacoed bana ke rakh lauga and uss recoed toh varible di value nu access karluga .\n\n\n\nTYPES OF VARIBLE ::::\n\n1. var :: it is a global and fucntoin scoperd varible . jado assi varible nu decalre karege inside bloack -> ek usnu kuch nai smajda -> ie is \nit is not going to deal woth blocck scoper things .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZookuH89xC9VLCbcpWeqI",
