      "updated": 1784058845817,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "why it is only blocked scoped in nature because it is intorduced in 1995 when there is only global scope and fucntion scope hi the \n\nuss time par developers feel nai kar paye the need of blocked scoper -> AFTER 20 years -> ECMA script 6 ayi >\n\nLET and CONST aye jo ki bht hi jarurui the \n\n\nvar -  declare , redeclare , assign , reasign al things can be possible at that time -> this is the biggest drawback of that time .\n\n\n        ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "why it is only blocked scoped in nature because it is intorduced in 1995 when there is only global scope and fucntion scope hi the \n\nuss time par developers feel nai kar paye the need of blocked scoper -> AFTER 20 years -> ECMA script 6 ayi >\n\nLET and CONST aye jo ki bht hi jarurui the \n\n\nvar -  declare , redeclare , assign , reasign al things can be possible at that time -> this is the biggest drawback of that time .\n\n\n        ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BMq9eXLNqhqjSP2TgtYEp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16026.360512058935,
      "y": -190.00814528059936,
      "width": 1420.6368408203125,
      "height": 2345,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 590533920,
      "version": 674,
      "versionNonce": 1782750432,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784058828389,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Global Scope (var)\nvar a = 10;\n\nconsole.log(a);\nFlow\nGlobal Scope\n+--------------------------+\n| var a = 10;              |\n|                          |\n| console.log(a); ✅       | \n+--------------------------+\n\nOutput\n\n10\n\n👉 a poore program mein kahin bhi use ho sakta hai.\n\n2. Function Scope (var)\nfunction demo() {\n    var a = 10;\n\n    console.log(a);\n}\n\ndemo();\nFlow\nFunction demo()\n+--------------------------+\n| var a = 10;              |\n|                          |\n| console.log(a); ✅       |\n+--------------------------+\n\nOutput\n\n10\n\n👉 a sirf demo() function ke andar hi use ho sakta hai.\n\n3. var Block ko Ignore karta hai\nfunction demo() {\n\n    if (true) {\n        var a = 10;\n    }\n\n    console.log(a);\n}\n\ndemo();\nFlow\nFunction Scope\n+--------------------------------+\n|                                |\n| if(true){                      |\n|    var a = 10;                 |\n| }                              |\n|                                |\n| console.log(a); ✅             |\n+--------------------------------+\n\nOutput\n\n10\n\n👉 var if {}, for {}, while {} jaise blocks ko ignore karta hai aur poore function mein available rehta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Global Scope (var)\nvar a = 10;\n\nconsole.log(a);\nFlow\nGlobal Scope\n+--------------------------+\n| var a = 10;              |\n|                          |\n| console.log(a); ✅       | \n+--------------------------+\n\nOutput\n\n10\n\n👉 a poore program mein kahin bhi use ho sakta hai.\n\n2. Function Scope (var)\nfunction demo() {\n    var a = 10;\n\n    console.log(a);\n}\n\ndemo();\nFlow\nFunction demo()\n+--------------------------+\n| var a = 10;              |\n|                          |\n| console.log(a); ✅       |\n+--------------------------+\n\nOutput\n\n10\n\n👉 a sirf demo() function ke andar hi use ho sakta hai.\n\n3. var Block ko Ignore karta hai\nfunction demo() {\n\n    if (true) {\n        var a = 10;\n    }\n\n    console.log(a);\n}\n\ndemo();\nFlow\nFunction Scope\n+--------------------------------+\n|                                |\n| if(true){                      |\n|    var a = 10;                 |\n| }                              |\n|                                |\n| console.log(a); ✅             |\n+--------------------------------+\n\nOutput\n\n10\n\n👉 var if {}, for {}, while {} jaise blocks ko ignore karta hai aur poore function mein available rehta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
