      "updated": 1784059113155,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "let and const --- IT is was introuduced as to overcome the issue that is\ncreated during var , and what are the possibilities that what can hapen in\nfuture ahead  ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "let and const --- IT is was introuduced as to overcome the issue that is created during var , and what are the possibilities that what can hapen in future ahead  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HgYE-FO7FqeEKhABfBWv9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13612.000531514483,
      "y": 1750.5820653000007,
      "width": 1329.663330078125,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
