    {
      "id": "wM6jbl86_2f-sRrrFG5_c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13620.111498514816,
      "y": 2551.138219339172,
      "width": 1827.418701171875,
      "height": 1645,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 225470609,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 25027711,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784059746771,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Working and Internal mecahnism :::\n\n\nExample\nlet age = 24;\n\nIs line mein 3 cheezein hoti hain:\n\nVariable Name → age\nMemory Address → maan lo 0x100\nValue → 24\n\nMemory kuch is tarah socho:\n\nVariable Table\n\nage  ─────────► 0x100\n\nAur memory mein:\n\nAddress      Value\n0x100   ───► 24\n\nYaani:\n\nage khud value nahi hai.\nage ek naam (identifier) hai.\n\nJavaScript engine ke paas ek record hota hai jisme likha hota hai:\n\nage → 0x100\nJab tum console.log(age) likhte ho, engine:\nage ko dhoondta hai.\nUska memory address (0x100) nikalta hai.\nAddress 0x100 par jaakar value 24 laata hai.\nAgar value change karo\nage = 30;\n\nAb:\n\nVariable Table\n\nage ─────────► 0x100\nAddress      Value\n0x100   ───► 30\n\nAddress wahi reh sakta hai, sirf value update ho jaati hai (engine implementation ke hisaab se ye internally optimize bhi ho sakta hai).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Working and Internal mecahnism :::\n\n\nExample\nlet age = 24;\n\nIs line mein 3 cheezein hoti hain:\n\nVariable Name → age\nMemory Address → maan lo 0x100\nValue → 24\n\nMemory kuch is tarah socho:\n\nVariable Table\n\nage  ─────────► 0x100\n\nAur memory mein:\n\nAddress      Value\n0x100   ───► 24\n\nYaani:\n\nage khud value nahi hai.\nage ek naam (identifier) hai.\n\nJavaScript engine ke paas ek record hota hai jisme likha hota hai:\n\nage → 0x100\nJab tum console.log(age) likhte ho, engine:\nage ko dhoondta hai.\nUska memory address (0x100) nikalta hai.\nAddress 0x100 par jaakar value 24 laata hai.\nAgar value change karo\nage = 30;\n\nAb:\n\nVariable Table\n\nage ─────────► 0x100\nAddress      Value\n0x100   ───► 30\n\nAddress wahi reh sakta hai, sirf value update ho jaati hai (engine implementation ke hisaab se ye internally optimize bhi ho sakta hai).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
