      "text": "           Variable Name\n                │\n                ▼\n        +----------------+\n        | Environment    |\n        | Record         |\n        +----------------+\n        | a → 0x101      |\n        +----------------+\n                │\n                ▼\n         Memory Address\n            0x101\n                │\n                ▼\n        +----------------+\n        | Value = 2      |\n        +----------------+",
