    },
    {
      "id": "nF3k9YXSYZI2gK28lBWVX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13816.064182463153,
      "y": 5446.994797772495,
      "width": 2483.850341796875,
      "height": 770,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 503760305,
      "version": 1128,
      "versionNonce": 489182911,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784062325988,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data types defines the type of data the varaible is sotring in it . -> variable ya data store akr raha hai uske bare mei batata hai . weahter it is sotring a sting , number , boolean , \n\nor  any other thing ...\n\n\n\nJS is dynamicaly typed lamgiga e-> jaha par appko data kya sote karn ahai uska type nai batana padta hai . it will auto sense that weather quotes are there or true/false \nhai kya woh dekh lega and appne app judge kar leya hai \n\n\nlike C and java usme data ke sath uska type bhji define karna pdta hai ::: \n\nstring name = \"aman\";\n\nnumber a=12;\n\n\nThere are two groups that classsify whole data types :::::\n\nPRIMITIVE DATA TYPE ::: in this you just have data ie : immutable in nature , it is a finite value = pakki value hogi \n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data types defines the type of data the varaible is sotring in it . -> variable ya data store akr raha hai uske bare mei batata hai . weahter it is sotring a sting , number , boolean , \n\nor  any other thing ...\n\n\n\nJS is dynamicaly typed lamgiga e-> jaha par appko data kya sote karn ahai uska type nai batana padta hai . it will auto sense that weather quotes are there or true/false \nhai kya woh dekh lega and appne app judge kar leya hai \n\n\nlike C and java usme data ke sath uska type bhji define karna pdta hai ::: \n\nstring name = \"aman\";\n\nnumber a=12;\n\n\nThere are two groups that classsify whole data types :::::\n\nPRIMITIVE DATA TYPE ::: in this you just have data ie : immutable in nature , it is a finite value = pakki value hogi \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8UIx_d96-5GPILrgFWeGH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13887.730861845477,
      "y": 6246.994746909863,
      "width": 2365.98291015625,
      "height": 855.9999999999997,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1529017087,
      "version": 152,
      "versionNonce": 100746545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784062454227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Data Type     | Single-Line Definition                                                 |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Number**    | Stores numeric values (integers and floating-point numbers).           |\n\n| **String**    | Stores a sequence of characters enclosed in quotes.                    |\n\n| **Boolean**   | Stores only two values: `true` or `false`.                             |\n\n| **Undefined** | Represents a variable that has been declared but not assigned a value. |\n\n| **Null**      | Represents the intentional absence of any value.                       |\n\n| **Symbol**    | Represents a unique and immutable identifier. jo change nai hogi hamesha unique create karega   \n\n| **BigInt**    | Stores very large integers beyond the safe `Number` limit.    \n",
      "fontSize": 42.79999999999998,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Data Type     | Single-Line Definition                                                 |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Number**    | Stores numeric values (integers and floating-point numbers).           |\n\n| **String**    | Stores a sequence of characters enclosed in quotes.                    |\n\n| **Boolean**   | Stores only two values: `true` or `false`.                             |\n\n| **Undefined** | Represents a variable that has been declared but not assigned a value. |\n\n| **Null**      | Represents the intentional absence of any value.                       |\n\n| **Symbol**    | Represents a unique and immutable identifier. jo change nai hogi hamesha unique create karega   \n\n| **BigInt**    | Stores very large integers beyond the safe `Number` limit.    \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
