      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784062763643,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Data Type    | Single-Line Definition                                                       |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Object**   | Stores data as key-value pairs.                                              |\n\n| **Array**    | Stores an ordered collection of multiple values.                             |\n\n| **Function** | A reusable block of code that performs a specific task.                      |\n\n| **Date**     | Represents and works with dates and times.                                   |\n\n| **RegExp**   | Represents a pattern used for searching and matching text.                   |\n                                 |\n",
      "fontSize": 44.88889058430983,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Data Type    | Single-Line Definition                                                       |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Object**   | Stores data as key-value pairs.                                              |\n\n| **Array**    | Stores an ordered collection of multiple values.                             |\n\n| **Function** | A reusable block of code that performs a specific task.                      |\n\n| **Date**     | Represents and works with dates and times.                                   |\n\n| **RegExp**   | Represents a pattern used for searching and matching text.                   |\n                                 |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
