      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784065006277,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TC is a process where you convert one the data type form one type to antoher based the situation ,\n\nyou can convert the type via 2 methods ::\n\n1. explicit type converion \n2. implicit type conversion \n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TC is a process where you convert one the data type form one type to antoher based the situation ,\n\nyou can convert the type via 2 methods ::\n\n1. explicit type converion \n2. implicit type conversion \n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Jcw5IvyNqXMjJsbB4HrAC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13834.730320158465,
      "y": 8715.32795308662,
      "width": 2135.447509765625,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
