      "seed": 1787249695,
      "version": 324,
      "versionNonce": 1057750769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784065098712,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "yeh dono type conversion data type convert kardrti hai as JS is dynamacically and loosely typed langiage so that is why \n\nit is allowing you to do this otherwise converting type is not self suffiecnt .\n\n\n  ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "yeh dono type conversion data type convert kardrti hai as JS is dynamacically and loosely typed langiage so that is why \n\nit is allowing you to do this otherwise converting type is not self suffiecnt .\n\n\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "w0WRZaIinCgLjDZVotL8U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13838.73025912331,
      "y": 8963.327861533886,
      "width": 2038,
      "height": 810,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 189822911,
      "version": 69,
      "versionNonce": 1808596127,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784065214574,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature               | Type Coercion                           | Type Casting                                       |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\\\n\n| **Meaning**           | JavaScript khud type convert karta hai. | Programmer khud type convert karta hai.      |\n| **Who converts?**     | JavaScript                              | Developer/Programmer                              \n\n| **Conversion Type**   | Implicit (Automatic)                    | Explicit (Manual)                                  |\n\n| **Control**           | JavaScript ke paas                      | Programmer ke paas                                 |\n\n| **Need of Functions** | ❌ Nahi                                  | ✅ Haan (`Number()`, `String()`, `Boolean()`, etc.) \n|\n| **Code Example**      | `\"5\" - 2`                               | `Number(\"5\") - 2`                                  |\n\n| **Output**            | `3`                                     | `3`                                                |\n\n| **Interview Keyword** | Automatic Conversion                    | Manual Conversion                                  |\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature               | Type Coercion                           | Type Casting                                       |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\\\n\n| **Meaning**           | JavaScript khud type convert karta hai. | Programmer khud type convert karta hai.      |\n| **Who converts?**     | JavaScript                              | Developer/Programmer                              \n\n| **Conversion Type**   | Implicit (Automatic)                    | Explicit (Manual)                                  |\n\n| **Control**           | JavaScript ke paas                      | Programmer ke paas                                 |\n\n| **Need of Functions** | ❌ Nahi                                  | ✅ Haan (`Number()`, `String()`, `Boolean()`, etc.) \n|\n| **Code Example**      | `\"5\" - 2`                               | `Number(\"5\") - 2`                                  |\n\n| **Output**            | `3`                                     | `3`                                                |\n\n| **Interview Keyword** | Automatic Conversion                    | Manual Conversion                                  |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
