    {
      "id": "pnIqcvtsoNluWXUW3669N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13305.1747476487,
      "y": 13609.883383181035,
      "width": 1815.875732421875,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 944068145,
      "version": 381,
      "versionNonce": 1457046943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784077050867,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Type Corocion :::\n\nin this js enggine will convert the type automatically ->  here based on the abstract operations ,\n\nand what is the condition of the statement , where it is leading the js engine based on that sacnmerio\n\nyour type is converted .\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Type Corocion :::\n\nin this js enggine will convert the type automatically ->  here based on the abstract operations ,\n\nand what is the condition of the statement , where it is leading the js engine based on that sacnmerio\n\nyour type is converted .\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vVxZ7Ugul-Oe4K-qwbOUV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13301.841388884051,
      "y": 14056.550100710332,
      "width": 1811.087646484375,
      "height": 990,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1139113503,
      "version": 864,
      "versionNonce": 379248881,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784077546010,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. TO STRING ::\n\nnow ab isme maine to STRING MEI CONCVERT KARNA HAI CHEEZO KO .\n\nyou have to follow abstract opertaiion ECMA script rules ::\n\nlike you hve to see that - \n\nWhat is your opertor [+.-.*,%]  , [<,>,<=,>=] , [== , ===]\\\n\nwhat is your operands  -- string , number , boolean , kya hai ??\n\nkoi special opertor jaise cheez toh nai hai kya woh bhi check kro ??\n\nab iske badd main cheez ke ::\n\nagar koi operand string hai and opertor hai + ka no matter agge kya hai sab string banke judd jayega .\n\n\nagar aise nai hai toh sab convert kro numbers mei -> sopecial cases ko bhar rakho side mei .\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. TO STRING ::\n\nnow ab isme maine to STRING MEI CONCVERT KARNA HAI CHEEZO KO .\n\nyou have to follow abstract opertaiion ECMA script rules ::\n\nlike you hve to see that - \n\nWhat is your opertor [+.-.*,%]  , [<,>,<=,>=] , [== , ===]\\\n\nwhat is your operands  -- string , number , boolean , kya hai ??\n\nkoi special opertor jaise cheez toh nai hai kya woh bhi check kro ??\n\nab iske badd main cheez ke ::\n\nagar koi operand string hai and opertor hai + ka no matter agge kya hai sab string banke judd jayega .\n\n\nagar aise nai hai toh sab convert kro numbers mei -> sopecial cases ko bhar rakho side mei .\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-v94wAhrYs0stvKFevVIH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13293.508106413348,
      "y": 15113.216741945685,
      "width": 1989.5035400390625,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1142282897,
      "version": 563,
      "versionNonce": 1484243327,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784078353878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "eg : 5+\"5\" hai -> string \n\n        5+true hai  -> numebr mei convert krdo \n\n\n\n2. To numebr -> abb conversion hogi numbers ko dekh kar , operand mei + ka sign nai hai and koi aur sign hai then\n\nwoh number mei convert hoga :\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "eg : 5+\"5\" hai -> string \n\n        5+true hai  -> numebr mei convert krdo \n\n\n\n2. To numebr -> abb conversion hogi numbers ko dekh kar , operand mei + ka sign nai hai and koi aur sign hai then\n\nwoh number mei convert hoga :\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7EI1tBVcCry0zd-ta8BvG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13265.1747476487,
      "y": 15689.883408612355,
      "width": 2579.0029296875,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 942058943,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 160333663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784079637292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Value               | `ToNumber()` Result                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `true`              | `1`                                                                                                                     |\n| `false`             | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `null`              | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `undefined`         | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `\"\"` (empty string) | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `\" \"` (spaces only) | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `\"10\"`              | `10`                                                                                                                    |\n| `\"10.5\"`            | `10.5`                                                                                                                  |\n| `\"0010\"`            | `10`                                                                                                                    |\n| `\"0x10\"`            | `16`                                                                                                                    |\n| `\"abc\"`             | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `\"10abc\"`           | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `NaN`               | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `Infinity`          | `Infinity`                                                                                                              |\n| `-Infinity`         | `-Infinity`                                                                                                             |\n| `0`                 | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `-0`                | `-0`                                                                                                                    |\n| `10n` (BigInt)      | `10` *(via the abstract operation; note that mixing `BigInt` and `Number` directly in arithmetic throws a `TypeError`)* |\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Value               | `ToNumber()` Result                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `true`              | `1`                                                                                                                     |\n| `false`             | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `null`              | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `undefined`         | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `\"\"` (empty string) | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `\" \"` (spaces only) | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `\"10\"`              | `10`                                                                                                                    |\n| `\"10.5\"`            | `10.5`                                                                                                                  |\n| `\"0010\"`            | `10`                                                                                                                    |\n| `\"0x10\"`            | `16`                                                                                                                    |\n| `\"abc\"`             | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `\"10abc\"`           | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `NaN`               | `NaN`                                                                                                                   |\n| `Infinity`          | `Infinity`                                                                                                              |\n| `-Infinity`         | `-Infinity`                                                                                                             |\n| `0`                 | `0`                                                                                                                     |\n| `-0`                | `-0`                                                                                                                    |\n| `10n` (BigInt)      | `10` *(via the abstract operation; note that mixing `BigInt` and `Number` directly in arithmetic throws a `TypeError`)* |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "O5CcI6XXc0SL5RWXvLBq5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13211.841407957538,
      "y": 16788.216818239638,
      "width": 1450.439453125,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5w",
