      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "to primitive hoga usjing abstract opertations -> abb abstract opertations ka concoipt kaya tha ECMA script mei so -> this is not the topics of js , these comes under\n\nECMA script -> Echma script are the rules given to the alngiage .\n\nabstract operators are the helpers hidden features that basically is done by the js engine not by the manually .\n\nTOPRIMITIVE ()     ,      TOSTRING()        ,    TO NUMBER()                   , TOBOOLEAN()  ",
