      "text": "Group 1  → Basic Operators\n      ↓\nGroup 2  → ToNumber\n      ↓\nGroup 3  → ToBoolean\n      ↓\nGroup 4  → ==\n      ↓\nGroup 5  → ===\n      ↓\nGroup 6  → ToPrimitive\n      ↓\nGroup 7  → Truthy / Falsy\n      ↓\nGroup 8  → && || !\n      ↓\nGroup 9  → Mixed Abstract Operations\n      ↓\nGroup 10 → Expert Level",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Group 1  → Basic Operators\n      ↓\nGroup 2  → ToNumber\n      ↓\nGroup 3  → ToBoolean\n      ↓\nGroup 4  → ==\n      ↓\nGroup 5  → ===\n      ↓\nGroup 6  → ToPrimitive\n      ↓\nGroup 7  → Truthy / Falsy\n      ↓\nGroup 8  → && || !\n      ↓\nGroup 9  → Mixed Abstract Operations\n      ↓\nGroup 10 → Expert Level",
      "autoResize": true,
