      "updated": 1784163436537,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "15. Nullish Coalescing (??) → Sirf null ya undefined hone par default value deta hai.\n0 ?? 100\n// 0\n\n\n\n16. Optional Chaining (?.) → Agar property exist na kare to error ki jagah undefined return karta hai.\nuser?.address?.city",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
