      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "15. Nullish Coalescing (??) → Sirf null ya undefined hone par default value deta hai.\n0 ?? 100\n// 0\n\n\n\n16. Optional Chaining (?.) → Agar property exist na kare to error ki jagah undefined return karta hai.\nuser?.address?.city",
      "autoResize": true,
