    {
      "id": "plK8B32ppRUdn1iFDcq0A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12212.0428355271,
      "y": 25969.626148387117,
      "width": 1001.5819091796875,
      "height": 1085,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1446290853,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 583428363,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784163487447,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "17. Conditional (Ternary) (? :) → Short form if...else.\nage >= 18 ? \"Adult\" : \"Minor\"\n\n\n\n\n18. String Concatenation (+) → Strings ko jodta hai.\n\"Hello \" + \"World\"\n// \"Hello World\"\n\n\n\n19. typeof → Value ka data type batata hai.\ntypeof 10\n// \"number\"\n\n\n\n20. delete → Object ki property delete karta hai.\ndelete user.name;\n\n\n21. in → Check karta hai property object mein hai ya nahi.\n\"name\" in user\n// true\n\n\n\n22. instanceof → Check karta hai object kis constructor ka instance hai.\n[] instanceof Array\n// true",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "17. Conditional (Ternary) (? :) → Short form if...else.\nage >= 18 ? \"Adult\" : \"Minor\"\n\n\n\n\n18. String Concatenation (+) → Strings ko jodta hai.\n\"Hello \" + \"World\"\n// \"Hello World\"\n\n\n\n19. typeof → Value ka data type batata hai.\ntypeof 10\n// \"number\"\n\n\n\n20. delete → Object ki property delete karta hai.\ndelete user.name;\n\n\n21. in → Check karta hai property object mein hai ya nahi.\n\"name\" in user\n// true\n\n\n\n22. instanceof → Check karta hai object kis constructor ka instance hai.\n[] instanceof Array\n// true",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xfJqMTZu9SOFzzJD5KihC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12217.376209550537,
      "y": 27168.292845571366,
      "width": 882.329833984375,
      "height": 1540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 813464549,
      "version": 160,
      "versionNonce": 592246027,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784163824510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "23. Bitwise AND (&) → Binary bits par AND operation karta hai.\n5 & 1\n// 1\n\nPehle binary banao:\n\n5 = 101\n1 = 001\n\nAb AND rule:\n\n1 & 1 = 1\n1 & 0 = 0\n0 & 0 = 0\n 101\n&001\n----\n 001\n\nBinary 001 = Decimal 1\n\n\n24. Bitwise OR (|) → Binary bits par OR operation karta hai.\n5 | 1\n// 5\n\n\nsame as bitwise and but it works on 32 bit inteeger \n\n\n\n25. Bitwise XOR (^) → Different bits par 1 return karta hai.\n5 ^ 1\n// 4\n\n\nsame \n\n\n26. Bitwise NOT (~) → Binary bits ko invert karta hai.\n~5\n// -6\n\nthis is two complement problem hai yeh ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "23. Bitwise AND (&) → Binary bits par AND operation karta hai.\n5 & 1\n// 1\n\nPehle binary banao:\n\n5 = 101\n1 = 001\n\nAb AND rule:\n\n1 & 1 = 1\n1 & 0 = 0\n0 & 0 = 0\n 101\n&001\n----\n 001\n\nBinary 001 = Decimal 1\n\n\n24. Bitwise OR (|) → Binary bits par OR operation karta hai.\n5 | 1\n// 5\n\n\nsame as bitwise and but it works on 32 bit inteeger \n\n\n\n25. Bitwise XOR (^) → Different bits par 1 return karta hai.\n5 ^ 1\n// 4\n\n\nsame \n\n\n26. Bitwise NOT (~) → Binary bits ko invert karta hai.\n~5\n// -6\n\nthis is two complement problem hai yeh ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
