      "text": "formula yaad rakho  =\n-(n+1) == -(5+1) =-6 ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "formula yaad rakho  =\n-(n+1) == -(5+1) =-6 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3CMA_s9kOomsvPvXYAaUZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12226.709583573975,
      "y": 28930.959471547943,
      "width": 1159.7535400390625,
      "height": 2100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1881624005,
      "version": 72,
      "versionNonce": 790335883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784164543234,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "27. Left Shift (<<) → Bits ko left shift karta hai.\n5 << 1\n// 10\n\n\nStep 1: Number ko Binary me convert karo\n5\n\n↓\n\n101\n\n8-bit me likhen to:\n\n00000101\nStep 2: Left Shift (<< 1)\n\nMatlab:\n\nHar bit ko ek position left move karo.\n\nBefore\n\n0 0 0 0 0 1 0 1\n\nEk step left:\n\n0 0 0 0 1 0 1 ?\n\nQuestion:\n\nLast wali jagah kya aayega?\n\n👉 JavaScript 0 fill karti hai.\n\nTo final:\n\n0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0\nStep 3: Decimal banao\n00001010\n\n↓\n\n10\n\n\n\n\n\n28. Right Shift (>>) → Bits ko right shift karta hai.\n8 >> 1\n// 4\n\nbas right se left move krdo bits ko that it\n\n\n\n29. Unsigned Right Shift (>>>) → Right shift karta hai aur sign bit ignore karta hai.\n8 >>> 1\n// 4",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "27. Left Shift (<<) → Bits ko left shift karta hai.\n5 << 1\n// 10\n\n\nStep 1: Number ko Binary me convert karo\n5\n\n↓\n\n101\n\n8-bit me likhen to:\n\n00000101\nStep 2: Left Shift (<< 1)\n\nMatlab:\n\nHar bit ko ek position left move karo.\n\nBefore\n\n0 0 0 0 0 1 0 1\n\nEk step left:\n\n0 0 0 0 1 0 1 ?\n\nQuestion:\n\nLast wali jagah kya aayega?\n\n👉 JavaScript 0 fill karti hai.\n\nTo final:\n\n0 0 0 0 1 0 1 0\nStep 3: Decimal banao\n00001010\n\n↓\n\n10\n\n\n\n\n\n28. Right Shift (>>) → Bits ko right shift karta hai.\n8 >> 1\n// 4\n\nbas right se left move krdo bits ko that it\n\n\n\n29. Unsigned Right Shift (>>>) → Right shift karta hai aur sign bit ignore karta hai.\n8 >>> 1\n// 4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PHORGyZ9xEoKfg3V4_4ZC",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 12188.0428355271,
