      "updated": 1784165576332,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    CONDITIONAL STATEMNETS : \n\nyeh use hoti hai code mei jaha par hamko kisi specfic part ko dekhna hai . matlab ke agar woh part true hoga then code halega nai toh stops .\n\n\nConsitional statements are :::\n\nif , ifelse , if else if , nested if , swtich statements ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    CONDITIONAL STATEMNETS : \n\nyeh use hoti hai code mei jaha par hamko kisi specfic part ko dekhna hai . matlab ke agar woh part true hoga then code halega nai toh stops .\n\n\nConsitional statements are :::\n\nif , ifelse , if else if , nested if , swtich statements ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WHyRm0jcPakqYIyXWYWyS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11991.978863780583,
      "y": 32811.99109756811,
      "width": 1334.50732421875,
      "height": 1505,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1323390117,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 1661221125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784165685954,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. if Statement\n\nEk condition check karta hai; true hui to block execute hota hai.\n\nif (age >= 18) console.log(\"Adult\");\n\n\n\n\n2. if...else Statement\nCondition true ho to if chalega, warna else chalega.\n\nif (age >= 18) console.log(\"Adult\");\nelse console.log(\"Minor\");\n\n\n\n\n3. if...else if...else Statement\nMultiple conditions ko sequence mein check karta hai.\n\nif (marks >= 90) console.log(\"A\");\nelse if (marks >= 75) console.log(\"B\");\nelse console.log(\"C\");\n\n\n\n4. Nested if Statement\nEk if ke andar doosra if likhte hain jab pehli condition ke baad aur check karna ho.\nif (user) {\n  if (user.isAdmin) console.log(\"Admin\");\n}\n\n\n\n5. switch Statement\n\nEk expression ki value ko multiple case se compare karta hai aur matching case execute karta hai.\n\nswitch(day){\n  case 1: console.log(\"Monday\"); break;\n  default: console.log(\"Invalid\");\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. if Statement\n\nEk condition check karta hai; true hui to block execute hota hai.\n\nif (age >= 18) console.log(\"Adult\");\n\n\n\n\n2. if...else Statement\nCondition true ho to if chalega, warna else chalega.\n\nif (age >= 18) console.log(\"Adult\");\nelse console.log(\"Minor\");\n\n\n\n\n3. if...else if...else Statement\nMultiple conditions ko sequence mein check karta hai.\n\nif (marks >= 90) console.log(\"A\");\nelse if (marks >= 75) console.log(\"B\");\nelse console.log(\"C\");\n\n\n\n4. Nested if Statement\nEk if ke andar doosra if likhte hain jab pehli condition ke baad aur check karna ho.\nif (user) {\n  if (user.isAdmin) console.log(\"Admin\");\n}\n\n\n\n5. switch Statement\n\nEk expression ki value ko multiple case se compare karta hai aur matching case execute karta hai.\n\nswitch(day){\n  case 1: console.log(\"Monday\"); break;\n  default: console.log(\"Invalid\");\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
