      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784166529998,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "loops woh cheez hai jo appke program mei iteration provide karuga jab tak conditon false nai hoti taaaki aappka code \n\nbina bar bar call kkiye chalta rahe effectively . >\n\nlooops ka basic logic hai ke appka code automatically run houga jab tak uski condtion satsify nai hoti hai..\n\n\n\n         ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "loops woh cheez hai jo appke program mei iteration provide karuga jab tak conditon false nai hoti taaaki aappka code \n\nbina bar bar call kkiye chalta rahe effectively . >\n\nlooops ka basic logic hai ke appka code automatically run houga jab tak uski condtion satsify nai hoti hai..\n\n\n\n         ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yaNqWiwD1zPnpUEs696a9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11584.550122325501,
      "y": 35409.67347642785,
      "width": 2192.790283203125,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 508885195,
      "version": 592,
      "versionNonce": 677755851,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784167041526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Loop             | 2-Line Definition                                                                                                                             | \n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`for`**        | Jab iterations ki count pehle se pata ho tab use karte hain. Initialization, condition aur increment/decrement ek hi statement mein hota hai. \n\n| **`while`**      | Pehle condition check hoti hai, phir loop execute hota hai. Jab tak condition `true` rahegi tab tak loop chalega.                            \n\n| **`do...while`** | Pehle loop ek baar zaroor execute hota hai, uske baad condition check hoti hai. Minimum ek iteration guaranteed hoti hai.               \n\n| **`for...of`**   | Arrays, Strings, Maps, Sets jaise iterable objects ke values par iterate karta hai. Har iteration mein value milti hai.                      \n\n| **`for...in`**   | Object ki enumerable property keys par iterate karta hai. Har iteration mein key milti hai.                                                   \n  \n| **`forEach()`**  | Array ka method hai jo har element ke liye callback function execute karta hai. Ye `break` aur `continue` support nahi karta.     \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Loop             | 2-Line Definition                                                                                                                             | \n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`for`**        | Jab iterations ki count pehle se pata ho tab use karte hain. Initialization, condition aur increment/decrement ek hi statement mein hota hai. \n\n| **`while`**      | Pehle condition check hoti hai, phir loop execute hota hai. Jab tak condition `true` rahegi tab tak loop chalega.                            \n\n| **`do...while`** | Pehle loop ek baar zaroor execute hota hai, uske baad condition check hoti hai. Minimum ek iteration guaranteed hoti hai.               \n\n| **`for...of`**   | Arrays, Strings, Maps, Sets jaise iterable objects ke values par iterate karta hai. Har iteration mein value milti hai.                      \n\n| **`for...in`**   | Object ki enumerable property keys par iterate karta hai. Har iteration mein key milti hai.                                                   \n  \n| **`forEach()`**  | Array ka method hai jo har element ke liye callback function execute karta hai. Ye `break` aur `continue` support nahi karta.     \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
