    },
    {
      "id": "TCLDFF_6onmnMwEvuYShd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19692.10565694173,
      "y": 253.5534057617212,
      "width": 1825.35888671875,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ff8787",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1365976148,
      "version": 913,
      "versionNonce": 502424300,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784510424358,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "but jab ham backend cheezo se deal karne lag pade toh dikkat pareshani a gyi then -> ke ab hamere pass toh uska control hai hi nai jab backend data bhejega tab hi usko dekhna padega \n\n\nmatalb controller ho gya BE \n\n\nBE mei use hoti hai 3rd party library so abb code ayega time lekar :::::   NOW we have 2 options rigght ::::\n\n1>> ke wait karo jab tak BE data na bhej de -> see abb JS is a single threaded langgiage hai -> abb ik hi main thread hona krek usko itna wait karna padega ke sara UI freeze ho jayega \n\n\n\n\n\nISSE AVOID KARNE KE LIYE AYA CALLBACK : \n\nKE App usko normally cahalte raho and jab  mera backend ka data ayega tab usko chala dena bakki kaamm as it is karte raho thats it ..\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "but jab ham backend cheezo se deal karne lag pade toh dikkat pareshani a gyi then -> ke ab hamere pass toh uska control hai hi nai jab backend data bhejega tab hi usko dekhna padega \n\n\nmatalb controller ho gya BE \n\n\nBE mei use hoti hai 3rd party library so abb code ayega time lekar :::::   NOW we have 2 options rigght ::::\n\n1>> ke wait karo jab tak BE data na bhej de -> see abb JS is a single threaded langgiage hai -> abb ik hi main thread hona krek usko itna wait karna padega ke sara UI freeze ho jayega \n\n\n\n\n\nISSE AVOID KARNE KE LIYE AYA CALLBACK : \n\nKE App usko normally cahalte raho and jab  mera backend ka data ayega tab usko chala dena bakki kaamm as it is karte raho thats it ..\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vHWMYEy1FHYml18d-5eUh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19665.438990275066,
      "y": 794.6645338270423,
      "width": 1451.13916015625,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1951373292,
      "version": 521,
      "versionNonce": 1966361172,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784510727974,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## Callback\n\n* **Callback Function** ek normal function hota hai jo **as an argument** kisi doosre function ko pass kiya jata hai.\n* Jab ek **normal function** kisi **Higher Order Function** ko argument ke roop me pass hota hai, tab uska role **Callback Function** ban jata hai.\n* Callback koi alag type ka function nahi hota, **sirf uska use (role) change hota hai**.\n\n### Yaad rakhne wali line\n\n**Normal Function + Higher Order Function me argument ke roop me pass = Callback Function**\n\n**Example:**\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet() {\n    console.log(\"Hello\");\n}\n\nfunction main(callback) {\n    callback();\n}\n\nmain(greet);\n```\n\n* `greet` → **Callback Function** (kyunki ye `main` ko argument ke roop me pass hua hai)\n* `main` → **Higher Order Function** (kyunki ye ek function ko argument me receive karta hai)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## Callback\n\n* **Callback Function** ek normal function hota hai jo **as an argument** kisi doosre function ko pass kiya jata hai.\n* Jab ek **normal function** kisi **Higher Order Function** ko argument ke roop me pass hota hai, tab uska role **Callback Function** ban jata hai.\n* Callback koi alag type ka function nahi hota, **sirf uska use (role) change hota hai**.\n\n### Yaad rakhne wali line\n\n**Normal Function + Higher Order Function me argument ke roop me pass = Callback Function**\n\n**Example:**\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet() {\n    console.log(\"Hello\");\n}\n\nfunction main(callback) {\n    callback();\n}\n\nmain(greet);\n```\n\n* `greet` → **Callback Function** (kyunki ye `main` ko argument ke roop me pass hua hai)\n* `main` → **Higher Order Function** (kyunki ye ek function ko argument me receive karta hai)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
