    },
    {
      "id": "AOPtlmnFQqCku07iAG8ro",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 19678.77247619629,
      "y": 2489.1089613172767,
      "width": 1215.8592529296875,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1670426708,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 383583212,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784511202986,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature           | Pure Function                                     | Impure Function                                  |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n\n| **Definition**    | Same input dene par hamesha same output deta hai. | Same input dene par alag output de sakta hai.    |\n\n| **Side Effects**  | ❌ Koi side effect nahi hota.                      | ✅ Side effects ho sakte hain.                    |\n\n| **External Data** | External variables ko use ya modify nahi karta.   | External variables ko read/modify kar sakta hai. |\n\n| **Predictable**   | ✅ Hamesha predictable.                            | ❌ Predictable nahi ho sakta.                     |\n\n| **Testing**       | Easy to test.                                     | Thoda difficult to test.                         |\n\n| **Debugging**     | Easy.                                             | Comparatively difficult.                         |\n\n| **Performance**   | Memoization/caching possible.                     | Memoization generally difficult.                 |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature           | Pure Function                                     | Impure Function                                  |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n\n| **Definition**    | Same input dene par hamesha same output deta hai. | Same input dene par alag output de sakta hai.    |\n\n| **Side Effects**  | ❌ Koi side effect nahi hota.                      | ✅ Side effects ho sakte hain.                    |\n\n| **External Data** | External variables ko use ya modify nahi karta.   | External variables ko read/modify kar sakta hai. |\n\n| **Predictable**   | ✅ Hamesha predictable.                            | ❌ Predictable nahi ho sakta.                     |\n\n| **Testing**       | Easy to test.                                     | Thoda difficult to test.                         |\n\n| **Debugging**     | Easy.                                             | Comparatively difficult.                         |\n\n| **Performance**   | Memoization/caching possible.                     | Memoization generally difficult.                 |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
