      "updated": 1784524753457,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "promise ::: why it came to existence :::::\n\nse there is some problem taht is why promiss are there -> problkems are like majorly dealing with callback to overcome that \n\npromises are introduced as to have a version that can deal with async task in more clean and effective mamner\n\nProblems are ::\n\n1. Callback hell \n\n2. Error Handlng is soo hard \n\n3. diff for beginers to understand this thing \n\n\nSOL : Promises \n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "promise ::: why it came to existence :::::\n\nse there is some problem taht is why promiss are there -> problkems are like majorly dealing with callback to overcome that \n\npromises are introduced as to have a version that can deal with async task in more clean and effective mamner\n\nProblems are ::\n\n1. Callback hell \n\n2. Error Handlng is soo hard \n\n3. diff for beginers to understand this thing \n\n\nSOL : Promises \n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2b1_-YrqlWdWofZF10iVY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22639.99414425805,
      "y": 144.6489726475371,
      "width": 1695.034912109375,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b91",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 426837484,
      "version": 421,
      "versionNonce": 1388020948,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784524911929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Promises are the js objects that are introduced in ES6 after soo many probklems realted to an async funtion ->\n\nthis is a JS obj that we deciede a valuable output for the opt of async task like in future you will have a definite state ->\n\nweather it is PENDING , FULFULIED, REJECTED state \n\n\n     ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Promises are the js objects that are introduced in ES6 after soo many probklems realted to an async funtion ->\n\nthis is a JS obj that we deciede a valuable output for the opt of async task like in future you will have a definite state ->\n\nweather it is PENDING , FULFULIED, REJECTED state \n\n\n     ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AtFG2w41eyinuMSuFkVDn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22633.327518281487,
      "y": 447.31553758894336,
      "width": 1551.255126953125,
      "height": 665,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b92",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1266959700,
      "version": 607,
      "versionNonce": 802202860,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784525296194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROMISE LIFECYCLE :\n\n\n1. PROMISE REPRESENTATION : ka matalb hai ke promise uski state and uski values and its whole environment \n\n2. PROMISE CREATE : when you use a thing called as new Promise() -> it will create a promise object . \n\nie like the obj that will hanndel a value in future provieded by a state \n\n3. StateS:   3 POSSIBLE STATES :\n\n        PENDING          FULLFILLED         REJECTED\n\n4. TRANSITION RULES :\n\nNOW YOU HAVE A FIXED RULES IN PROMISE LIEKE ::::\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PROMISE LIFECYCLE :\n\n\n1. PROMISE REPRESENTATION : ka matalb hai ke promise uski state and uski values and its whole environment \n\n2. PROMISE CREATE : when you use a thing called as new Promise() -> it will create a promise object . \n\nie like the obj that will hanndel a value in future provieded by a state \n\n3. StateS:   3 POSSIBLE STATES :\n\n        PENDING          FULLFILLED         REJECTED\n\n4. TRANSITION RULES :\n\nNOW YOU HAVE A FIXED RULES IN PROMISE LIEKE ::::\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GO7ph-R8YfDgkMse6qY7L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22641.327518281487,
      "y": 1052.6489116123807,
      "width": 728.7556762695312,
      "height": 1155,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b93",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1342606036,
      "version": 59,
      "versionNonce": 276514028,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784525370310,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule 1\nPromise hamesha\nPending\nse start hota hai.\n\nRule 2\nPending se\nFulfilled\njaa sakta hai.\n\nRule 3\nPending se\nRejected\njaa sakta hai.\n\nRule 4\nEk baar settle ho gaya\nFulfilled\ntoh dubara change nahi hoga.\n\nRule 5\nEk baar\nRejected\nho gaya\ntoh bhi change nahi hoga.\n\nRule 6\nPromise ki state immutable hoti hai after settlement.\nMatlab\nresolve();\nreject);\n\nReject ignore ho jayega.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rule 1\nPromise hamesha\nPending\nse start hota hai.\n\nRule 2\nPending se\nFulfilled\njaa sakta hai.\n\nRule 3\nPending se\nRejected\njaa sakta hai.\n\nRule 4\nEk baar settle ho gaya\nFulfilled\ntoh dubara change nahi hoga.\n\nRule 5\nEk baar\nRejected\nho gaya\ntoh bhi change nahi hoga.\n\nRule 6\nPromise ki state immutable hoti hai after settlement.\nMatlab\nresolve();\nreject);\n\nReject ignore ho jayega.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "044rw4LX110B-wAZTO8EN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22549.327579316643,
      "y": 2324.6490133376415,
      "width": 457.519775390625,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b95",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1163387092,
      "version": 11,
      "versionNonce": 585723756,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784525507291,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Promise Settlement\n\nPending\n↓\nFulfilled\n\nya\n↓\nRejected\n\nIs process ko bolte hain\nSettlement\n\nMatlab\nPromise ka final decision aa gaya.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Promise Settlement\n\nPending\n↓\nFulfilled\n\nya\n↓\nRejected\n\nIs process ko bolte hain\nSettlement\n\nMatlab\nPromise ka final decision aa gaya.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oLRvlhN7FkMuqLpzQvuCE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22522.660892304924,
      "y": 2952.648957388748,
      "width": 676.8717651367188,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b96",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 965494868,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1144144748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784525525785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. Promise Handlers\n\nPromise ke result ko receive karne wale functions.\n.then()\n.catch()\n.finally()",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Promise Handlers\n\nPromise ke result ko receive karne wale functions.\n.then()\n.catch()\n.finally()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MVcbIQJukV3J_kjApkUfm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22507.994205,
      "y": 3203.3155986240995,
      "width": 996.4578857421875,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b97",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1094693972,
      "version": 16,
      "versionNonce": 391779052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784525557074,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ".then() → Handles the successful (fulfilled) result of a Promise.\n.catch() → Handles errors or rejected Promises.\n.finally() → Runs after the Promise settles, whether it succeeds or fails.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ".then() → Handles the successful (fulfilled) result of a Promise.\n.catch() → Handles errors or rejected Promises.\n.finally() → Runs after the Promise settles, whether it succeeds or fails.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
