      "updated": 1784525734242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "State is the current condition or status of an object at a particular point in time.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "State is the current condition or status of an object at a particular point in time.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q8DKcTgW2jGS11cUtor0W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22429.771971203038,
      "y": 3591.204464624804,
      "width": 2048.95556640625,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2091464660,
      "version": 16,
      "versionNonce": 764918252,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784525746505,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| State         | Meaning                                  | Result Available?                       | Function Called | Next Step                           |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Pending**   | Asynchronous operation is still running. | ❌ No                                    | None            | Waits for `resolve()` or `reject()` |\n| **Fulfilled** | Operation completed successfully.        | ✅ Yes                                   | `resolve()`     | Executes `.then()`                  |\n| **Rejected**  | Operation failed.                        | ❌ No (receives an error/reason instead) | `reject()`      | Executes `.catch()`                 |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| State         | Meaning                                  | Result Available?                       | Function Called | Next Step                           |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Pending**   | Asynchronous operation is still running. | ❌ No                                    | None            | Waits for `resolve()` or `reject()` |\n| **Fulfilled** | Operation completed successfully.        | ✅ Yes                                   | `resolve()`     | Executes `.then()`                  |\n| **Rejected**  | Operation failed.                        | ❌ No (receives an error/reason instead) | `reject()`      | Executes `.catch()`                 |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VHXBg-rJZTUbjwqgTK0s8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22969.7720729283,
      "y": 3855.6489429776702,
      "width": 423.411376953125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
