      "updated": 1784583582013,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1\n\nPromise object banta hai.\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Pending\n    result : undefined\n}\n\n\n\n\nStep 2\n\nExecutor Function start hota hai.\nUske paas do functions aate hain:\n\nresolve()\nreject()\n\nYe sirf functions hain.\n\n\n\n\nStep 3\n\nsetTimeout() async operation start karta hai.\n2 second tak Promise object aisa hi rehta hai:\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Pending\n    result : undefined\n}\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 4\n\n2 second baad\n\nresolve(\"Data\");\n\ncall hota hai.\n\nAb resolve() Promise object ko update karta hai.\n\nBefore\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Pending\n    result : undefined\n}\n\n        │\nresolve(\"Data\")\n        ▼\n\nAfter\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Fulfilled\n    result : \"Data\"\n}\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 5\n\nAb JavaScript Promise object ko dekhta hai.\n\nState = Fulfilled\n\nTo\n\n.then()\n\nko Microtask Queue me daal deta hai.\n\n.then() ko \"Data\" mil jata hai.\n\nAgar\nreject(\"Error\");\n\ncall hota\n\nTo Promise object ban jata\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Rejected\n    result : \"Error\"\n}\n\nAur JavaScript\n\n.catch()\n\nexecute kar deta.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1\n\nPromise object banta hai.\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Pending\n    result : undefined\n}\n\n\n\n\nStep 2\n\nExecutor Function start hota hai.\nUske paas do functions aate hain:\n\nresolve()\nreject()\n\nYe sirf functions hain.\n\n\n\n\nStep 3\n\nsetTimeout() async operation start karta hai.\n2 second tak Promise object aisa hi rehta hai:\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Pending\n    result : undefined\n}\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 4\n\n2 second baad\n\nresolve(\"Data\");\n\ncall hota hai.\n\nAb resolve() Promise object ko update karta hai.\n\nBefore\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Pending\n    result : undefined\n}\n\n        │\nresolve(\"Data\")\n        ▼\n\nAfter\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Fulfilled\n    result : \"Data\"\n}\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 5\n\nAb JavaScript Promise object ko dekhta hai.\n\nState = Fulfilled\n\nTo\n\n.then()\n\nko Microtask Queue me daal deta hai.\n\n.then() ko \"Data\" mil jata hai.\n\nAgar\nreject(\"Error\");\n\ncall hota\n\nTo Promise object ban jata\n\nPromise\n{\n    state  : Rejected\n    result : \"Error\"\n}\n\nAur JavaScript\n\n.catch()\n\nexecute kar deta.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yvUK0aVP-ZE5q7Kd1gkW2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 22220.044595684994,
      "y": 11353.2103296889,
      "width": 2057.952270507813,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f783ac",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9k",
