      "seed": 997963937,
      "version": 378,
      "versionNonce": 1039402913,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784584816451,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature            | `Promise.all()`                          | `Promise.allSettled()`                          | `Promise.race()`                                  | `Promise.any()`                                         |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Purpose**        | Sabhi Promises ko ek saath execute karna | Sabhi Promises ke final result lena             | Jo Promise sabse pehle settle ho uska result lena | Jo Promise sabse pehle success ho uska result lena      |\n\n| **Waits For**      | Sabhi Promises                           | Sabhi Promises                                  | Sirf pehla settled Promise                        | Sirf pehla fulfilled Promise                            |\n\n| **Success**        | Jab **sabhi** Promises Fulfilled ho      | Success aur Failure dono ka result deta hai     | Agar pehla settled Promise Fulfilled hai          | Pehla Fulfilled Promise milte hi                        |\n\n| **Failure**        | Ek bhi Promise Reject hua to pura reject | Kabhi reject nahi hota (jab tak input valid ho) | Agar pehla settled Promise Reject hua             | Tabhi reject hoga jab **sabhi** Promises Reject ho jaye \n|\n| **Return**         | Resolved values ka array                 | Objects ka array (`status`, `value/reason`)     | First settled value/error                         | First fulfilled value                                   |\n\n| **Error Handling** | Immediate reject                         | Har Promise ka result deta hai                  | First rejection bhi return kar sakta hai          | Sab reject hone par `AggregateError`                    |\n\n| **Best Use Case**  | Multiple APIs jinka result sab chahiye   | Sab APIs ka report chahiye (success + fail)     | Fastest response ya timeout                       | Multiple servers me se pehla successful response        |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature            | `Promise.all()`                          | `Promise.allSettled()`                          | `Promise.race()`                                  | `Promise.any()`                                         |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| **Purpose**        | Sabhi Promises ko ek saath execute karna | Sabhi Promises ke final result lena             | Jo Promise sabse pehle settle ho uska result lena | Jo Promise sabse pehle success ho uska result lena      |\n\n| **Waits For**      | Sabhi Promises                           | Sabhi Promises                                  | Sirf pehla settled Promise                        | Sirf pehla fulfilled Promise                            |\n\n| **Success**        | Jab **sabhi** Promises Fulfilled ho      | Success aur Failure dono ka result deta hai     | Agar pehla settled Promise Fulfilled hai          | Pehla Fulfilled Promise milte hi                        |\n\n| **Failure**        | Ek bhi Promise Reject hua to pura reject | Kabhi reject nahi hota (jab tak input valid ho) | Agar pehla settled Promise Reject hua             | Tabhi reject hoga jab **sabhi** Promises Reject ho jaye \n|\n| **Return**         | Resolved values ka array                 | Objects ka array (`status`, `value/reason`)     | First settled value/error                         | First fulfilled value                                   |\n\n| **Error Handling** | Immediate reject                         | Har Promise ka result deta hai                  | First rejection bhi return kar sakta hai          | Sab reject hone par `AggregateError`                    |\n\n| **Best Use Case**  | Multiple APIs jinka result sab chahiye   | Sab APIs ka report chahiye (success + fail)     | Fastest response ya timeout                       | Multiple servers me se pehla successful response        |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
