      "locked": false,
      "text": "dekho jaise callback kebadd PrOMISE kyo aya uske piche reason tha hena same waise hi  Promise mei kuch cheze aise thi jis ke badd \n\nASYNC / AWAIT AYA \n\nlike :\n1> jab multiple async opt hote hai toh hamko multiople .then use karna padta hai ->>> jissi wajah se iski readbility and maintainablity errect hoti thi \n\nsoo to AVOID THis ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "dekho jaise callback kebadd PrOMISE kyo aya uske piche reason tha hena same waise hi  Promise mei kuch cheze aise thi jis ke badd \n\nASYNC / AWAIT AYA \n\nlike :\n1> jab multiple async opt hote hai toh hamko multiople .then use karna padta hai ->>> jissi wajah se iski readbility and maintainablity errect hoti thi \n\nsoo to AVOID THis ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
