      "updated": 1784608133196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "there comes ASYNC AWAIT jo kuch logicallu change nai karta the -> bass likhne ka tarike alag kar deta tha -> \n\nisko ham kehte the syantatic sugar of promises . yeh bana toh pomsie ke platfotm ke upper hi tha .\n\nASYNC AWAIT -> MEI 2 keywords se milkar bana hai \n\nASYNC -> ek fucntion banata hai \n\nAWAIT -> ek keyword hai jo appka asyycn fucntion ka return hone ka wait  karta tha \n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "there comes ASYNC AWAIT jo kuch logicallu change nai karta the -> bass likhne ka tarike alag kar deta tha -> \n\nisko ham kehte the syantatic sugar of promises . yeh bana toh pomsie ke platfotm ke upper hi tha .\n\nASYNC AWAIT -> MEI 2 keywords se milkar bana hai \n\nASYNC -> ek fucntion banata hai \n\nAWAIT -> ek keyword hai jo appka asyycn fucntion ka return hone ka wait  karta tha \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
