    },
    {
      "id": "r8vILrrOW_tdjdTxhvcK7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25419.690718413072,
      "y": 1527.2386634830796,
      "width": 1703.799072265625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3bc9db",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1115948833,
      "version": 971,
      "versionNonce": 1680343215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784609232525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "it is a reserved keyword that waits till your promise gets returrned in either way FULFILLED / REJECTED \n\njado tak tuhada async promise return nai houga odo tak tuhdaa async block ho jana hai -> async agge nai chaluga jado tak \n\nohho promise nu resovled nai krda \n\neda matlab hai ke tuhdaa MAIN thread kamm karda rahuga ahh bg mei chaluga , siraf asycnc ko hi blokc karta hai .\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "it is a reserved keyword that waits till your promise gets returrned in either way FULFILLED / REJECTED \n\njado tak tuhada async promise return nai houga odo tak tuhdaa async block ho jana hai -> async agge nai chaluga jado tak \n\nohho promise nu resovled nai krda \n\neda matlab hai ke tuhdaa MAIN thread kamm karda rahuga ahh bg mei chaluga , siraf asycnc ko hi blokc karta hai .\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YApZbRlzQbNQKPlZptfyi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25625.95799597834,
      "y": 1839.2872958024075,
      "width": 875.419677734375,
      "height": 560,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1914251649,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 271150593,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784609352550,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "await internally kya karta hai?\n\nJab JavaScript ye line dekhti hai:\n\nconst data = await fetchData();\n\nToh internally:\n\nfetchData() call hota hai. ->>>  Wo Promise return karta hai.\nawait check karta hai ki Promise complete hua ya nahi.\n\nAgar pending hai:\ncurrent async function pause ho jata hai.\nmain thread block nahi hoti.\nevent loop doosra code chalata rehta hai.\nPromise resolve hote hi function wahi line se resume ho jata hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "await internally kya karta hai?\n\nJab JavaScript ye line dekhti hai:\n\nconst data = await fetchData();\n\nToh internally:\n\nfetchData() call hota hai. ->>>  Wo Promise return karta hai.\nawait check karta hai ki Promise complete hua ya nahi.\n\nAgar pending hai:\ncurrent async function pause ho jata hai.\nmain thread block nahi hoti.\nevent loop doosra code chalata rehta hai.\nPromise resolve hote hi function wahi line se resume ho jata hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q9o1PRPUiv0mYJiV8tSH8",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 25397.375850702447,
      "y": 1358.7201476673754,
      "width": 2298.8714599609375,
      "height": 1091.0880025227866,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAJ",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1184145857,
      "version": 91,
      "versionNonce": 968075969,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784609371996,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ITBP9bXwmmD3l-S81Eecv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25798.518810297173,
      "y": 2493.8762563234245,
      "width": 890.11962890625,
      "height": 2380,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffd43b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 944598255,
      "version": 103,
      "versionNonce": 1779797647,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784609690624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "working of async/awaot\n\n\n\nfunction fetchData() {\n    // 5. Ek Promise ban gaya\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n\n        // 6. Timer Web API ko de diya\n        setTimeout(() => {\n\n            // 11. 2 sec baad Promise resolve hoga\n            resolve(\"Data Received\");\n\n        }, 2000);\n\n    });\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n\n    console.log(\"Start\");      // 1. Print ho gaya\n\n    // 2. fetchData() call hua\n    // 3. fetchData() ne Pending Promise return kiya\n    // 4. await ne dekha Promise abhi Pending hai\n    //    Isliye sirf main() function pause ho gaya\n    //    JavaScript block nahi hui\n    //    Global code execute hota rahega\n\n\n\n    const data = await fetchData();\n    // 12. Promise resolve hote hi ye line dobara execute hogi\n    //     (Microtask Queue ke through)\n\n\n\n    console.log(data);\n    // 13. Remaining code continue hoga\n    console.log(\"End\");\n}\n\nmain();              // main() start hua\n\n\n// 7. Kyunki main() pause tha,\n//    isliye Global Execution Context ye line execute kar deta hai\nconsole.log(\"Outside\");\n\n// ---------- 2 second baad ----------\n\n// 8. setTimeout callback Task Queue me aaya\n// 9. Event Loop ne callback Call Stack me bheja\n// 10. resolve(\"Data Received\") chala\n//     Promise Pending -> Fulfilled ho gaya\n//     await ke baad wala code Microtask Queue me gaya\n\n// 12. Event Loop ne Microtask Queue se continuation uthaya\n//     main() wahi se resume hua jahan await tha\n\n// Final Output:\n// Start\n// Outside\n\n\n// Data Received\n// End",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "working of async/awaot\n\n\n\nfunction fetchData() {\n    // 5. Ek Promise ban gaya\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n\n        // 6. Timer Web API ko de diya\n        setTimeout(() => {\n\n            // 11. 2 sec baad Promise resolve hoga\n            resolve(\"Data Received\");\n\n        }, 2000);\n\n    });\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n\n    console.log(\"Start\");      // 1. Print ho gaya\n\n    // 2. fetchData() call hua\n    // 3. fetchData() ne Pending Promise return kiya\n    // 4. await ne dekha Promise abhi Pending hai\n    //    Isliye sirf main() function pause ho gaya\n    //    JavaScript block nahi hui\n    //    Global code execute hota rahega\n\n\n\n    const data = await fetchData();\n    // 12. Promise resolve hote hi ye line dobara execute hogi\n    //     (Microtask Queue ke through)\n\n\n\n    console.log(data);\n    // 13. Remaining code continue hoga\n    console.log(\"End\");\n}\n\nmain();              // main() start hua\n\n\n// 7. Kyunki main() pause tha,\n//    isliye Global Execution Context ye line execute kar deta hai\nconsole.log(\"Outside\");\n\n// ---------- 2 second baad ----------\n\n// 8. setTimeout callback Task Queue me aaya\n// 9. Event Loop ne callback Call Stack me bheja\n// 10. resolve(\"Data Received\") chala\n//     Promise Pending -> Fulfilled ho gaya\n//     await ke baad wala code Microtask Queue me gaya\n\n// 12. Event Loop ne Microtask Queue se continuation uthaya\n//     main() wahi se resume hua jahan await tha\n\n// Final Output:\n// Start\n// Outside\n\n\n// Data Received\n// End",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
