      "updated": 1784610780738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Method                  | Use                                                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `try...catch`           | Sync code aur `async/await` ke errors handle karna     |\n| `throw`                 | Custom error create karna                              |\n| `.catch()`              | Promise rejection handle karna                         |\n| `try...catch` + `await` | Async function ke andar Promise rejection handle karna |\n ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Method                  | Use                                                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `try...catch`           | Sync code aur `async/await` ke errors handle karna     |\n| `throw`                 | Custom error create karna                              |\n| `.catch()`              | Promise rejection handle karna                         |\n| `try...catch` + `await` | Async function ke andar Promise rejection handle karna |\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "srlZZ-lfzaAKosvoLf2P8",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 25512.107536340875,
      "y": 8142.090468847007,
      "width": 1865.9901123046857,
