      "versionNonce": 2013478113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784611115416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Top level await :\n\nmatalb yeh problem ka sol tha jab problem ayi thi ek ke kya ham , bina async ke await use kar sakte hai -> dekho jab 2021 mei aya ek conpct\n\nTLA . jisme appko freedom di gyi ke app bass ES MODULES mei hi await bina aync ke use kar sakte ho -> \n\nkyoki Common JS ISKO allow nai karta ke bina async us ekanr await yeh appko error de dega soo \n\niff you want ot use it us it with using ES MODUULES .\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Top level await :\n\nmatalb yeh problem ka sol tha jab problem ayi thi ek ke kya ham , bina async ke await use kar sakte hai -> dekho jab 2021 mei aya ek conpct\n\nTLA . jisme appko freedom di gyi ke app bass ES MODULES mei hi await bina aync ke use kar sakte ho -> \n\nkyoki Common JS ISKO allow nai karta ke bina async us ekanr await yeh appko error de dega soo \n\niff you want ot use it us it with using ES MODUULES .\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CKT58e8Ygl5Y8SY9-T3Lv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 25440.95494845025,
      "y": 12293.051108791806,
      "width": 1270.4996337890625,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2063982063,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 957526063,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784611170950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bilkul. 👍 Yehi reason hai.\n\nCommonJS me agar tum await se pause karna chahte ho, to async function banana hi padega.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bilkul. 👍 Yehi reason hai.\n\nCommonJS me agar tum await se pause karna chahte ho, to async function banana hi padega.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
