      "updated": 1784611189583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CommonJS Module Start\n\n↓\n\nmain() call\n\n↓\n\nmain() pause (await)\n\n↓\n\nModule ka baaki code chalta rahega\n\n↓\n\nconsole.log(\"End\")\n\n↓\n\nPromise Resolve\n\n↓\n\nmain() resume\n\n↓\n\nconsole.log(data)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CommonJS Module Start\n\n↓\n\nmain() call\n\n↓\n\nmain() pause (await)\n\n↓\n\nModule ka baaki code chalta rahega\n\n↓\n\nconsole.log(\"End\")\n\n↓\n\nPromise Resolve\n\n↓\n\nmain() resume\n\n↓\n\nconsole.log(data)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
