      "text": "ES Module Start\n\n↓\n\nTop-Level Await\n\n↓\n\nPOORA MODULE pause\n\n↓\n\nPromise Resolve\n\n↓\n\nconsole.log(data)\n\n↓\n\nconsole.log(\"End\")",
