      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784611325198,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CommonJS me await use karne ke liye async function banana padta hai\nkyunki sirf async function hi pause ho sakta hai. ES Modules me Top-\nLevel Await ki wajah se async function ki zarurat nahi hoti, kyunki\npoora module Promise resolve hone tak pause ho sakta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CommonJS me await use karne ke liye async function banana padta hai kyunki sirf async function hi pause ho sakta hai. ES Modules me Top-Level Await ki wajah se async function ki zarurat nahi hoti, kyunki poora module Promise resolve hone tak pause ho sakta hai.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
