      "text": "Kya await use karna hai?\n\n        │\n      Yes\n        │\n        ▼\nKya ES Module ka Top-Level hai?\n\n      /        \\\n    Yes        No\n     │          │\nNo async     async function\nneeded       banana padega\n\n\nKya function already Promise return karta hai?\n\n        │\n      Yes\n        │\nasync optional\n\n        │\n      No\n        │\nNormal function hi rakho",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kya await use karna hai?\n\n        │\n      Yes\n        │\n        ▼\nKya ES Module ka Top-Level hai?\n\n      /        \\\n    Yes        No\n     │          │\nNo async     async function\nneeded       banana padega\n\n\nKya function already Promise return karta hai?\n\n        │\n      Yes\n        │\nasync optional\n\n        │\n      No\n        │\nNormal function hi rakho",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
