      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "fucntions : socho abb agar normla js code hai like adding a same number to a deafult number\n\n   suppose aise code hai jisme same kaam ho raha hai but mai usko call bar bar akr raha hu manually\n\nso then what is the logic behind that if you are doiung it manually ???????\n\n\nSO you must do a thing that is callled as repeative task goes automated so that jab tak conditon satisfyu kare tab tak app usko \n\nchalao bina manulaly cal kiye \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "fucntions : socho abb agar normla js code hai like adding a same number to a deafult number\n\n   suppose aise code hai jisme same kaam ho raha hai but mai usko call bar bar akr raha hu manually\n\nso then what is the logic behind that if you are doiung it manually ???????\n\n\nSO you must do a thing that is callled as repeative task goes automated so that jab tak conditon satisfyu kare tab tak app usko \n\nchalao bina manulaly cal kiye \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b8sQrQcTZgrzmL1OsXAFJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29382.158200581864,
      "y": -246.7826574157781,
      "width": 1220.439208984375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#fd7e14",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
