      "versionNonce": 291207151,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784749881755,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so there introduced a concpt called as functions ::::\n\nFunction ::: yeh appka automated task controller , resuable block of code -> jo appka peice of code run karega till it satisfy \n\nits condition .\n\njab tak conditoin usko run karegi tab tak code chalega .   ISSO KEHTE HAI FUCNTION .\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so there introduced a concpt called as functions ::::\n\nFunction ::: yeh appka automated task controller , resuable block of code -> jo appka peice of code run karega till it satisfy \n\nits condition .\n\njab tak conditoin usko run karegi tab tak code chalega .   ISSO KEHTE HAI FUCNTION .\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mHBwgQ8TAJDXG0O3h8Zai",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29253.235102335606,
      "y": 43.95812604162535,
      "width": 1062.414250691732,
      "height": 423.69791666666674,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#da77f2",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 416320929,
      "version": 713,
      "versionNonce": 21064737,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784750179261,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNCTION DECLAREATION :::\n\niska matalb kya hai -> jab functin bananen start huie the tab se yeh concopt cha raha hai .\n\ndefining a fucntion woth its function name =  iska matalb hai ke funciton ko uske name ke sath define karna \n\n taaki jab usko cal karna ho toh name se hi call kar sake ->>>>>\n\n\niske bass app  fucntion ko declare , call and purely hoisted fuction ki feature ko enjoy karte ho \n\n\nfucntion hi (name){\nconsole.log(name)\n}\n\nhi(\"akmar\")",
      "fontSize": 19.93872549019608,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FUNCTION DECLAREATION :::\n\niska matalb kya hai -> jab functin bananen start huie the tab se yeh concopt cha raha hai .\n\ndefining a fucntion woth its function name =  iska matalb hai ke funciton ko uske name ke sath define karna \n\n taaki jab usko cal karna ho toh name se hi call kar sake ->>>>>\n\n\niske bass app  fucntion ko declare , call and purely hoisted fuction ki feature ko enjoy karte ho \n\n\nfucntion hi (name){\nconsole.log(name)\n}\n\nhi(\"akmar\")",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "967Q7qJw-6JxHvTFUdxbr",
