    {
      "id": "Sdm506cSiyO8VZvbYMqTM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29181.23229726155,
      "y": 543.9580663118854,
      "width": 1232.2392578125,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4dabf7",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1227745025,
      "version": 846,
      "versionNonce": 1516467503,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784750571836,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AB develoeps ko aise fuction use nau karna tha they need to treat fucntion like values soo abb kya kre \n\nUSS TIME PAR CONCPET AYA fucntion expression ka ::::::\n\n\nFUCNTION EXPRESSION ::::: \n\niska matalb hai ke fucntion ko app ek varaible mei store kardo and woh funtciona act karegha as a value .\n\nabb see imp batt :::::\n\nFUNC DEC AND FUN EXP dono ka kaam toh hai same bass diff hai syntax ka and use case ka konsa case mei konsa fucntion \nnatuirlly suited lag raha hai usko use karo- ==> dono mei fucntion hi bann rahe hai . \n\nbas diff hai use case ka appko konsa function best lag raha hai and best rahega\n USKO UUSE KARO\n\n\n\nlet name = fuxnrion (_) {}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AB develoeps ko aise fuction use nau karna tha they need to treat fucntion like values soo abb kya kre \n\nUSS TIME PAR CONCPET AYA fucntion expression ka ::::::\n\n\nFUCNTION EXPRESSION ::::: \n\niska matalb hai ke fucntion ko app ek varaible mei store kardo and woh funtciona act karegha as a value .\n\nabb see imp batt :::::\n\nFUNC DEC AND FUN EXP dono ka kaam toh hai same bass diff hai syntax ka and use case ka konsa case mei konsa fucntion \nnatuirlly suited lag raha hai usko use karo- ==> dono mei fucntion hi bann rahe hai . \n\nbas diff hai use case ka appko konsa function best lag raha hai and best rahega\n USKO UUSE KARO\n\n\n\nlet name = fuxnrion (_) {}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oxjfn592Gch2ew83yvpIy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28811.865862311934,
      "y": 1098.043623647575,
      "width": 1587.7120772560054,
      "height": 375.7612257737379,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1058878831,
      "version": 196,
      "versionNonce": 1047310113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784750619020,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature                    | Function Declaration                                                | Function Expression                                                  |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Definition**             | Function ko direct declare karte hain                               | Function ko kisi variable me store karte hain                        |\n| **Syntax**                 | `function greet() {}`                                               | `const greet = function() {};`                                       |\n| **Name Required?**         | ✅ Haan, function ka naam zaroori hai                                | ❌ Anonymous bhi ho sakti hai                                         |\n| **Hoisting**               | ✅ Puri function hoist hoti hai                                      | ❌ Sirf variable hoist hota hai, function nahi                        |\n| **Call Before Definition** | ✅ Possible                                                          | ❌ Possible nahi                                                      |\n| **Execution**              | Declaration se pehle bhi chal jati hai                              | Assignment ke baad hi chalegi                                        |\n| **Storage**                | Memory me function direct store hota hai                            | Variable me function reference store hota hai                        |\n| **Best Use Case**          | Reusable utility functions                                          | Callback, dynamic assignment, closures                               |\n| **Can Reassign?**          | Normally nahi (same name dubara likh sakte ho, overwrite ho jayegi) | ✅ Agar `let` ya `var` hai to reassign kar sakte ho (`const`\nme nahi) |\n| **Interview Importance**   | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                                                               | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n|\n",
      "fontSize": 20.04059870793269,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature                    | Function Declaration                                                | Function Expression                                                  |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Definition**             | Function ko direct declare karte hain                               | Function ko kisi variable me store karte hain                        |\n| **Syntax**                 | `function greet() {}`                                               | `const greet = function() {};`                                       |\n| **Name Required?**         | ✅ Haan, function ka naam zaroori hai                                | ❌ Anonymous bhi ho sakti hai                                         |\n| **Hoisting**               | ✅ Puri function hoist hoti hai                                      | ❌ Sirf variable hoist hota hai, function nahi                        |\n| **Call Before Definition** | ✅ Possible                                                          | ❌ Possible nahi                                                      |\n| **Execution**              | Declaration se pehle bhi chal jati hai                              | Assignment ke baad hi chalegi                                        |\n| **Storage**                | Memory me function direct store hota hai                            | Variable me function reference store hota hai                        |\n| **Best Use Case**          | Reusable utility functions                                          | Callback, dynamic assignment, closures                               |\n| **Can Reassign?**          | Normally nahi (same name dubara likh sakte ho, overwrite ho jayegi) | ✅ Agar `let` ya `var` hai to reassign kar sakte ho (`const` me nahi) |\n| **Interview Importance**   | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                                                               | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐                                                                |\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
