      "versionNonce": 1087215809,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784750938999,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠️ Is function ko aise direct likh nahi sakte, kyunki JavaScript ko pata hi nahi chalega isko use kaise karna hai.\n\nIsliye anonymous function ko usually kisi variable me store karte hain ya callback ke roop me pass karte hain.",
      "fontSize": 20.640421549479175,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚠️ Is function ko aise direct likh nahi sakte, kyunki JavaScript ko pata hi nahi chalega isko use kaise karna hai.\n\nIsliye anonymous function ko usually kisi variable me store karte hain ya callback ke roop me pass karte hain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cIggY54YJHt3Gcp_ZPluo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 28641.179362342467,
      "y": 2108.680282667836,
      "width": 446.9796447753906,
      "height": 50,
