    },
    {
      "id": "jZVdae_22WZnN118ABdZ-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29326.364654904315,
      "y": 3005.902478678734,
      "width": 746.9993896484375,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 694975727,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1811063105,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784751126363,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Namespace Pollution kam kiya ✅\n\nPehle:\n\nfunction task1() {}\nfunction task2() {}\nfunction task3() {}\n\nBahut saare global function names ban gaye.\n\nAnonymous function:\n\nsetTimeout(function () {\n    console.log(\"Done\");\n}, 1000);\n\nKoi extra global function name create nahi hua.\n\n2. One-time Logic likhna easy hua ✅\n\nAgar function sirf callback ke liye chahiye, alag se naam dene ki zarurat nahi.\n\narr.forEach(function (item) {\n    console.log(item);\n});\n3. Cleaner Code ✅\n\nInstead of:\n\nfunction print(item) {\n    console.log(item);\n}\n\narr.forEach(print);\n\nDirect:\n\narr.forEach(function (item) {\n    console.log(item);\n});",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Namespace Pollution kam kiya ✅\n\nPehle:\n\nfunction task1() {}\nfunction task2() {}\nfunction task3() {}\n\nBahut saare global function names ban gaye.\n\nAnonymous function:\n\nsetTimeout(function () {\n    console.log(\"Done\");\n}, 1000);\n\nKoi extra global function name create nahi hua.\n\n2. One-time Logic likhna easy hua ✅\n\nAgar function sirf callback ke liye chahiye, alag se naam dene ki zarurat nahi.\n\narr.forEach(function (item) {\n    console.log(item);\n});\n3. Cleaner Code ✅\n\nInstead of:\n\nfunction print(item) {\n    console.log(item);\n}\n\narr.forEach(print);\n\nDirect:\n\narr.forEach(function (item) {\n    console.log(item);\n});",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
