      "originalText": "Arrow Function JavaScript me short syntax provide karne ke liye introduce hua tha. Lekin iska sabse bada purpose \n  sirf syntax chhota karna nahi tha, this keyword ki problem solve karna bhi tha.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
