      "index": "bBm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2062343105,
      "version": 29,
      "versionNonce": 1817827599,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784751370751,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Syntax\n1. Normal Function\nfunction add(a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n}\n\n\n\n2. Function Expression\nconst add = function (a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n};\n\n\n\n3. Arrow Function\nconst add = (a, b) => {\n    return a + b;\n};",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntax\n1. Normal Function\nfunction add(a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n}\n\n\n\n2. Function Expression\nconst add = function (a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n};\n\n\n\n3. Arrow Function\nconst add = (a, b) => {\n    return a + b;\n};",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sjmqdblrEXC1xDy5ewkuB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29046.778244381843,
      "y": 5153.153494293318,
