      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784751771607,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sabse pehle this kya karta hai?\n\n👉 this hamesha us object ko point karta hai jisne function ko call kiya hai.\n\nExample: NORMAL FUCNTION KA THIS KAA KAAM",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
