      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "person.show()\n      │\n      ▼\nshow() execute hua\n      │\n      ▼\nthis = person ✅\n      │\n      ▼\nsetTimeout(callback)\n      │\n      ▼\nBrowser ne callback store kar liya\n      │\n      ▼\n1 sec baad Browser ne callback call kiya\n\ncallback();   ← Dhyan do\n\n❌ person.callback() nahi hua\nSirf callback() hua\n\n      │\n      ▼\nNormal Function\n\nNaya this create hua\n\nthis = window\n\n      │\n      ▼\nthis.name\n\n↓\n\nwindow.name\n\n↓\n\nundefined",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "person.show()\n      │\n      ▼\nshow() execute hua\n      │\n      ▼\nthis = person ✅\n      │\n      ▼\nsetTimeout(callback)\n      │\n      ▼\nBrowser ne callback store kar liya\n      │\n      ▼\n1 sec baad Browser ne callback call kiya\n\ncallback();   ← Dhyan do\n\n❌ person.callback() nahi hua\nSirf callback() hua\n\n      │\n      ▼\nNormal Function\n\nNaya this create hua\n\nthis = window\n\n      │\n      ▼\nthis.name\n\n↓\n\nwindow.name\n\n↓\n\nundefined",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
