      "text": "person.show()\n      │\n      ▼\nshow() execute hua\n      │\n      ▼\nthis = person ✅\n      │\n      ▼\nsetTimeout(Arrow Function)\n      │\n      ▼\nBrowser ne Arrow Function call ki\n\n      │\n      ▼\nArrow Function check karta hai\n\n\"Mere paas apna this hai?\"\n\n      │\n      ▼\nNO ❌\n\n      │\n      ▼\nBahar dekho\n\nshow()\n\n      │\n      ▼\nshow() ka this = person\n\n      │\n      ▼\nArrow wahi this use karega\n\nthis = person\n\n      │\n      ▼\nthis.name\n\n↓\n\nperson.name\n\n↓\n\nAmar",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "person.show()\n      │\n      ▼\nshow() execute hua\n      │\n      ▼\nthis = person ✅\n      │\n      ▼\nsetTimeout(Arrow Function)\n      │\n      ▼\nBrowser ne Arrow Function call ki\n\n      │\n      ▼\nArrow Function check karta hai\n\n\"Mere paas apna this hai?\"\n\n      │\n      ▼\nNO ❌\n\n      │\n      ▼\nBahar dekho\n\nshow()\n\n      │\n      ▼\nshow() ka this = person\n\n      │\n      ▼\nArrow wahi this use karega\n\nthis = person\n\n      │\n      ▼\nthis.name\n\n↓\n\nperson.name\n\n↓\n\nAmar",
