      "text": "Golden Rule ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐Golden Rule ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nJavaScript ye nahi dekhti:\n\nFunction ka naam kya hai?\n\nJavaScript ye dekhti hai:\n\nFunction ko kisne call kiya?\n\nAgar\n\nobj.fun();\n\nto\n\nthis = obj\n\nAgar\n\nfun();\n\nto\n\nthis = window\n(browser me, non-strict mode)\n\nAgar\n\nobj1.obj2.fun();\n\nto\n\nthis = obj2\nIsko ek formula ki tarah yaad rakho\nobj.method()\n\n↓\n\nthis = obj\nmethod()\n\n↓\n\nthis = window\nobj1.obj2.method()\n\n↓\n\nthis = obj2\nInterview wali line\n\nthis function ke naam ko refer nahi karta. this hamesha us object ko refer karta hai jo function ko call karta hai. Agar function kisi object ke through call nahi hua, to browser me (non-strict mode) this global object (window) hota hai.Golden Rule ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nJavaScript ye nahi dekhti:\n\nFunction ka naam kya hai?\n\nJavaScript ye dekhti hai:\n\nFunction ko kisne call kiya?\n\nAgar\n\nobj.fun();\n\nto\n\nthis = obj\n\nAgar\n\nfun();\n\nto\n\nthis = window\n(browser me, non-strict mode)\n\nAgar\n\nobj1.obj2.fun();\n\nto\n\nthis = obj2\nIsko ek formula ki tarah yaad rakho\nobj.method()\n\n↓\n\nthis = obj\nmethod()\n\n↓\n\nthis = window\nobj1.obj2.method()\n\n↓\n\nthis = obj2\nInterview wali line\n\nthis function ke naam ko refer nahi karta. this hamesha us object ko refer karta hai jo function ko call karta hai. Agar function kisi object ke through call nahi hua, to browser me (non-strict mode) this global object (window) hota hai.\n\nJavaScript ye nahi dekhti:\n\nFunction ka naam kya hai?\n\nJavaScript ye dekhti hai:\n\nFunction ko kisne call kiya?\n\nAgar\n\nobj.fun();\n\nto\n\nthis = obj\n\nAgar\n\nfun();\n\nto\n\nthis = window\n(browser me, non-strict mode)\n\nAgar\n\nobj1.obj2.fun();\n\nto\n\nthis = obj2\nIsko ek formula ki tarah yaad rakho\nobj.method()\n\n↓\n\nthis = obj\nmethod()\n\n↓\n\nthis = window\nobj1.obj2.method()\n\n↓\n\nthis = obj2\nInterview wali line\n\nthis function ke naam ko refer nahi karta. this hamesha us object ko refer karta hai jo function ko call karta hai. Agar function kisi object ke through call nahi hua, to browser me (non-strict mode) this global object (window) hota hai.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
