    {
      "id": "-AFwfdTi8p-TIKkdlxZfZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30251.214706556282,
      "y": 15438.499100213043,
      "width": 1248.9991455078125,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2103610255,
      "version": 13,
      "versionNonce": 1796483873,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784753775295,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Feature       | Default Parameters                                      | Rest Parameters                                     |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| Purpose       | Agar argument pass na ho to default value use karta hai | Multiple arguments ko ek array me collect karta hai |\n\n| Introduced In | ES6                                                     | ES6                                                 |\n\n| Syntax        | `function add(a = 10)`                                  | `function add(...nums)`                             |\n\n| Value         | Ek parameter ki default value                           | Multiple values ka array                            |\n\n| Type          | Normal variable                                         | Array                                               |\n\n| Used When     | Argument optional ho                                    | Number of arguments pata na ho                      |\n\n| Position      | Kahin bhi likh sakte ho (generally end me)              | **Hamesha last parameter hona chahiye**             |\n\n| Number        | Multiple default parameters ho sakte hain               | Sirf **ek** rest parameter ho sakta hai             |\n\n| Accepts       | Missing (`undefined`) value ko replace karta hai        | Extra arguments ko collect karta hai                |\n\n| Interview Use | Optional values                                         | Variable number of arguments                        |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Feature       | Default Parameters                                      | Rest Parameters                                     |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| Purpose       | Agar argument pass na ho to default value use karta hai | Multiple arguments ko ek array me collect karta hai |\n\n| Introduced In | ES6                                                     | ES6                                                 |\n\n| Syntax        | `function add(a = 10)`                                  | `function add(...nums)`                             |\n\n| Value         | Ek parameter ki default value                           | Multiple values ka array                            |\n\n| Type          | Normal variable                                         | Array                                               |\n\n| Used When     | Argument optional ho                                    | Number of arguments pata na ho                      |\n\n| Position      | Kahin bhi likh sakte ho (generally end me)              | **Hamesha last parameter hona chahiye**             |\n\n| Number        | Multiple default parameters ho sakte hain               | Sirf **ek** rest parameter ho sakta hai             |\n\n| Accepts       | Missing (`undefined`) value ko replace karta hai        | Extra arguments ko collect karta hai                |\n\n| Interview Use | Optional values                                         | Variable number of arguments                        |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sPnQKj7jWtcBqv6oD41N_",
