      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784753851069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Default Parameter                   | Rest Parameter                        |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Missing value ko fill karta hai** | **Extra values ko collect karta hai** |\n| `=` use hota hai                    | `...` use hota hai                    |\n| Single value                        | Array of values                       |\n| Optional argument                   | Unlimited arguments                   |\n",
      "fontSize": 28.960390770606654,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Default Parameter                   | Rest Parameter                        |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Missing value ko fill karta hai** | **Extra values ko collect karta hai** |\n| `=` use hota hai                    | `...` use hota hai                    |\n| Single value                        | Array of values                       |\n| Optional argument                   | Unlimited arguments                   |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7Hnd6cMciQr8u2COOqg6q",
      "type": "text",
