      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784754098624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "iska matalb hai ke agar hame ek fucntion bana haichota sa and usko siraf ek time hi chala hai bar bar nai \n\ntoh uss time par aya tha CONCPT IIFE . \n\nbina name ka fucntion ko call karna one time only and waise bhi agar ek bar call karna hai toh kyu yeh sab karna ke ducntion decalare karo neeche call kro chalao yeh sabn\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iska matalb hai ke agar hame ek fucntion bana haichota sa and usko siraf ek time hi chala hai bar bar nai \n\ntoh uss time par aya tha CONCPT IIFE . \n\nbina name ka fucntion ko call karna one time only and waise bhi agar ek bar call karna hai toh kyu yeh sab karna ke ducntion decalare karo neeche call kro chalao yeh sabn\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
