    },
    {
      "id": "Lhs3deMx41xl-M98vFwi4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30392.786722798886,
      "y": 17469.559001507627,
      "width": 1496.0145149934153,
      "height": 55.07265475771001,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 331078095,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 1299757839,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784754190689,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Jab hume koi chhota function sirf ek hi baar execute karna hota tha, tab JavaScript me IIFE ka concept aaya.\n Isme function ko alag se declare karke baad me call karne ki zarurat nahi padti. Function banta bhi hai aur turant execute bhi ho jata hai.",
      "fontSize": 22.029061903084,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Jab hume koi chhota function sirf ek hi baar execute karna hota tha, tab JavaScript me IIFE ka concept aaya.\n Isme function ko alag se declare karke baad me call karne ki zarurat nahi padti. Function banta bhi hai aur turant execute bhi ho jata hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ma4Y-3j8XFM_akABwVFTc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30392.7969726057,
      "y": 17604.781251144577,
      "width": 1489.8787841796875,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1972722977,
      "version": 720,
      "versionNonce": 1978502063,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784754541650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "iska use ek aur jagah hua before ES6 jab tak let and const nai aye the uss time tak hamko -> var se deal akrna padta tha and issu is var as you knwo \n\nis a fucntion scoped in nature . jo { } braces ko repect nai krta .\n\nuss time var ko privvate scope banan ke liye we use IEFE \n\n\n(fucntion(){\n\nvar a=10 } ) \n()   \n\nvar bhar accesivae nei hopga fucntionke andar hi chalga\n\n\n\njab let and const a gya toh kahanai hi alag ho gayi hai ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iska use ek aur jagah hua before ES6 jab tak let and const nai aye the uss time tak hamko -> var se deal akrna padta tha and issu is var as you knwo \n\nis a fucntion scoped in nature . jo { } braces ko repect nai krta .\n\nuss time var ko privvate scope banan ke liye we use IEFE \n\n\n(fucntion(){\n\nvar a=10 } ) \n()   \n\nvar bhar accesivae nei hopga fucntionke andar hi chalga\n\n\n\njab let and const a gya toh kahanai hi alag ho gayi hai ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dU7qJoiwDR441V3oEnYLK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30369.180741029362,
      "y": 18116.417466595896,
      "width": 1580.9189453125,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1050039823,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1582412321,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784754572830,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Yaad rakhna (Interview)\n\nIIFE ke 2 main reasons the:\n\n✅ Function ko immediately execute karna (one-time execution).\n✅ Apna private scope banana taaki variables global scope me na jayein (namespace pollution se bachna).\n\nAaj ke time me let, const aur ES Modules ki wajah se IIFE ka use pehle se kaafi kam ho gaya hai, lekin interviews me iska concept abhi bhi bahut poocha jata hai.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yaad rakhna (Interview)\n\nIIFE ke 2 main reasons the:\n\n✅ Function ko immediately execute karna (one-time execution).\n✅ Apna private scope banana taaki variables global scope me na jayein (namespace pollution se bachna).\n\nAaj ke time me let, const aur ES Modules ki wajah se IIFE ka use pehle se kaafi kam ho gaya hai, lekin interviews me iska concept abhi bhi bahut poocha jata hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wvyL_X3EP5TjKyIoIm_zn",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 29583.69918775569,
      "y": 16793.342527165038,
      "width": 2879.9481225013733,
      "height": 1808.8540649414062,
