      "text": "To Recursion me sabse important kya hota hai?\n\n👉 Base Case\n\nBase Case matlab:\n\nJahan function ruk jaye.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "To Recursion me sabse important kya hota hai?\n\n👉 Base Case\n\nBase Case matlab:\n\nJahan function ruk jaye.",
