      "versionNonce": 687411393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755044412,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Pure Function                        | Impure Function                        |\n| ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| Same Input → Same Output ✅           | Same Input → Different Output ❌        |\n| Sirf Parameters par depend karta hai | External data par bhi depend karta hai |\n| No Side Effects                      | Side Effects hote hain                 |\n| Global Variable use nahi karta       | Global Variable use kar sakta hai      |\n| Object/Array modify nahi karta       | Object/Array modify kar sakta hai      |\n| Easy to Test                         | Difficult to Test                      |\n",
      "fontSize": 42.09828199543005,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Pure Function                        | Impure Function                        |\n| ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| Same Input → Same Output ✅           | Same Input → Different Output ❌        |\n| Sirf Parameters par depend karta hai | External data par bhi depend karta hai |\n| No Side Effects                      | Side Effects hote hain                 |\n| Global Variable use nahi karta       | Global Variable use kar sakta hai      |\n| Object/Array modify nahi karta       | Object/Array modify kar sakta hai      |\n| Easy to Test                         | Difficult to Test                      |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2vsMjZvreuYtXP3HtDG6x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29946.705476760973,
      "y": 22616.519669661495,
      "width": 603.584228515625,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 760151041,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 1154325857,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755033389,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ Pure Function\n\nRule:\n\nInput lo → Process karo → Output do. Bas.\n\nfunction add(a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n}\nadd(10,20); //30\nadd(10,20); //30\n\n✔ Same Input → Same Output",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ Pure Function\n\nRule:\n\nInput lo → Process karo → Output do. Bas.\n\nfunction add(a, b) {\n    return a + b;\n}\nadd(10,20); //30\nadd(10,20); //30\n\n✔ Same Input → Same Output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uSvsHTYTm9LpcwbRvoAkK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30870.417584101466,
      "y": 22630.78449943104,
      "width": 1519.39111328125,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 678105729,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 1233333153,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755034771,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "❌ Impure Function\n\nRule:\n\nFunction bahar ki kisi cheez (Global Variable, API, Date, Random, Object) par depend kare ya usse change kare.\n\nlet tax = 10;\n\nfunction total(price) { \n    return price + tax;\n}\ntotal(100); //110\n\ntax = 20;\n\ntotal(100); //120\n\n❌ Same Input → Different Output",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "❌ Impure Function\n\nRule:\n\nFunction bahar ki kisi cheez (Global Variable, API, Date, Random, Object) par depend kare ya usse change kare.\n\nlet tax = 10;\n\nfunction total(price) { \n    return price + tax;\n}\ntotal(100); //110\n\ntax = 20;\n\ntotal(100); //120\n\n❌ Same Input → Different Output",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
