      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755356871,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Generator Function ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nNormal Function\n\nNormal Function ya to poora execute hota hai ya bilkul nahi hota. Beech me pause nahi ho sakta aur wahi se resume bhi nahi ho sakta.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Generator Function ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nNormal Function\n\nNormal Function ya to poora execute hota hai ya bilkul nahi hota. Beech me pause nahi ho sakta aur wahi se resume bhi nahi ho sakta.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Jz6CJM-98JZCJeZaqOcBx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30597.87679227204,
      "y": 23929.337959737622,
      "width": 174.15994262695312,
      "height": 735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1154536111,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 314204001,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755364762,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Call Function\n\n↓\n\nStart\n\n↓\n\nStatement 1\n\n↓\n\nStatement 2\n\n↓\n\nStatement 3\n\n↓\n\nEnd",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Call Function\n\n↓\n\nStart\n\n↓\n\nStatement 1\n\n↓\n\nStatement 2\n\n↓\n\nStatement 3\n\n↓\n\nEnd",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yduotp5AQxrSB97Hf1OlF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30368.247173945216,
      "y": 24742.30084989462,
      "width": 2033.414794921875,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1911866223,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 940417729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755373573,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Generator Function\n\nGenerator Function beech me pause ho sakta hai aur baad me wahi se dobara resume ho sakta hai. Isi wajah se Generator Function special hota hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Generator Function\n\nGenerator Function beech me pause ho sakta hai aur baad me wahi se dobara resume ho sakta hai. Isi wajah se Generator Function special hota hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9pgib4EmCnO7oWthweclP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30370.09898058584,
      "y": 24912.671224474107,
      "width": 129.78128051757812,
      "height": 1015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 634138209,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 108471407,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755380367,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Start\n\n↓\n\nyield\n\n⏸ Pause\n\n↓\n\nnext()\n\n↓\n\nResume\n\n↓\n\nyield\n\n⏸ Pause\n\n↓\n\nnext()\n\n↓\n\nResume",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Start\n\n↓\n\nyield\n\n⏸ Pause\n\n↓\n\nnext()\n\n↓\n\nResume\n\n↓\n\nyield\n\n⏸ Pause\n\n↓\n\nnext()\n\n↓\n\nResume",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "twYuu48VOi5QfJ8b-9cUG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30196.74835395824,
      "y": 26093.400318997083,
      "width": 2908.3291015625,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2065568193,
      "version": 22,
      "versionNonce": 1111646945,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755391460,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "yield Keyword\n\nyield ek special keyword hai jo Generator Function ki execution ko temporarily pause kar deta hai aur ek value return karta hai. Jab next() call hota hai, function wahi se continue hota hai jahan yield par ruka tha.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "yield Keyword\n\nyield ek special keyword hai jo Generator Function ki execution ko temporarily pause kar deta hai aur ek value return karta hai. Jab next() call hota hai, function wahi se continue hota hai jahan yield par ruka tha.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W1S0LyLZKd1UFnxrBL0qC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30194.173102696845,
      "y": 26287.671147595152,
      "width": 254.0998992919922,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#38d9a9",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 69036641,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1452714095,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784755400206,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "function* demo() {\n    yield 1;\n    yield 2;\n    yield 3;\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "function* demo() {\n    yield 1;\n    yield 2;\n    yield 3;\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jpL37yNps8ozijZDg6T3N",
