      "originalText": "next()\n\n↓\n\nyield 1\n\n↓\n\nPause\n\n↓\n\nnext()\n\n↓\n\nyield 2\n\n↓\n\nPause\n\n↓\n\nnext()\n\n↓\n\nyield 3",
