      "updated": 1784963396280,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ab dekho kya ho raha hai ->>> abb hamne html page bana liya hai abb css and js ko main dikkat ayi ke \n\nstyling kaise kare , toh \n\nCSS ke case mei we have a css selector -> jo basically appke html elemnent ko style karega -> pehele uss element ko labugga then ussko \n\nstyle karuga .\n\n\nJs mei use hota hai document.getelement by ID -> yeh kya karega pehele assi ode toh eleement find karde aa then agge js appni proceding kar sakdi hai \n\n  ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ab dekho kya ho raha hai ->>> abb hamne html page bana liya hai abb css and js ko main dikkat ayi ke \n\nstyling kaise kare , toh \n\nCSS ke case mei we have a css selector -> jo basically appke html elemnent ko style karega -> pehele uss element ko labugga then ussko \n\nstyle karuga .\n\n\nJs mei use hota hai document.getelement by ID -> yeh kya karega pehele assi ode toh eleement find karde aa then agge js appni proceding kar sakdi hai \n\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
