      "text": "1. documenet.getElementById() === yeh use hota tha html element mei se id find krke return krana single selectged eelement .\n\nHTml aya -> Dom bana -> usme se find kita id ko -> id mil gyi kyoki har id is unique and it will basically give the fasterst result\n \n\njab isse ham id ko find kar lete hai then ham kya karte haiu -> agge js opertations kar sakte ho  -> innertext ,  innerhtml jasie\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. documenet.getElementById() === yeh use hota tha html element mei se id find krke return krana single selectged eelement .\n\nHTml aya -> Dom bana -> usme se find kita id ko -> id mil gyi kyoki har id is unique and it will basically give the fasterst result\n \n\njab isse ham id ko find kar lete hai then ham kya karte haiu -> agge js opertations kar sakte ho  -> innertext ,  innerhtml jasie\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
