      "updated": 1784963918336,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 3\n\nElement mil gaya.\n\nAb uske baad tum ye sab kar sakte ho:\n\ndocument.getElementById()\n          ↓\nSirf element laata hai.\n          ↓\nElement milne ke baad\n✔ Text change\n✔ HTML change\n✔ CSS change\n✔ Attribute change\n✔ Event add\n✔ Remove\n✔ Value read/write\n✔ Image change\n✔ Aur bahut kuch;",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 3\n\nElement mil gaya.\n\nAb uske baad tum ye sab kar sakte ho:\n\ndocument.getElementById()\n          ↓\nSirf element laata hai.\n          ↓\nElement milne ke baad\n✔ Text change\n✔ HTML change\n✔ CSS change\n✔ Attribute change\n✔ Event add\n✔ Remove\n✔ Value read/write\n✔ Image change\n✔ Aur bahut kuch;",
