      "originalText": "| `getElementById()`                  | CSS Selector                        |\n| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| Element select karta hai            | Element select karta hai            |\n| JavaScript ke liye                  | CSS ke liye                         |\n| Uske baad JS kuch bhi kar sakti hai | Uske baad sirf style apply hoti hai |\n",
