      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Context Changes ka chakkar :::: -->>>\n\niska matalb hai ke abb hamne ek element via selecting elements seclet akr liya ab usme changes leke anna ho then kya kreoge app \n\nWE have followiung methods :::\n\n1.",
      "autoResize": true,
