      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785028858257,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Property      | Kya karta hai?                   | HTML Tags ko samajhta hai? | Hidden Text padhta hai? | CSS (`display:none`) ko follow\nkarta hai? |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `innerText`   | Sirf screen par dikhne wala text | ❌ Nahi                     | ❌ Nahi                  | ✅ Haan                                    |\n| `innerHTML`   | Andar ka poora HTML deta hai     | ✅ Haan                     | ✅ Haan                  | ❌ Nahi\n|\n| `textContent` | Andar ka poora text deta hai     | ❌ Nahi                     | ✅ Haan                  | ❌ Nahi\n|\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Property      | Kya karta hai?                   | HTML Tags ko samajhta hai? | Hidden Text padhta hai? | CSS (`display:none`) ko follow karta hai? |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `innerText`   | Sirf screen par dikhne wala text | ❌ Nahi                     | ❌ Nahi                  | ✅ Haan                                    |\n| `innerHTML`   | Andar ka poora HTML deta hai     | ✅ Haan                     | ✅ Haan                  | ❌ Nahi                                    |\n| `textContent` | Andar ka poora text deta hai     | ❌ Nahi                     | ✅ Haan                  | ❌ Nahi                                    |\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
