      "text": "Yaad rakhne ki Trick 🔥\nProperty        Easy Meaning\ninnerText        👀 Jo user dekh raha hai\ninnerHTML        🏗️ Poora HTML structure\ntextContent        📄 Poora text (hidden bhi)",
