      "updated": 1785029035187,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Method                     | Kis se select karta hai? | Kitne elements? |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------ | --------------- |\n| `getElementById()`         | ID                       | Ek              |\n| `getElementsByClassName()` | Class                    | Saare           |\n| `getElementsByTagName()`   | Tag                      | Saare           |\n| `querySelector()`          | CSS Selector             | Pehla           |\n| `querySelectorAll()`       | CSS Selector             | Saare           |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Method                     | Kis se select karta hai? | Kitne elements? |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------ | --------------- |\n| `getElementById()`         | ID                       | Ek              |\n| `getElementsByClassName()` | Class                    | Saare           |\n| `getElementsByTagName()`   | Tag                      | Saare           |\n| `querySelector()`          | CSS Selector             | Pehla           |\n| `querySelectorAll()`       | CSS Selector             | Saare           |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
