      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785030462339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EVENTS KYA HOTE HAI ::\n\n\n\nevents are the actions perfromed bby the user to change UI \n\nInternally it is just changiung the dom strucutre and then Dom is converted to real dom and then finaly reflow repaint ke badd\n\nappko UI mei change show hota hai \n.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EVENTS KYA HOTE HAI ::\n\n\n\nevents are the actions perfromed bby the user to change UI \n\nInternally it is just changiung the dom strucutre and then Dom is converted to real dom and then finaly reflow repaint ke badd\n\nappko UI mei change show hota hai \n.\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
