      "updated": 1785030497632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JavaScript aake bolti hai:\n\nbutton.addEventListener(\"click\", login);\n\nAb browser kehta hai:\n\n\"Theek hai, agar is button par click hua to login() function chala dunga.\"",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JavaScript aake bolti hai:\n\nbutton.addEventListener(\"click\", login);\n\nAb browser kehta hai:\n\n\"Theek hai, agar is button par click hua to login() function chala dunga.\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
