      "versionNonce": 1906882363,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785031015764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EventaddListner == yeh aapka root cause hai -> okay yaha se hi evenet trigger ki tarf jata hai \n\nuser   -> action   -> listen  -> check kruga changes   -> UI updatre\n\n\n\nNOW user ka action perform hi kaise hua woh hua via eventadd listner se beacuse yehi appka event ko trigger karta hai .\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EventaddListner == yeh aapka root cause hai -> okay yaha se hi evenet trigger ki tarf jata hai \n\nuser   -> action   -> listen  -> check kruga changes   -> UI updatre\n\n\n\nNOW user ka action perform hi kaise hua woh hua via eventadd listner se beacuse yehi appka event ko trigger karta hai .\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "X7g4fr99xMfCk4AY8SATQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34613.75353686015,
      "y": 13045.915817048815,
      "width": 633.3876953125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1694004405,
      "version": 38,
      "versionNonce": 1297324981,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785031097704,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sabse pehle Event kya hota hai?\n\nEvent = Koi bhi action jo browser me hota hai.\n\nExamples:\n\nMouse click 🖱️\nDouble click\nKeyboard button press ⌨️\nInput me typing\nPage load\nMouse hover\nForm submit\n\nYe sab Events hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sabse pehle Event kya hota hai?\n\nEvent = Koi bhi action jo browser me hota hai.\n\nExamples:\n\nMouse click 🖱️\nDouble click\nKeyboard button press ⌨️\nInput me typing\nPage load\nMouse hover\nForm submit\n\nYe sab Events hain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4aYD_ZA1EWc62TOB3VXuO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34621.24041430156,
      "y": 13634.240587424349,
      "width": 811.9156494140625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 523787099,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 1932147675,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785031146593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "addEventListener() kya karta hai?\n\nSimple language me:\n\n\"Kisi element ko bolo ki jab koi event ho, to ye kaam karna.\"",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "addEventListener() kya karta hai?\n\nSimple language me:\n\n\"Kisi element ko bolo ki jab koi event ho, to ye kaam karna.\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CrA8zvDXn382AB2P8Ptzc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34634.044369379684,
      "y": 13927.03560813047,
      "width": 643.2717895507812,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 255554037,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 609467835,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785031130014,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "element.addEventListener(\"event\", function () {\n\n    // Kaam\n\n});",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "element.addEventListener(\"event\", function () {\n\n    // Kaam\n\n});",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
