      "versionNonce": 505103285,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785035726628,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Button dabaya?\n\nYe bahut slow ho jayega.\n\nIsliye browser Event System use karta hai.\n\nJaise hi user kuch karta hai,\n\nBrowser bolta hai:\n\nClick hua\n\n↓\n\nEvent Fire\n\nAur sirf tab function chalta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Button dabaya?\n\nYe bahut slow ho jayega.\n\nIsliye browser Event System use karta hai.\n\nJaise hi user kuch karta hai,\n\nBrowser bolta hai:\n\nClick hua\n\n↓\n\nEvent Fire\n\nAur sirf tab function chalta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
