      "text": "User Click\n\n↓\n\nBrowser ko signal mila\n\n↓\n\nFunction chala do",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User Click\n\n↓\n\nBrowser ko signal mila\n\n↓\n\nFunction chala do",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YVAPFONGevAQVeuBZPTXZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34755.285229365036,
      "y": 18745.54768702717,
      "width": 532.3917846679688,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bG6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 870121173,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 1315493595,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785036141024,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Golden Rule ⭐\n\naddEventListener() event nahi chalata.\n\nYe sirf browser ko bolta hai:\n\nAgar future me ye event aaye...\n\n↓\n\nTo ye function chala dena.\n\nUske baad:\n\nUser Action\n\n↓\n\nEvent Trigger\n\n↓\n\nEvent Fire\n\n↓\n\nCallback Function Execute",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Golden Rule ⭐\n\naddEventListener() event nahi chalata.\n\nYe sirf browser ko bolta hai:\n\nAgar future me ye event aaye...\n\n↓\n\nTo ye function chala dena.\n\nUske baad:\n\nUser Action\n\n↓\n\nEvent Trigger\n\n↓\n\nEvent Fire\n\n↓\n\nCallback Function Execute",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
