      "updated": 1785036934469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Lekin browser to beech me hi refresh kar deta hai.\n\nIsliye hum usko bolte hain:\n\ne.preventDefault();\n\nMatlab:\n\n\"Ruk ja browser! Tu abhi refresh mat kar. Pehle mera JavaScript code chalne de.\"",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lekin browser to beech me hi refresh kar deta hai.\n\nIsliye hum usko bolte hain:\n\ne.preventDefault();\n\nMatlab:\n\n\"Ruk ja browser! Tu abhi refresh mat kar. Pehle mera JavaScript code chalne de.\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
