      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "e.preventDefault() isliye use karte hain kyunki hum browser ke automatic action ko rok kar apna JavaScript code pehle chalana chahte hain. Ye especially forms, links aur custom interactions me bahut useful hota hai.",
      "autoResize": false,
