      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class list :: yeh ek proerty hai/ object hai jisme woh current element ki poori css classes ko manage karta hai .\n\nissi se classes add kar sakte hai and remove kar sakte hai /\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "class list :: yeh ek proerty hai/ object hai jisme woh current element ki poori css classes ko manage karta hai .\n\nissi se classes add kar sakte hai and remove kar sakte hai /\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yEzDO0kiiNBhHNrjbeJIH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33949.13693775957,
      "y": 23489.711053484727,
      "width": 2661.36669921875,
      "height": 441.6796875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffa94d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 190227099,
      "version": 232,
      "versionNonce": 1917099733,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785040788221,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Method         | Syntax                                    | Kya Karta Hai                          | Agar Class Pehle Se Hai         | Agar Class Nahi Hai      | Example                    |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| **add()**      | `element.classList.add(\"red\")`            | Nayi class add karta hai               | Duplicate add nahi karega       | Class add ho jayegi      | `red big` → `red big blue` |\n\n| **remove()**   | `element.classList.remove(\"red\")`         | Class hata deta hai                    | Class remove ho jayegi          | Kuch nahi hoga           | `red big` → `big`          |\n\n| **toggle()**   | `element.classList.toggle(\"red\")`         | Hai to hatao, nahi hai to add karo     | Remove kar dega                 | Add kar dega             | `red` → `` → `red`         |\n\n| **contains()** | `element.classList.contains(\"red\")`       | Sirf check karta hai class hai ya nahi | `true` return karega            | `false` return karega    | `red big` → `true`         |\n\n| **replace()**  | `element.classList.replace(\"red\",\"blue\")` | Ek class ko dusri se replace karta hai | `red` ki jagah `blue` aa jayegi | Kuch nahi hoga (`false`) | `red big` → `blue big`     |\n",
      "fontSize": 29.4453125,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Method         | Syntax                                    | Kya Karta Hai                          | Agar Class Pehle Se Hai         | Agar Class Nahi Hai      | Example                    |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| **add()**      | `element.classList.add(\"red\")`            | Nayi class add karta hai               | Duplicate add nahi karega       | Class add ho jayegi      | `red big` → `red big blue` |\n\n| **remove()**   | `element.classList.remove(\"red\")`         | Class hata deta hai                    | Class remove ho jayegi          | Kuch nahi hoga           | `red big` → `big`          |\n\n| **toggle()**   | `element.classList.toggle(\"red\")`         | Hai to hatao, nahi hai to add karo     | Remove kar dega                 | Add kar dega             | `red` → `` → `red`         |\n\n| **contains()** | `element.classList.contains(\"red\")`       | Sirf check karta hai class hai ya nahi | `true` return karega            | `false` return karega    | `red big` → `true`         |\n\n| **replace()**  | `element.classList.replace(\"red\",\"blue\")` | Ek class ko dusri se replace karta hai | `red` ki jagah `blue` aa jayegi | Kuch nahi hoga (`false`) | `red big` → `blue big`     |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
