      "updated": 1785040844967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| `className`                                             | `classList`                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Puri `class` attribute ko replace (overwrite) karta hai | Sirf specific class par operation karta hai\n|\n| Accidentally saari classes hata sakta hai               | Existing classes safe rehti hain\n|\n| String return/assign karta hai                          | Methods (`add`, `remove`, `toggle`, `replace`, `contains`)\nprovide karta hai |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| `className`                                             | `classList`                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Puri `class` attribute ko replace (overwrite) karta hai | Sirf specific class par operation karta hai                                  |\n| Accidentally saari classes hata sakta hai               | Existing classes safe rehti hain                                             |\n| String return/assign karta hai                          | Methods (`add`, `remove`, `toggle`, `replace`, `contains`) provide karta hai |\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
