      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "classname use hota hai earlier jab yeh puuri css ki class ki ek string ki tarah rakhta the \"red green 250px\"  abb jab bhi koi class mei change krta toh isko pta nai chalta ke change s konsi jaagh hue hai \n\ntoh issliye next aya ke appp classlist hi use kro kyoki woh  mehtods use krta hai kyoki isme css values return hoti hai as arrya =[\"red,\"blue\"] toh classlist ki node se value dekhleta hai \n\nand puri strig replace nai krta bass jo selected value ko target karte hai .",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "classname use hota hai earlier jab yeh puuri css ki class ki ek string ki tarah rakhta the \"red green 250px\"  abb jab bhi koi class mei change krta toh isko pta nai chalta ke change s konsi jaagh hue hai \n\ntoh issliye next aya ke appp classlist hi use kro kyoki woh  mehtods use krta hai kyoki isme css values return hoti hai as arrya =[\"red,\"blue\"] toh classlist ki node se value dekhleta hai \n\nand puri strig replace nai krta bass jo selected value ko target karte hai .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SlCWO4LCO_eOMG7o4lOVu",
      "type": "text",
