      "seed": 255297685,
      "version": 54,
      "versionNonce": 1681951451,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785042159223,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Method            | Before      | After                     |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ------------------------- |\n| `appendChild()`   | Apple Mango | Apple Mango Banana        |\n| `append()`        | Apple Mango | Apple Mango Banana / Text |\n| `prepend()`       | Apple Mango | Orange Apple Mango        |\n| `removeChild()`   | Apple Mango | Mango                     |\n| `remove()`        | Apple Mango | (Entire ul removed)       |\n| `replaceChild()`  | Apple Mango | Banana Mango              |\n| `replaceWith()`   | Apple Mango | Hello Mango               |\n| `cloneNode(true)` | Apple Mango | Apple Mango + Copy        |\n| `insertBefore()`  | Apple Mango | Apple Orange Mango        |\n",
      "fontSize": 33.569101470416264,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Method            | Before      | After                     |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ------------------------- |\n| `appendChild()`   | Apple Mango | Apple Mango Banana        |\n| `append()`        | Apple Mango | Apple Mango Banana / Text |\n| `prepend()`       | Apple Mango | Orange Apple Mango        |\n| `removeChild()`   | Apple Mango | Mango                     |\n| `remove()`        | Apple Mango | (Entire ul removed)       |\n| `replaceChild()`  | Apple Mango | Banana Mango              |\n| `replaceWith()`   | Apple Mango | Hello Mango               |\n| `cloneNode(true)` | Apple Mango | Apple Mango + Copy        |\n| `insertBefore()`  | Apple Mango | Apple Orange Mango        |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MIa_PKqHxjnQEJ1qALJDg",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 35142.39645161454,
      "y": 24855.966689131856,
      "width": 1280.352884928383,
      "height": 604.8032633463517,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGf",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 953798683,
      "version": 133,
      "versionNonce": 1845488085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785042163084,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1PJTOqiuPKM81Ei-eT4AG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 33730.15683013424,
      "y": 25647.80691033673,
      "width": 3138.321044921875,
      "height": 1050,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9775fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 250951829,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 1659631573,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785042237934,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Method                 | Syntax                                        | Kya Karta Hai                                                        | Position       | Return       | Example                                              |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `appendChild()`        | `parent.appendChild(child)`                   | Child ko **last** me add karta hai                                   | Last           | Added Node   | `ul.appendChild(li)`                                 |\n\n| `append()`             | `parent.append(child, \"Text\")`                | Last me add karta hai, text aur multiple items bhi add kar sakta hai | Last           | `undefined`  | `div.append(p, \"Hello\")`                             |\n\n| `prepend()`            | `parent.prepend(child)`                       | Child ko **first** me add karta hai                                  | First          | `undefined`  | `ul.prepend(li)`                                     |\n\n| `removeChild()`        | `parent.removeChild(child)`                   | Parent ke andar se specific child remove karta hai                   | Remove         | Removed Node | `ul.removeChild(li)`                                 |\n\n| `remove()`             | `element.remove()`                            | Element khud ko DOM se hata deta hai                                 | Remove         | `undefined`  | `div.remove()`                                       |\n\n| `replaceChild()`       | `parent.replaceChild(newChild, oldChild)`     | Purane child ki jagah naya child lagata hai                          | Replace        | Removed Node | `ul.replaceChild(newLi, oldLi)`                      |\n\n| `replaceWith()`        | `element.replaceWith(newElement)`             | Element khud ko replace kar deta hai                                 | Replace        | `undefined`  | `li.replaceWith(h1)`                                 |\n\n\n| `cloneNode(true)`      | `element.cloneNode(true)`                     | Element ki deep copy banata hai (children ke sath)                   | Copy           | New Node     | `div.cloneNode(true)`                                |\n\n| `cloneNode(false)`     | `element.cloneNode(false)`                    | Sirf element copy karta hai, children nahi                           | Copy           | New Node     | `div.cloneNode(false)`                               |\n\n| `insertBefore()`       | `parent.insertBefore(newNode, referenceNode)` | Kisi element se pehle insert karta hai                               | Before         | Added Node   | `ul.insertBefore(li, ul.children[1])`                |\n\n| `before()`             | `element.before(node)`                        | Element ke **bahar**, usse pehle insert karta hai                    | Outside Before | `undefined`  | `p.before(hr)`                                       |\n\n\n| `after()`              | `element.after(node)`                         | Element ke **bahar**, uske baad insert karta hai                     | Outside After  | `undefined`  | `p.after(hr)`                                        |\n\n| `insertAdjacentHTML()` | `element.insertAdjacentHTML(position, html)`  | HTML string ko specific position par insert karta hai                | 4 Positions    | `undefined`  | `div.insertAdjacentHTML(\"beforeend\",\"<p>Hello</p>\")` |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Method                 | Syntax                                        | Kya Karta Hai                                                        | Position       | Return       | Example                                              |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `appendChild()`        | `parent.appendChild(child)`                   | Child ko **last** me add karta hai                                   | Last           | Added Node   | `ul.appendChild(li)`                                 |\n\n| `append()`             | `parent.append(child, \"Text\")`                | Last me add karta hai, text aur multiple items bhi add kar sakta hai | Last           | `undefined`  | `div.append(p, \"Hello\")`                             |\n\n| `prepend()`            | `parent.prepend(child)`                       | Child ko **first** me add karta hai                                  | First          | `undefined`  | `ul.prepend(li)`                                     |\n\n| `removeChild()`        | `parent.removeChild(child)`                   | Parent ke andar se specific child remove karta hai                   | Remove         | Removed Node | `ul.removeChild(li)`                                 |\n\n| `remove()`             | `element.remove()`                            | Element khud ko DOM se hata deta hai                                 | Remove         | `undefined`  | `div.remove()`                                       |\n\n| `replaceChild()`       | `parent.replaceChild(newChild, oldChild)`     | Purane child ki jagah naya child lagata hai                          | Replace        | Removed Node | `ul.replaceChild(newLi, oldLi)`                      |\n\n| `replaceWith()`        | `element.replaceWith(newElement)`             | Element khud ko replace kar deta hai                                 | Replace        | `undefined`  | `li.replaceWith(h1)`                                 |\n\n\n| `cloneNode(true)`      | `element.cloneNode(true)`                     | Element ki deep copy banata hai (children ke sath)                   | Copy           | New Node     | `div.cloneNode(true)`                                |\n\n| `cloneNode(false)`     | `element.cloneNode(false)`                    | Sirf element copy karta hai, children nahi                           | Copy           | New Node     | `div.cloneNode(false)`                               |\n\n| `insertBefore()`       | `parent.insertBefore(newNode, referenceNode)` | Kisi element se pehle insert karta hai                               | Before         | Added Node   | `ul.insertBefore(li, ul.children[1])`                |\n\n| `before()`             | `element.before(node)`                        | Element ke **bahar**, usse pehle insert karta hai                    | Outside Before | `undefined`  | `p.before(hr)`                                       |\n\n\n| `after()`              | `element.after(node)`                         | Element ke **bahar**, uske baad insert karta hai                     | Outside After  | `undefined`  | `p.after(hr)`                                        |\n\n| `insertAdjacentHTML()` | `element.insertAdjacentHTML(position, html)`  | HTML string ko specific position par insert karta hai                | 4 Positions    | `undefined`  | `div.insertAdjacentHTML(\"beforeend\",\"<p>Hello</p>\")` |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
