      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Opps :  Oriented programming langauga = it is bascially the programming apprach that make resuable sofware ,\n\nin this appraoch eveything just reveolves around classes and obejcts okay\n\n\nabb isme object ke andar aapp == data and mehtods dono ko rakh sakte ho :\n\n\n\n",
