    {
      "id": "g26fkerBbounhLeidC4w8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34078.48022891789,
      "y": 643.1203978351318,
      "width": 1339.859130859375,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1304111803,
      "version": 820,
      "versionNonce": 282114581,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785237698979,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1> COde resusablitlity -> agar opps use na kre toh dikkat hogi appkko ke har object ke liye appkko uska mehtod dobara dena ohoga\n\nbut in OPPS you just create and object now you can crate multiple object with same classs\n\n\n2> Organization -> yeh apke code ko basically organise karta hai in such a wayy that you are having your data and mehod in same obejct\n\n\n3> security : it provides a lot more security than others are it has private members in it that makes your code soo much secure\n\n4> Scalability : now you can add as many  classes as you want , as many object as you want .\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1> COde resusablitlity -> agar opps use na kre toh dikkat hogi appkko ke har object ke liye appkko uska mehtod dobara dena ohoga\n\nbut in OPPS you just create and object now you can crate multiple object with same classs\n\n\n2> Organization -> yeh apke code ko basically organise karta hai in such a wayy that you are having your data and mehod in same obejct\n\n\n3> security : it provides a lot more security than others are it has private members in it that makes your code soo much secure\n\n4> Scalability : now you can add as many  classes as you want , as many object as you want .\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RptiszdU56K635v1bfUr7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34060.84420675898,
      "y": 1000.2511983433174,
      "width": 908.9594116210938,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1520561755,
      "version": 871,
      "versionNonce": 775420181,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785238177717,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After this there comes POOPS : procedural object oriented preogramming system ->\n\nisme kya cheez add kari gyi \n\nas you know that object are the protype of another object .\n\nin this what is the thing that developrs solved like :\n\n\nwhy to have this rigid syntax of classes -> just replace that , then we can  do things like :: \n\nnow we have more dynamic object and can be changed at runtime .\n\n\nADV :;\n1. Dynamic object and can changes the things at runtime ,\n2. it ignore the rigid class syntacx \n\n\nDis ::\n\neveryone is not familier with the prototypes mechanisms .\n\ndebuging prototype chain is not soo easy .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After this there comes POOPS : procedural object oriented preogramming system ->\n\nisme kya cheez add kari gyi \n\nas you know that object are the protype of another object .\n\nin this what is the thing that developrs solved like :\n\n\nwhy to have this rigid syntax of classes -> just replace that , then we can  do things like :: \n\nnow we have more dynamic object and can be changed at runtime .\n\n\nADV :;\n1. Dynamic object and can changes the things at runtime ,\n2. it ignore the rigid class syntacx \n\n\nDis ::\n\neveryone is not familier with the prototypes mechanisms .\n\ndebuging prototype chain is not soo easy .",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OOdjl8CBKNWk0YwtDxd-y",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 34017.856137846036,
      "y": 296.81515263586084,
