      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "now see what is the problem in OPBS procedural langiages in this you cannot resuse the code again and again there is no such struture or you can say \n\nno such things soo code is too much repetative in nature .\n\nso develops thik off like kaise hoga agar ham ek aise blueprint tiyar kare jisse ham usko jab chahe jitni barr chahye use kar sake .\n\n\nCLass is the blueprint in which you decide the properties and vakues that obejct will have during creation .\n\n\nClasses {\n\n\n}\n\ncosnt a=new a(\"a\",21)\na.call()    ",
      "fontSize": 28,
