      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "it is the running instance of the class ->>> okay , next what now ab object appka independent memory mei hota hai .\n\nhar obejct ki aponi ek memopry hoti hai .\n\nbut object jis classs ke method ko use krega woh ek common memory mei hota hai and har obejct ke sath jab methods attach hote hai \n\ntoh woh same memory ko use krta hai na ki methods ke liye new memory create krte hai ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "it is the running instance of the class ->>> okay , next what now ab object appka independent memory mei hota hai .\n\nhar obejct ki aponi ek memopry hoti hai .\n\nbut object jis classs ke method ko use krega woh ek common memory mei hota hai and har obejct ke sath jab methods attach hote hai \n\ntoh woh same memory ko use krta hai na ki methods ke liye new memory create krte hai ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
