      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785241511913,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Object**                         | **Instance**                                       |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| Object ek real entity hai.         | Instance wahi object hai jo kisi class se bana ho. |\n| Focus object par hota hai.         | Focus class ke relation par hota hai.              |\n| Answer deta hai: **\"Ye kya hai?\"** | Answer deta hai: **\"Ye kis class ka hai?\"**        |\n| Example: `bmw` ek object hai.      | `bmw` Car class ka instance hai.                   |\n",
      "fontSize": 41.42881121776514,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Object**                         | **Instance**                                       |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| Object ek real entity hai.         | Instance wahi object hai jo kisi class se bana ho. |\n| Focus object par hota hai.         | Focus class ke relation par hota hai.              |\n| Answer deta hai: **\"Ye kya hai?\"** | Answer deta hai: **\"Ye kis class ka hai?\"**        |\n| Example: `bmw` ek object hai.      | `bmw` Car class ka instance hai.                   |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
