      "text": "           class Student\n                 │\n              new Student()\n                 │\n                 ▼\n      Heap\n   +------------------+\n   | name = \"Amar\"    |  ← Object\n   +------------------+\n           ▲\n           │\n      s1 (Reference Variable)\n\nYe object hi Student class ka Instance hai.",
