      "seed": 690295547,
      "version": 100,
      "versionNonce": 112772955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785250704186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Constructor helps in:\n♻️ Reusability – Ek hi class se multiple objects bana sakte ho, sirf alag values pass karke.\n🔄 Flexibility – Har object ko different data (arguments) ke saath initialize kar sakte ho.\n📂 Code Organization – Object initialization ka sara logic ek hi jagah (constructor) mein rehta hai,\nisse code clean aur maintainable banta hai.\n⚡ Automatic Initialization – Object create hote hi uski properties automatically initialize ho jaati\nhain.\n❌ Reduces Code Duplication – Har object ke liye baar-baar properties manually assign nahi karni\npadti.",
      "fontSize": 35.08161206620298,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Constructor helps in:\n♻️ Reusability – Ek hi class se multiple objects bana sakte ho, sirf alag values pass karke.\n🔄 Flexibility – Har object ko different data (arguments) ke saath initialize kar sakte ho.\n📂 Code Organization – Object initialization ka sara logic ek hi jagah (constructor) mein rehta hai, isse code clean aur maintainable banta hai.\n⚡ Automatic Initialization – Object create hote hi uski properties automatically initialize ho jaati hain.\n❌ Reduces Code Duplication – Har object ke liye baar-baar properties manually assign nahi karni padti.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
