      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| `this`                                                    | Local Variable                                      |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Current object ko represent karta hai                     | Sirf current function ke andar exist karti hai      |\n| Object ki properties access karta hai                     | Temporary values store karti hai                    |\n| Function call ke hisaab se decide hota hai                | Function execute hote hi create hoti hai            |\n| Function khatam hone ke baad bhi object me data rehta hai | Function khatam hote hi destroy ho jati hai         |\n| Object ke data ko modify karta hai                        | Sirf calculation ya temporary work ke liye hoti hai |\n| `this.name` object ki property hai                        | `let name` local variable hai                       |\n| Memory object ke saath linked hoti hai                    | Memory sirf execution context me hoti hai           |\n",
      "fontSize": 27.72211521242079,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| `this`                                                    | Local Variable                                      |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| Current object ko represent karta hai                     | Sirf current function ke andar exist karti hai      |\n| Object ki properties access karta hai                     | Temporary values store karti hai                    |\n| Function call ke hisaab se decide hota hai                | Function execute hote hi create hoti hai            |\n| Function khatam hone ke baad bhi object me data rehta hai | Function khatam hote hi destroy ho jati hai         |\n| Object ke data ko modify karta hai                        | Sirf calculation ya temporary work ke liye hoti hai |\n| `this.name` object ki property hai                        | `let name` local variable hai                       |\n| Memory object ke saath linked hoti hai                    | Memory sirf execution context me hoti hai           |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "phnFhVj8dUADoZH7jGrF-",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 43331.08781372114,
      "y": -358.0110300443282,
      "width": 1682.052417365463,
