    {
      "id": "y_3y8Uw7Kk3mEeaJV3UsG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43617.65181413071,
      "y": 82.21790978736573,
      "width": 1009.6590932850976,
      "height": 417.19637516984125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bI2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19764781,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 1232562477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785332383604,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bahut log this.name aur let name ko same samajhte hain, lekin dono completely different hain.\n\nLocal variable sirf function ke andar temporary hoti hai.\n\nJab function finish hota hai, local variable destroy ho jati hai.\n\nLekin this.name object ki property hoti hai.\n\nObject jab tak memory me hai, property bhi rahegi.\n\nSimple words me:\n\nLocal Variable → Temporary Data\n\nthis.property → Permanent Object Data",
      "fontSize": 22.25047334239153,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bahut log this.name aur let name ko same samajhte hain, lekin dono completely different hain.\n\nLocal variable sirf function ke andar temporary hoti hai.\n\nJab function finish hota hai, local variable destroy ho jati hai.\n\nLekin this.name object ki property hoti hai.\n\nObject jab tak memory me hai, property bhi rahegi.\n\nSimple words me:\n\nLocal Variable → Temporary Data\n\nthis.property → Permanent Object Data",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DNIRO6hitXHCeUyUjvlpr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 43413.18070947675,
      "y": 594.4309247805028,
      "width": 1678.5090291848403,
      "height": 321.696088065357,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bI3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1022289187,
      "version": 138,
      "versionNonce": 526849805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785332353821,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Arrow Function                                           | Normal Function                                             |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Apna `this` nahi banata                                  | Apna `this` banata hai                                      |\n| Parent scope ka `this` use karta hai                     | Call hone ke time `this` decide hota hai                    |\n| Lexical `this` hota hai                                  | Dynamic `this` hota hai                                     |\n| `call()`, `apply()`, `bind()` se `this` change nahi hota | `call()`, `apply()`, `bind()` se `this` change ho sakta hai |\n| Event handlers me kabhi-kabhi unexpected ho sakta hai    | Event handlers me element ko refer karta hai                |\n| Mostly callbacks me useful                               | General methods ke liye preferred                           |\n",
      "fontSize": 28.595207828031725,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Arrow Function                                           | Normal Function                                             |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Apna `this` nahi banata                                  | Apna `this` banata hai                                      |\n| Parent scope ka `this` use karta hai                     | Call hone ke time `this` decide hota hai                    |\n| Lexical `this` hota hai                                  | Dynamic `this` hota hai                                     |\n| `call()`, `apply()`, `bind()` se `this` change nahi hota | `call()`, `apply()`, `bind()` se `this` change ho sakta hai |\n| Event handlers me kabhi-kabhi unexpected ho sakta hai    | Event handlers me element ko refer karta hai                |\n| Mostly callbacks me useful                               | General methods ke liye preferred                           |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
