      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 420626379,
      "version": 1405,
      "versionNonce": 1774739685,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785494955581,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prototype tuhada ki hai :: and kidda ahh cheez ne PROblems solve kar ditiya sigiya itho diya okay ->>>>>\n \nPehele code likhdde si -> and agar same code bar bar likhna pe reha hai likke in case of objects , fuctions , pass karna penda si \n\nta sra code dobara likho ya dobara fucntion de andar introduce krdo \n\n\nUss time developes ne socha ke koi aisa common obejct create kar sake jisse ham multiple objehct ko usko de sakte hai and woh \n\nsiraf ek jagah hi rahega and usko jo bhi use krna chahta hai uska refercne lekar use kar sakta hai >>>>\n\n\n1> jisse code duplication kam ho jati hai \n\n2> code organised in a way such that you can understadn it easily \n\n3> performance better ho gayi hai \n\n\n\nPROTOTYPE : it is a common obejct where your default constucotr is created with its having its common methds so rthatr\n\nyour objects can initilize in it with its refercne pointing to the shared obejct .\n\n\nJaiose hi fucntion create karte ho woh appki ek property create kr deta hai usko kehte hai protoype ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prototype tuhada ki hai :: and kidda ahh cheez ne PROblems solve kar ditiya sigiya itho diya okay ->>>>>\n \nPehele code likhdde si -> and agar same code bar bar likhna pe reha hai likke in case of objects , fuctions , pass karna penda si \n\nta sra code dobara likho ya dobara fucntion de andar introduce krdo \n\n\nUss time developes ne socha ke koi aisa common obejct create kar sake jisse ham multiple objehct ko usko de sakte hai and woh \n\nsiraf ek jagah hi rahega and usko jo bhi use krna chahta hai uska refercne lekar use kar sakta hai >>>>\n\n\n1> jisse code duplication kam ho jati hai \n\n2> code organised in a way such that you can understadn it easily \n\n3> performance better ho gayi hai \n\n\n\nPROTOTYPE : it is a common obejct where your default constucotr is created with its having its common methds so rthatr\n\nyour objects can initilize in it with its refercne pointing to the shared obejct .\n\n\nJaiose hi fucntion create karte ho woh appki ek property create kr deta hai usko kehte hai protoype ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
