      "text": "Prototype Object ek special object hota hai jo automatically create hota hai jab hum Constructor Function ya Class create karte hain. JavaScript \nuske saath ek empty Prototype Object banati hai jisme by default constructor property hoti hai. Hum is Prototype Object me shared methods add kar \nsakte hain, jise us constructor se bane saare objects share karte hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prototype Object ek special object hota hai jo automatically create hota hai jab hum Constructor Function ya Class create karte hain. JavaScript \nuske saath ek empty Prototype Object banati hai jisme by default constructor property hoti hai. Hum is Prototype Object me shared methods add kar \nsakte hain, jise us constructor se bane saare objects share karte hain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
