      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Constructor Function/Class create hua\n✅ Prototype Object automatically create hua.\nPrototype Object\n✅ By default constructor property hoti hai.\n✅ Shared methods store karta hai.\nprototype\n✅ Constructor Function/Class ki property hai.\n✅ Prototype Object ka reference hold karti hai.\n__proto__\n✅ Har object ki hidden property hai.\n✅ Object ko uske Prototype Object se link karti hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Constructor Function/Class create hua\n✅ Prototype Object automatically create hua.\nPrototype Object\n✅ By default constructor property hoti hai.\n✅ Shared methods store karta hai.\nprototype\n✅ Constructor Function/Class ki property hai.\n✅ Prototype Object ka reference hold karti hai.\n__proto__\n✅ Har object ki hidden property hai.\n✅ Object ko uske Prototype Object se link karti hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
