      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785505104791,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "kyu krte hai resoptre kya chaakr hai iska \n\n\nbark() → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ eat() → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ instanceof → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ Inheritance → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ constructor reference sahi rakhna ho → Restore zaruri hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "kyu krte hai resoptre kya chaakr hai iska \n\n\nbark() → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ eat() → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ instanceof → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ Inheritance → Restore ki zarurat nahi.\n✅ constructor reference sahi rakhna ho → Restore zaruri hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
