      "seed": 1026474091,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 2025868453,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785505216999,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "✅ Haan, exactly. Bas wording thodi aur accurate honi chahiye.\n\nTum keh sakte ho:\n\nAgar hame constructor property par depend karna hai (ya kisi specific constructor ko\nidentify karna hai), tab Dog.prototype.constructor = Dog se constructor reference\nrestore karte hain.",
      "fontSize": 26.67857142857123,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "✅ Haan, exactly. Bas wording thodi aur accurate honi chahiye.\n\nTum keh sakte ho:\n\nAgar hame constructor property par depend karna hai (ya kisi specific constructor ko identify karna hai), tab Dog.prototype.constructor = Dog se constructor reference restore karte hain.",
