      "text": "DOG Prototype = obejct.crate(animal.prototype)\n\niska matalb woh point krega animal ko and replce krdega dog wale ko \n ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DOG Prototype = obejct.crate(animal.prototype)\n\niska matalb woh point krega animal ko and replce krdega dog wale ko \n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vI9a3HUVsXnNzQaJT31UD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47447.74060027484,
      "y": -6169.437709011048,
      "width": 1211.037498474121,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1522711301,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 2037035947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785505603196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Constructor dunciton :: A Constructor Function is a normal JavaScript function that is\nused with the new keyword to create and initialize objects. It sets up object\nproperties using this, and each call with new creates a new object. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Constructor dunciton :: A Constructor Function is a normal JavaScript function that is used with the new keyword to create and initialize objects. It sets up object properties using this, and each call with new creates a new object. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_qhm0HcrZQtIemBwN1BVL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47448.520446466246,
      "y": -5966.694789089173,
      "width": 1377.1793212890625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 357087083,
      "version": 359,
      "versionNonce": 1299239333,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785505794471,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "it is same like class ka realtion hai Constructor ke sath waise hi consftutcotr function ka hota hai ,\n\nyeh bhi new dekhta hai and object new return krta hai \n\nthis -> current object ke sath properties attach karke obejct retuin krta hai same \n\n\nBASS CLASS ek syntatic sugar hai protype se hi sara kaam hota hai behind the scene\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "it is same like class ka realtion hai Constructor ke sath waise hi consftutcotr function ka hota hai ,\n\nyeh bhi new dekhta hai and object new return krta hai \n\nthis -> current object ke sath properties attach karke obejct retuin krta hai same \n\n\nBASS CLASS ek syntatic sugar hai protype se hi sara kaam hota hai behind the scene\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
