      "text": "Normal Function → Work karta hai.\nConstructor Function → Object banata hai.\nnew keyword → Constructor Function ko special behavior deta hai (new object create karta hai,\nprototype link karta hai, this set karta hai, aur object return karta h",
      "fontSize": 28,
