      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Normal Function → Work karta hai.\nConstructor Function → Object banata hai.\nnew keyword → Constructor Function ko special behavior deta hai (new object create karta hai, prototype link karta hai, this set karta hai, aur object return karta h",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
