      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785506314535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why not inside constructor?\n\nInside constructor\n\nthis.study = function(){}\n\nHar object ke saath naya function.\n\nPrototype\n\nStudent.prototype.study = function(){}\n\nSirf ek function.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why not inside constructor?\n\nInside constructor\n\nthis.study = function(){}\n\nHar object ke saath naya function.\n\nPrototype\n\nStudent.prototype.study = function(){}\n\nSirf ek function.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
