      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785506339118,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Properties (unique data) → Object (this.name, this.age)\nMethods (shared behavior) → Prototype\n(Student.prototype.study)\n\nIsi wajah se Adding Methods to Prototype JavaScript me\nimportant hai—ye memory bachata hai, duplicate functions avoid\nkarta hai, aur saare objects ek hi method ko share karte hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Properties (unique data) → Object (this.name, this.age)\nMethods (shared behavior) → Prototype (Student.prototype.study)\n\nIsi wajah se Adding Methods to Prototype JavaScript me important hai—ye memory bachata hai, duplicate functions avoid karta hai, aur saare objects ek hi method ko share karte hain.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
