      "text": "🟢 Group 12: Object Built-in Methods ⭐⭐⭐⭐\nObject.create()\nObject.assign()\nObject.freeze()\nObject.seal()\nObject.keys()\nObject.values()\nObject.entries()\nObject.hasOwn()",
