    {
      "id": "dB45kIgb5DGWmrcFpcX-l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 49473.53864693184,
      "y": -1528.9172038615147,
      "width": 957.820434570313,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bMG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1180425451,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 2067712843,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785510854257,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Built-in methods woh predefined methods hote hain jo JavaScript\nhume by default provide karti hai. Inhe hume khud likhne ki zarurat\nnahi hoti. Hum in methods ko directly use karke common tasks (jaise\nobject create karna, copy karna, keys nikalna, etc.) perform kar sakte\nhain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Built-in methods woh predefined methods hote hain jo JavaScript hume by default provide karti hai. Inhe hume khud likhne ki zarurat nahi hoti. Hum in methods ko directly use karke common tasks (jaise object create karna, copy karna, keys nikalna, etc.) perform kar sakte hain.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yn9zgxOm4MyrC06d38p4r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48395.89519905586,
      "y": -1057.9015281158854,
      "width": 976.9201660156245,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bMH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228912549,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 2092883083,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785510916156,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Object.create()\n\nObject.create() ek naya object banata hai aur jo object hum argument\nme pass karte hain, usse naye object ka prototype link kar deta hai. Is\nwajah se naya object parent object ki properties aur methods ko\nprototype chain ke through access kar sakta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Object.create()\n\nObject.create() ek naya object banata hai aur jo object hum argument me pass karte hain, usse naye object ka prototype link kar deta hai. Is wajah se naya object parent object ki properties aur methods ko prototype chain ke through access kar sakta hai.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q7Iw0a2HNy1qRWJcZFHPH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48397.33541512032,
      "y": -781.4781119781901,
      "width": 1052.6317138671875,
      "height": 385,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bMI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1089506245,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 769226475,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785511459408,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "const parent = {};\n\nconst dog = Object.create(parent);\n\n👉 Object Literal ka example hai.\n\nYahan:\n\nparent ek object literal hai ({} se bana hai).\nIska apna koi prototype property nahi hota jaise functions ka hota hai.\nIsliye Object.create(parent) sirf dog ka [[Prototype]] parent bana deta hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "const parent = {};\n\nconst dog = Object.create(parent);\n\n👉 Object Literal ka example hai.\n\nYahan:\n\nparent ek object literal hai ({} se bana hai).\nIska apna koi prototype property nahi hota jaise functions ka hota hai.\nIsliye Object.create(parent) sirf dog ka [[Prototype]] parent bana deta hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pgtgzUGA7A2urtmpWBgWU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48378.44656,
      "y": -272.5892371206753,
      "width": 1027.7649536132812,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bMJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1025338213,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 360113931,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785511541340,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Object.assign() ek ya ek se zyada source objects ki own properties ko\ntarget object me copy karta hai. Ye object merge ya shallow copy banane\nke liye use hota hai.\n\nSyntax\nObject.assign(target, source1, source2, ...)\nTarget → Jis object me data copy hoga.\nSource → Jis object se data copy hoga.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Object.assign() ek ya ek se zyada source objects ki own properties ko target object me copy karta hai. Ye object merge ya shallow copy banane ke liye use hota hai.\n\nSyntax\nObject.assign(target, source1, source2, ...)\nTarget → Jis object me data copy hoga.\nSource → Jis object se data copy hoga.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eqbsfKo67pJzWvzaTG_iD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48421.77956795235,
      "y": 144.63332757659055,
      "width": 590.4918212890625,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bMK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 32170059,
      "version": 10,
      "versionNonce": 66782507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785511561463,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "const user = { name: \"Amar\" };\nconst info = { age: 24 };\n\nconst result = Object.assign({}, user, info);\n\nconsole.log(result);",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "const user = { name: \"Amar\" };\nconst info = { age: 24 };\n\nconst result = Object.assign({}, user, info);\n\nconsole.log(result);",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
