      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🟢 Object.seal()\nTheory\n\nObject.seal() object ko partially lock karta hai.\n\nSeal ke baad:\n\n❌ New property add nahi kar sakte.\n❌ Existing property delete nahi kar sakte.\n✅ Existing property ki value change kar sakte hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🟢 Object.seal()\nTheory\n\nObject.seal() object ko partially lock karta hai.\n\nSeal ke baad:\n\n❌ New property add nahi kar sakte.\n❌ Existing property delete nahi kar sakte.\n✅ Existing property ki value change kar sakte hain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
