      "updated": 1785575085323,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Encapsulation**                                                                 | **Data Hiding**                                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| Data (properties) aur methods ko **ek single unit (Class)** mein bind/wrap karna. | Data ko **direct access se hide/protect** karna.   \n                             |\n\n| Ye ek **OOP principle/mechanism** hai.                                            | Ye **Encapsulation ka objective/benefit** hai.                                  |\n\n\n| Focus → **Code organization + access control**                                    | Focus → **Security of data**                                           \n\n         |\n| Class banakar achieve hota hai.                                                   | Private fields (`#`) aur controlled access (Getter/Setter) se achieve hota hai. |\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Encapsulation**                                                                 | **Data Hiding**                                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n\n| Data (properties) aur methods ko **ek single unit (Class)** mein bind/wrap karna. | Data ko **direct access se hide/protect** karna.   \n                             |\n\n| Ye ek **OOP principle/mechanism** hai.                                            | Ye **Encapsulation ka objective/benefit** hai.                                  |\n\n\n| Focus → **Code organization + access control**                                    | Focus → **Security of data**                                           \n\n         |\n| Class banakar achieve hota hai.                                                   | Private fields (`#`) aur controlled access (Getter/Setter) se achieve hota hai. |\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
