      "text": "Outside World\n\n        ❌ count\n\n           |\n           v\n\n+-------------------------+\n| Counter()               |\n|                         |\n| count = 0   ← Private   |\n|                         |\n| increment()  ✅         |\n| getCount()   ✅         |\n+-------------------------+",
