    {
      "id": "K5yhJOpuXv0gz0Em76fZ-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 53292.714842,
      "y": 2294.5016053927234,
      "width": 1010.1555786132812,
      "height": 910,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bN5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 783942629,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1938450789,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785577469362,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. _name (Underscore) ❌ Not Private\nclass Person {\n  constructor(name) {\n    this._name = name;\n  }\n}\n\nconst p = new Person(\"Amar\");\n\nconsole.log(p._name); // ✅ Amar\np._name = \"Rahul\";    // ✅ Change ho gaya\n_ ka matlab kya hai?\n\n_ sirf ek naming convention hai.\n\nDeveloper dusre developers ko signal deta hai:\n\n\"Please is variable ko directly access mat karo. Ye internal use ke liye hai.\"\n\nJavaScript is rule ko enforce nahi karti.\n\nIsliye:\n\n✅ Access kar sakte ho.\n✅ Update kar sakte ho.\n❌ Private nahi hai.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. _name (Underscore) ❌ Not Private\nclass Person {\n  constructor(name) {\n    this._name = name;\n  }\n}\n\nconst p = new Person(\"Amar\");\n\nconsole.log(p._name); // ✅ Amar\np._name = \"Rahul\";    // ✅ Change ho gaya\n_ ka matlab kya hai?\n\n_ sirf ek naming convention hai.\n\nDeveloper dusre developers ko signal deta hai:\n\n\"Please is variable ko directly access mat karo. Ye internal use ke liye hai.\"\n\nJavaScript is rule ko enforce nahi karti.\n\nIsliye:\n\n✅ Access kar sakte ho.\n✅ Update kar sakte ho.\n❌ Private nahi hai.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
