      "seed": 1465440101,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1804224069,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785577524624,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| `_name`                       | `#name`                         |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n\n| Sirf naming convention        | Real private field              |\n\n| Access ho sakta hai           | Access nahi ho sakta            |\n\n| Update ho sakta hai           | Sirf class ke andar update hoga |\n\n| JavaScript enforce nahi karti | JavaScript enforce karti hai    |\n",
      "fontSize": 38.4116908482143,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| `_name`                       | `#name`                         |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n\n| Sirf naming convention        | Real private field              |\n\n| Access ho sakta hai           | Access nahi ho sakta            |\n\n| Update ho sakta hai           | Sirf class ke andar update hoga |\n\n| JavaScript enforce nahi karti | JavaScript enforce karti hai    |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xa9G6uv61FPaY2XkkfAlf",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 53402.437056031864,
      "y": 3350.057099400967,
      "width": 1344.9872589111328,
      "height": 545.2691078186035,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bN9",
