    {
      "id": "7jZSPZYhnYw5_frSL9vuq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 53320.79644056861,
      "y": 4045.6298952688876,
      "width": 1545.8731689453125,
      "height": 3570,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#099268",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1051092203,
      "version": 103,
      "versionNonce": 1530155147,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785577699073,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Getter setter tihada pehele a gay si before your # feilds ::\n\n\n\n# Getter & Setter (Hinglish)\n\n## Getter\n\n**Getter** ek special method hota hai jo object ki property ko **read/access** karne ke liye use hota hai.\n\nAgar property private (`#`) hai, to uski value directly access nahi kar sakte. Getter us value ko safely return\nkarta hai.\n\n```javascript\nclass Person {\n  #name = \"Amar\";\n\n  get name() {\n    return this.#name;\n  }\n}\n\nconst p = new Person();\n\nconsole.log(p.name); // Getter automatically call hoga\n```\n\n### Getter ka Purpose\n\n* Private data ko read/access karna.\n* Computed value return karna.\n* Read-only property banana.\n\n---\n\n## Setter\n\n**Setter** ek special method hota hai jo property ki value ko **set ya update** karne ke liye use hota hai.\n\nSetter ke andar validation bhi laga sakte hain.\n\n```javascript\nclass Person {\n  #name = \"\";\n\n  set name(value) {\n    this.#name = value;\n  }\n}\n\nconst p = new Person();\n\np.name = \"Rahul\"; // Setter automatically call hoga\n```\n\n### Setter ka Purpose\n\n* Private data update karna.\n* Validation lagana.\n* Invalid data ko rokna.\n\nExample:\n\n```javascript\nset name(value) {\n  if (value.length < 3) {\n    console.log(\"Name too short\");\n    return;\n  }\n\n  this.#name = value;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# Interview Definition\n\n**Getter** is a special method used to read or access a property's value.\n\n**Setter** is a special method used to set or update a property's value. It is also commonly used to validate\ndata before updating it.\n\n---\n\n# Easy Trick\n\n* **GET = Read / Access**\n* **SET = Write / Update**\n\n```text\nPrivate Data (#name)\n        │\n   Getter (Read)\n        ▲\n        │\nOutside Code\n        │\n        ▼\n   Setter (Update)\n```\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Getter setter tihada pehele a gay si before your # feilds ::\n\n\n\n# Getter & Setter (Hinglish)\n\n## Getter\n\n**Getter** ek special method hota hai jo object ki property ko **read/access** karne ke liye use hota hai.\n\nAgar property private (`#`) hai, to uski value directly access nahi kar sakte. Getter us value ko safely return karta hai.\n\n```javascript\nclass Person {\n  #name = \"Amar\";\n\n  get name() {\n    return this.#name;\n  }\n}\n\nconst p = new Person();\n\nconsole.log(p.name); // Getter automatically call hoga\n```\n\n### Getter ka Purpose\n\n* Private data ko read/access karna.\n* Computed value return karna.\n* Read-only property banana.\n\n---\n\n## Setter\n\n**Setter** ek special method hota hai jo property ki value ko **set ya update** karne ke liye use hota hai.\n\nSetter ke andar validation bhi laga sakte hain.\n\n```javascript\nclass Person {\n  #name = \"\";\n\n  set name(value) {\n    this.#name = value;\n  }\n}\n\nconst p = new Person();\n\np.name = \"Rahul\"; // Setter automatically call hoga\n```\n\n### Setter ka Purpose\n\n* Private data update karna.\n* Validation lagana.\n* Invalid data ko rokna.\n\nExample:\n\n```javascript\nset name(value) {\n  if (value.length < 3) {\n    console.log(\"Name too short\");\n    return;\n  }\n\n  this.#name = value;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# Interview Definition\n\n**Getter** is a special method used to read or access a property's value.\n\n**Setter** is a special method used to set or update a property's value. It is also commonly used to validate data before updating it.\n\n---\n\n# Easy Trick\n\n* **GET = Read / Access**\n* **SET = Write / Update**\n\n```text\nPrivate Data (#name)\n        │\n   Getter (Read)\n        ▲\n        │\nOutside Code\n        │\n        ▼\n   Setter (Update)\n```\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
