      "updated": 1785578851788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "programs ,mai aise practide kro \n\n\n1. Public Property\n        ↓\nProblem:\nDirect Access\n\n2. _name\n        ↓\nOnly Naming Convention\n(Not Real Private)\n\n3. Closure\n        ↓\nOld Way of Data Hiding\n(Private through Lexical Scope)\n\n4. #private\n        ↓\nOfficial / Real Data Hiding\n\n5. Getter\n        ↓\nRead Private Data\n\n6. Setter\n        ↓\nUpdate Private Data + Validation",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "programs ,mai aise practide kro \n\n\n1. Public Property\n        ↓\nProblem:\nDirect Access\n\n2. _name\n        ↓\nOnly Naming Convention\n(Not Real Private)\n\n3. Closure\n        ↓\nOld Way of Data Hiding\n(Private through Lexical Scope)\n\n4. #private\n        ↓\nOfficial / Real Data Hiding\n\n5. Getter\n        ↓\nRead Private Data\n\n6. Setter\n        ↓\nUpdate Private Data + Validation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
