      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Super ()   =\n\njab app child mei extends keyowrd use kr lete ho -> uske badd appko super call akrna hota hai taaki woh parent ke const rcuto ko call karta hai -> jissse appka parent const call ho jata hai \n\njab bhi app child mei constrciotr baante ho and usging this then appkpo parent ka const peghe;e call krna hoga \n\nAGAR appp this ka use karte toh js ussko appne app hi call kr leta hai /",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Super ()   =\n\njab app child mei extends keyowrd use kr lete ho -> uske badd appko super call akrna hota hai taaki woh parent ke const rcuto ko call karta hai -> jissse appka parent const call ho jata hai \n\njab bhi app child mei constrciotr baante ho and usging this then appkpo parent ka const peghe;e call krna hoga \n\nAGAR appp this ka use karte toh js ussko appne app hi call kr leta hai /",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
