      "originalText": "Super matab paernt ka const call krdo basss ,\n\nSuper .method = apremnt ka merthof call kna \n\njab super call ho jata hai uske badd child ka this banta hai  uske abdd hi method bante hai perhele parent cosnt call hoga",
      "autoResize": true,
