    {
      "id": "BiQuc8k0891ZJ7yxFTUuE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58293.360395239884,
      "y": -3655.252016372417,
      "width": 3047.685546875,
      "height": 945,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bNd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1155035237,
      "version": 18,
      "versionNonce": 1070784427,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785594487909,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Definition:\nParent Class woh class hoti hai jisme common properties (data) aur methods (functions) define kiye jaate hain. Is class ko doosri classes inherit karti hain taaki code reuse ho sake.\n\nSimple Hinglish:\n\nParent Class ek main class hoti hai jo apni properties aur methods Child Class ko deti hai.\n\nPurpose:\n\nCommon code ek hi jagah likhna.\nCode duplication kam karna.\nReusability badhana.\nChild classes ko base functionality provide karna.\nChild Class (Derived Class / Sub Class) – Theory\n\nDefinition:\nChild Class woh class hoti hai jo extends keyword ka use karke Parent Class ko inherit karti hai. Iske paas Parent ki properties aur methods bhi hoti hain aur ye apni additional properties aur methods bhi add kar sakti hai.\n\nSimple Hinglish:\n\nChild Class Parent Class ki saari public functionality use kar sakti hai aur apni nayi functionality bhi bana sakti hai.\n\nPurpose:\n\nParent ke code ko reuse karna.\nNaye features add karna.\nZarurat padne par Parent ke methods ko override karna.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Definition:\nParent Class woh class hoti hai jisme common properties (data) aur methods (functions) define kiye jaate hain. Is class ko doosri classes inherit karti hain taaki code reuse ho sake.\n\nSimple Hinglish:\n\nParent Class ek main class hoti hai jo apni properties aur methods Child Class ko deti hai.\n\nPurpose:\n\nCommon code ek hi jagah likhna.\nCode duplication kam karna.\nReusability badhana.\nChild classes ko base functionality provide karna.\nChild Class (Derived Class / Sub Class) – Theory\n\nDefinition:\nChild Class woh class hoti hai jo extends keyword ka use karke Parent Class ko inherit karti hai. Iske paas Parent ki properties aur methods bhi hoti hain aur ye apni additional properties aur methods bhi add kar sakti hai.\n\nSimple Hinglish:\n\nChild Class Parent Class ki saari public functionality use kar sakti hai aur apni nayi functionality bhi bana sakti hai.\n\nPurpose:\n\nParent ke code ko reuse karna.\nNaye features add karna.\nZarurat padne par Parent ke methods ko override karna.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
