      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Method Overriding\n\nDefinition:\nMethod Overriding ka matlab hai parent class ke method ko child class me same name aur same parameters ke saath dobara banana, taaki child apna alag behavior de sake.\n\nRules\nParent aur Child dono me method ka same name hona chahiye.\nParameters bhi generally same hote hain.\nChild ka method Parent ke method ko override kar deta hai.\nAgar child object se method call hoga, to child wala method execute hoga.\nExample (Concept)\nParent:\nstart()\n\nChild:\nstart()\n\nAgar:\n\nconst car = new Car();\ncar.start();\n\nTo Car ka start() chalega, parent ka nahi.\n\n2. Runtime Polymorphism\n\nDefinition:\nRuntime Polymorphism ka matlab hai ki kaunsa method execute hoga, iska decision program run hone ke time hota hai, compile/write karte time nahi.\n\nIsko Method Overriding ke through achieve kiya jata hai.\n\nSimple Meaning\n\nProgram ko sirf itna pata hota hai ki method call hua hai.\n\nRun hone ke baad object dekha jata hai:\n\nAgar object Parent ka hai → Parent method chalega.\nAgar object Child ka hai → Child method chalega.\n\nIsliye ise Runtime Polymorphism kehte hain.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Method Overriding\n\nDefinition:\nMethod Overriding ka matlab hai parent class ke method ko child class me same name aur same parameters ke saath dobara banana, taaki child apna alag behavior de sake.\n\nRules\nParent aur Child dono me method ka same name hona chahiye.\nParameters bhi generally same hote hain.\nChild ka method Parent ke method ko override kar deta hai.\nAgar child object se method call hoga, to child wala method execute hoga.\nExample (Concept)\nParent:\nstart()\n\nChild:\nstart()\n\nAgar:\n\nconst car = new Car();\ncar.start();\n\nTo Car ka start() chalega, parent ka nahi.\n\n2. Runtime Polymorphism\n\nDefinition:\nRuntime Polymorphism ka matlab hai ki kaunsa method execute hoga, iska decision program run hone ke time hota hai, compile/write karte time nahi.\n\nIsko Method Overriding ke through achieve kiya jata hai.\n\nSimple Meaning\n\nProgram ko sirf itna pata hota hai ki method call hua hai.\n\nRun hone ke baad object dekha jata hai:\n\nAgar object Parent ka hai → Parent method chalega.\nAgar object Child ka hai → Child method chalega.\n\nIsliye ise Runtime Polymorphism kehte hain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
