      "seed": 1831075461,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1769712389,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785661078273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "### JavaScript mein Abstraction\n\nJavaScript mein **`abstract`** naam ka koi keyword nahi hota, isliye JavaScript **abstract classes ko directly support nahi karti**.\n\nIske badle hum **aisa environment (setup)** create karte hain jo **abstract class jaisa behavior** provide karta hai.\n\nHum `new.target` ka use karke abstract class ka direct object banne se rok dete hain aur `throw new Error()` ka use karke child class ko required\nmethods implement karne ke liye force karte hain.\n\nIs tarah JavaScript **abstract classes ko simulate (imitate)** karti hai.\n\nSimple line:\n\n> **JavaScript mein `abstract` keyword nahi hota. Hum logic (`new.target` aur `throw new Error()`) ka use karke abstract class jaisa behavior create\nkarte hain, jisse abstraction achieve hoti hai.**\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "### JavaScript mein Abstraction\n\nJavaScript mein **`abstract`** naam ka koi keyword nahi hota, isliye JavaScript **abstract classes ko directly support nahi karti**.\n\nIske badle hum **aisa environment (setup)** create karte hain jo **abstract class jaisa behavior** provide karta hai.\n\nHum `new.target` ka use karke abstract class ka direct object banne se rok dete hain aur `throw new Error()` ka use karke child class ko required methods implement karne ke liye force karte hain.\n\nIs tarah JavaScript **abstract classes ko simulate (imitate)** karti hai.\n\nSimple line:\n\n> **JavaScript mein `abstract` keyword nahi hota. Hum logic (`new.target` aur `throw new Error()`) ka use karke abstract class jaisa behavior create karte hain, jisse abstraction achieve hoti hai.**\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "U8xpGK-GYfgPlZhlhvCJm",
